<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Sagala Bible Version</book>
  <para style="toc1">Ndongwa Nofu kota fyo tsandikwe na</para>
  <para style="toc2">Lukasi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ndongwa Nofu kota fyo tsandikwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUKASI</para>
  <para style="imt">Wulongolo</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu chino cha Ndongwa Nofu kota fyo tsandikwe na Lukasi cho chitabu chimwe mufitabu fitayi lya lilagano lipya fyo finsimulila ndongwa tsa wuvina wa Yesu Chilisito. Chila chitabu chinchemwa Ndongwa Nofu. Fitabu fino fitayi fyandikwe na Matayo, na Maliko, na Lukasi, na Yohana. Lukasi siandiche ndongwa tsa wumi wa Yesu ng'ani, lechelelo andiche ndongwa tseka tso adisile Yesu na vadahitswa vake, hamwe na kwandika ndongwa kufwa na kutsilipuka kwa Yesu. Kaha akandiche chitabu chochinchemwa “Ng'olwa tsa vatumi.” Kuduhuli munu yoyuve yoan'tsela kuta chitabu chino cha Lukasi chandikwe hanili, lechelelo vasomi wolofu vantijila kuta chandikwe myaka 70 kuhuma kuchipulwa kwa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lukasi yo andiche chitabu chino avaga muganga va kusibitali. Hila fyo andiche chitabu chino yinlajila kuta avaga munu yo asomile ndalahela. Lukasi aganaga kulajila finofu ndongwa tsa wumi wa Yesu kwa kwandika ndongwa tso tsahumile ili vanu vanji velewe cho andiche Lukasi 1:1-3. Lukasi siavaga Muyawudi Vakolosai 4:10-14. Kahi andiche kuta na vanu yo sivali Vayawudi van'tsela chila cho andiche. Lulongwa luno lunlajila fyo andiche ntsovelo tsa Vayawudi mu Lukasi 1:8.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ndongwa Nofu tso tsandikwe na Lukasi tsinakota fitabu fya Matayo na Maliko, kwasawuli tsinsimulila ndongwa ntsolofu tso tsingihwana. Mu fitabu ifyo fidatu, Lukasi ansimulila ndongwa ntsolofu tsa kuleleka kwa Yohana Mubatsi. Kahi ahahanitse ndongwa tsa kuhulumila na kwigana mu Lukasi 3:3; 11:4; 17:3-4; 23:34; 24:47 kaha ahahanitse kumusuka Mulungu mu Lukasi 3:21; 5:16; 6:12; 11:1-12; 22:32.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ndongwa tsotsili mu chitabu chino</para>
  <para style="io">Lukasi anlajila chila choandiche muchitabu chake na kuyidadambula mu sula ya 1:1-4</para>
  <para style="io">Kaha an'dadambula kuleleka kwa Yesu na Yesu, na hila Yohana mubatitsi fyo avisile chang'ani hila fyo an'ganika kudita Yesu mu sula ya 1:5; 4:1-18</para>
  <para style="io">Hono hakomi ha Ndongwa nofu tsa Mulungu mu sula ya 4:14; 21:38 Lukasi ankweletsela majetso ga Yesu, kaha ankweletsela mitinuso jo adisile Yesu, hamwe na madahitso.</para>
  <para style="io">Hawudugo wa Musula tsivili tsa wudugo Lukasi ankwandika hila Yesu fyovamusindiche kuwuhigo, kusulubitswa, kufwa, na kutsilipuka kuhuma kwa vanu wovafweye mu sula ya 22:1; 24:1-5.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s">Wulongolo wa chitabu chino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Muvina Tiyofilo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:1">Vanu wolofu vikangitse kwandika ndongwa tsila tso tsikakoliche hagati hetu. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Vakandiche kota fyo vakatulonje vala wo vatsiwene ndongwa itso luhuma hamutalo na vatantsi va Mulungu wo vavikulaga ndongwa itso. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Kwasawuli mbutsanitse finofu ndongwa itso tseka luhuma hamutalo ihyo mbwene na heni ngwandichile heve muvina Tiyofilo chila chinu. <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />Ndisile ihyo ili na heve utsele wumwene wukweli wa ndongwa tsila tso wadahitswe.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuleleka kwa Yohana mubatitsi kunvikulwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Iho Helode hoavaga muntsajila va ku Yudeya, kwavaga na mutawula nambiko yoachemwaga Tsakaliya, va chikundi cha vatawula nambiko va Abiya. Mudala vake litawa lyake achemwaga Elitsabeti, yoavaga ahumye mu lukolo lwa mutawula nambiko yoachemwaga Haluni. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Veka vavili vavaga vidichilwe na Mulungu, na vikalaga kwa kufwata amuli na malajitso geka ga Mutwa Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Nawo sivavaga na vana kwasawuli Elitsabeti avaga mende na veka vavili vavaga vagogolo ndala hela.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Siku yimwe Tsakaliya hoavaga na vayage mu tsamu yawo ya wutawula nambiko mu Nyumba ya Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Vakamuhagulaje Tsakaliya kwa simbi kota hila fyovaditaga ili injile mu Nyumba ya Mulungu afuse wubani. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Luvala lulo hoafusaga wubani lila lilugu lya vanu vavaga vakong'ine hivala vansala.<verse eid="LUK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Mutantsi va kilanga va Mulungu akamuhumilaje mumo mugati, akimaje lubali lwa kwililo lwa hono hakufusila wubani. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Tsakaliya hoavaga kumuwona akakakamaje, akawonaje muloto. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Lechelelo mutantsi va kilanga va Mulungu akamulonjelaje, “Tsakaliya! Uleche kuva na muloto, kwasawuli suko yako yihulikitswe, na mudala vako Elitsabeti akukulelela mwana mukwamitsi, nave ukumutambulila litawa Yohana. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Nave ukuhechelela na kusangalala ndalahela, na vanu wolofu vakusangalala kwasawuli ya kuleleka kwake! <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Akuva munu muvina halutalo ha Mutwa, siakujela ang'we difwayi awu chochive chinya kugatsa, nayo akumemetswa Muhe va Mulungu luhuma kuleleka kwake. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Nayo akuvadita Vaisilaheli wolofu vamupituchile Mutwa Mulungu vawo. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Akulongola halutalo ha Mutwa, akuva na wuvetso na muhe kota Eliya muloli va Mulungu. Akutsigalula numbula tsa vayaya vavahotse vanawo na akuvadita vanu vave chang'ani kumwanuchila Mutwa.” <verse eid="LUK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Tsakaliya akamuputsaje uyo mutantsi va kilanga va Mulungu, “Chinu chachi chochikumela wuhuvilo kwa lulongwa luno? Heni ntsili mugogolo, hihilaga na mudala vangu nayo agogwe.” <verse eid="LUK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Yula mutantsi va kilanga va Mulungu akamulonjelaje kuta, “Heni ntsi Gabuliyeli, yontsimaga halutalo ha Mulungu, numilwe ndonje na heve ndongwa tsino nofu. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Lelo kwasawuli siuwitumbye ndongwa tsino tso ngulonje, ukuva chibubwi, siukuvetsa kulonga mbaka hala ndongwa tsino ho tsikuhumila.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Luvala lulo vanu vala vavaga vangumutsinda Tsakaliya vakiputsaga hila fyo ahafile kuhuma kivala. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Tsakaliya hoavaga kuhuma kivala akalemwaje kulonga, akantsaje kulonga kwa kuvalajila kwa mawoko kwasawuli ali chibubwi, ihyo vakatselaje kuta awene nduntsuchilo mu Nyumba ya Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Siku tsake tsa kukola katsi mu Nyumba ya Mulungu hotsavaga kusila akawuyaje kukaye kwake. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Hotsavaga kulutila siku nunga mudala vake akapataje wubofu, akikalaje aliyena mu nyumba yake kwa chipindi cha myetsi jihanu akalongaje kuta, <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />“Hino ho hila fyo anditye Mutwa, andotsile na kunditila wuwuya.”<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuleleka kwa Yesu fyokwavikulwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Myetsi sita luhuma Elitsabeti ave na wubofu, Mulungu akamutumaje Gabuliyeli mutantsi vake va kilanga abite kumuji gwa Galilaya gogunchemwa Natsaleti, <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />kwa muhintsa yosiamutsele mulume, litawa lyake Maliyamu yoali akwelilwe na Yusufu yoavaga va lukolo lwa Dawudi. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Mutantsi va kilanga va Mulungu akatsaje kwa mudala uyo akamusamusaje kwa kumulonjela kuta, “Unogaje heve yo uditilwe wuwuya na Mulungu, nayo Mutwa alihamwe na heve.” <verse eid="LUK 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Maliyamu hoavaga kuhulika ndongwa itso akahotsaje ndalahela, akiputsaje mu numbula yake kuta samuso yino yinya ndawuli. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Lechelelo mutantsi va kilanga va Mulungu akamulonjelaje, “Maliyamu uleche kuva na muloto, kwasawuli Mulungu akuditye wuwuya. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Ukupata wubofu, na ukulela mwana mukwamitsi, na heve ukumutambulila litawa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Mwana uyo akuva munu muvina, nayo akuchemwa Mwana va Mulungu va Kuchanya Ndalahela. Mutwa Mulungu akumudita ave Muntsajila kota Dawudi dada vake. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Nayo akuva muntsajila va lulelo lwa Yakobo siku tseka na wuntsajila wake siwukuva na wudugo.” <verse eid="LUK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Maliyamu akamulonjelaje yula mutantsi va kilanga va Mulungu, “Lukuva ndawuli lulongwa ulo kuno heni sintsimutsele mulume?” <verse eid="LUK 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Mutantsi va kilanga va Mulungu akamulonjelaje, “Muhe va Mulungu akutsa na kukugubika kota mujiji, na wuvetso wake Yoali Kilanga Ndalahela na uyo yo ukumulela yoali lubali lwa Mulungu akuchemwa mwana va Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Kaha utselaje kuta mung'olotso Elitsabeti yoavaga mende ana wubofu kuwugogolo, na guno go mwetsi gwa sita gwa wubofu wake. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Kwasawuli kuduhuli lulongwa lutalamu lolumusumaga Mulungu.” <verse eid="LUK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Maliyamu akalongaje, “Lave heni ntsi mutantsi va Mutwa, na yivaje hihyo kota fyo undonje.” Hambele mutantsi va kilanga va Mulungu akawukaje.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maliyamu am'bita kumujendela Elitsabeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Siku tsitso Maliyamu akangufitsaje kwantsa lujendo lwa kubita ku muji gumwe goguli mu fidunda fya inyi ya Yudeya. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Akinjilaje mu nyumba ya Tsakaliya na kumusamusa Elitsabeti. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Hala Elitsabeti hoavaga kuhulika sawu ya Maliyamu, mwana yo avaga mwileme lyake akadibukaje. Elitsabeti akamemetswaje Muhe va Mulungu, <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />nayo Elitsabeti akalongaje fikami kuta, “Heve utambichilwe kulutila vadala veka, nayo mwana youkumulela atambichililwe.” <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Lechelelo kwasawuli yachi lulongwa ulu luhumile kwa heni, mbaka yuve va Mutwa vangu atse anjendele heni? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Hala hombije kuhulika samuso yako, mwana yoali mulileme lyangu adibuche kwa wusangalafu. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Uditilwe wuwuya na Mulungu heve yo witumbye kuta ndongwa tsoalontsile Mutwa tsikuhumila.<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maliyamu ankwimba lwimbo lwa kumutsumitsa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Nayo Maliyamu akimbaje kwa kumutsumitsa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:46">“Numbula yangu yingumutsumitsa Mutwa,<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />nayo numbula yangu yingumusangalalila Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:47">yo Mukulusi vangu.<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />Kwasawuli andotsile kwa lusungu heni mutantsi vake munyakwika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:48">Nachene luhuma sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:48">filelo fyeka fikunyema munu yo aditilwe wuwuya,<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />Kwasawuli Mulungu munya wuvetso weka anditye ndongwa ngomi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:49">Na kwasawuli Mwene ng'ani yo Mukwemufu ndalahela.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Lusungu lwake luli kwa vanu veka wo vangumuhesimila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:50">Mulungu kuhuma chilelo mbaka chilelo,<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Adisile ndongwa ngomi kwa wuvetso wake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:51">Na agatalitse mahotso ga vanya chidada go gali mu numbula tsawo.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Avahetsitse vantsajila luhuma mu wuntsajila wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:52">nayo avakwinitse vanyakwika.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Avagutitse vanya ntsala kwa finu finofu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:53">na vafuchifu avavintsile mawoko ng'ani.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Amutantsile Isilaheli mutantsi vake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:54">na akiwukaje wilaho wake kwa Ibulahimu,<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />na filelo fyake siku tseka tsotsili hela wudugo!”<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Maliyamu akikalaje na Elitsabeti myetsi jidatu, hambele akawuyaje kukaye kwake.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuleleka kwa Yohana mubatitsaji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Chavaga kufika chipindi cha Elitsabeti kulela, akalelaje mwana mukwamitsi. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Vanu wovikalasaga habehi nayo na vanu vanji vakahulikaje hila Mutwa fyo amuwon'ye lusungu, nawo vakasangalalaje hamwe nayo. <verse eid="LUK 1:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Mwana hoavaga kufika siku ya nane vakamwingitsaje likumbi, vaganaga mwana achemwe litawa Tsakaliya, lyolyavaga litawa lya dade. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Lechelelo yuve akalongaje kuta, “Ndaya! Litawa lyake achemwe Yohana!” <verse eid="LUK 1:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Lechelelo vanu vakamulonjelaje kuta, “Kuduhu munu yoyuve mulukolo lwake munya litawa kota ilyo!” <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Vakamuputsaje dade kwa ndajilo tsa mawoko ili atambule litawa lyo an'gana kumupela mwanage. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Tsakaliya akasukaje lubawo lwa kwandichila, akandikaje, “Litawa lyake Yohana.” Vanu veka vakapomokaje! <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Luvala lulo Tsakaliya akavetsaje kulonga kanji na akantsaje kumutsumitsa Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Vanu veka va habehi nawo vakatinukaje na ndongwa itso tsikatagalilaje chila hono mu inyi yeka ya Yudeya. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Chila munu yo ahuliche ndongwa itso akatinukaje na kiwutsa, “Mbe, mwana uyu akuva munu vachi?” Kwasawuli wuvetso wa Mutwa wavaga hamwe nayo.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wuloli wa Tsakaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Kahi Tsakaliya dade va Yohana akamemetswaje Muhe va Mulungu, akalongaje wuloli wa kuhuma kwa Mulungu na kulonga,<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />“Atsumitswe Mutwa, Mulungu va Isilaheli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:68">kwasawuli atsitse na kuvagombola vanu vake.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Nayo atupelye Mukulusi munya wuvetso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:69">luhuma mufilelo vya Dawudi mutantsi vake.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Kota fyo alontsile kukolela kwa valoli yo avahagwe luhuma katali,<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />Kuta akutukulusa mu mawoko ga vatelani vetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:71">Na kuhuma mumawoko ga veka wovangutuvipila.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Alontsile kuta akuvaditila ndongwa nofu vagogolo vetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:72">na akwiwuka lilagano lyake lyoavisile mwene.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Kota hila fyoali amulonje kwa kumulahila dada vetu Ibulahamu,<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />kuta akutukulusa mwene luhuma mumawoko ga valatelani vetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:74">Na kutudita tuvetse kumutanga bila muloto,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />kwa kuva lubali lwake na kudichilwa halutalo hake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:75">mu siku tseka tsa wumi wetu.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Na heve mwanangu ukuchemwa muloli va Mulungu Muvina ndalahela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:76">Kwasawuli ukumulongola Mutwa ili umuditile ng'asi.<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />Ukuvalonjela vanu vake kuta vakukuluswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:77">kwa kuhulumilwa ndongwa tsawo ntsibi.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Kwasawuli ya wukatufu na lusungu lwa Mulungu vetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:78">Akutung'alichila mwangatsa gwa wukuluso wake kuhuma kilanga.<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />Na kuvang'alichila veka wovangikala mujitsa lya wuhigo wa chifo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:79">na kutulongotsa mu ng'asi ya wusichimafu.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Mwana akakalagalaje na kuva na wuvetso mu numbula. Akikalaje kumbuga mbaka hoavaga kilajila kwa vanu Vaisilaheli.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Kuleleka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Matayo 1:18-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Siku tsila Kayisali Agusitino akalajitsaje kuta vanu veka wo vangikala mu wutavala wa Valoma vanguganika kuvalilwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Iyo yo yavaga mbalilo ndongola, luvala ulo Kileniyo hoavaga muvina va mukova gwa Siliya. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Duve chila munu akabitaje kwiyandikitsa ku muji gwake go alelechilye. <verse eid="LUK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Ihyo Yosefu akawukaje luhuma muji gwa Natsaleti gogwavaga ku Galilaya akabitaje mbaka ku Betelehemu, ku muji go alelechilye Dawudi. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Yusufu akabitasaje kiyandikitsa hamwe na Maliyamu, yo vali valajine kwitola. Kuno mwanga avaga na wubofu. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Hovavaga uko ku Betelehemu, siku ya Maliyamu kulela mwana yikafikaje. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Akalelaje mwanage mulongola mukwamitsi, akamugubikitsaje myenda ja chiwana, na kumulambalika hono hotsililaga senga, kwasawuli nyumba tsa kuvasa vajentsi tsavaga tsimemile vanu.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vadimi na vatantsi va kilanga va Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Kwavaga na vadimi yo vikalaga habehi na hono iho, yo vamilaga ng'olo tsawo hachilo. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Luvala lulo mutantsi va kilanga va Mutwa akavahumilaje, na wumelemo wa Mulungu wukavang'alichilaje chila lubali. Nawo vakavaje na muloto ndalahela. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Lechelelo mutantsi va kilanga va Mulungu akavalonjelaje, “Muleche kuva na muloto! Kwasawuli ntsina ndongwa nofu tsotsikuva na wuhechelelo wukomi kwa vanu veka. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Kwasawuli yenyu munyi guno ku muji gwa Dawudi aleliche Mukulusi yo Chilisito Mutwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Iyi yoyikuva ndajilo kwenyu kuta mukumufika mwana agubikitswe fibwende na alambalikwe mu libani lya kulila senga.” <verse eid="LUK 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Luvala lulo lilugu likomi lya vatantsi va kilanga va Mulungu likihantsaje na yula mutantsi va kilanga va Mulungu, vakantsaje kumutsumitsa Mulungu vakalongaje,<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />“Atsumitswe Mulungu va kilanga ndalahela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:14">na wusichimafu wuve na vanu veka va muinyi yoanguvagana.”<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Hala vatantsi va kilanga va Mulungu hovavaga kuvaleka na kuwuya kilanga kwa Mulungu vadimi vakilonjelaje, “Hondi tubite ku Betelehemu tukalulole lulongwa ulu lo atulonje Mutwa.” <verse eid="LUK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Vakangufitsaje kubita, vakamuwonaje Maliyamu na Yusufu na chali chila vachilambaliche mu libani lya kulila senga. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Vala vadimi hovavaga kuchiwona chali chila, vakatagalitsaje kwa vanu veka ndongwa tsa chali chila tso avalonje mutantsi va kilanga va Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Vanu veka wovahuliche ndongwa tsila tsovalontsile vadimi vakapomokaje ndalahela. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Lechelelo Maliyamu akatsivikaje ndongwa itso mu numbula yake na kutsihotsanitsa. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Vadimi vala vakawuyaje ku mbuga, kuno vangumutsumitsa Mulungu kwa ndongwa tseka tsovahuliche na kuntsiwona, kwasawuli tseka tsavaga hihilaga kota fyoali avalonje mutantsi va Mulungu va kilanga.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana antambulilwa litawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Hoyavaga kufika siku ya nane vakamwingitsaje mwana likumbi na vakamutambulilaje litawa Yesu, litawa ilyo lyoali atambulilwe na mutantsi va kilanga va Mulungu, hala Maliyamu hoavaga ang'acha kuva na wubofu.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ansindikwa mu Nyumba ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Hotsavaga kukwila siku tsa Maliyamu kugoloka luhuma alele kota fyogalajitsaga malajitso ga Musa, Yusufu na Maliyamu vakamutolaje mwana mbaka Yelusalemu ili vamuviche mwana halutalo ha Mutwa, <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />kota fyo yandikwe mu malajitso ga Mutwa kuta, “Chila mwana mukwamitsi, akuva muhagulwa va Muntsajila.” <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Kahi vavaga vahele kutawula nambiko, ng'unda mbina tsivili awu ng'unda ntsana tsivili, kota fyo yaganikaga mu malajitso ga Mutwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Luvala lulo ku Yelusalemu kwavaga na munu yoachemwaga Simiyoni yoadichilwaga halutalo ha Mulungu, nayo atsindilaga kwa wuwiniwo wukuluso wa vanu Vaisilaheli na Muhe va Mulungu avaga hamwe na munu uyo. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Muhe va Mulungu ali amugubulye kuta, siakufwa mbaka hala ho akumuwona Chilisito va Mutwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Muhe va Mulungu akamulongotsaje Simiyoni akabitaje ha Nyumba ya Mulungu, Yusufu na Maliyamu vakamuletaje mwana Yesu ili atambichilwe kota fyoyaganikaga na malajitso. <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simiyoni akamutolaje mwana uyo mumawoko gake, akamuhongetsaje Mulungu na kulonga,<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />“Lelo Mutwa ukwitsitse chila cho ukali undahye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:29">undeche heni ntsi mutantsi vako mbite kwa Mulungu kwa wusichimafu.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Kwasawuli kwa miho gangu ntsiwuwene wukuluso wako,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />wo mwanga uwuvisile halutalo ha vanu.<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Mwangatsa gogukuvang'alichila vanu vala wosi Vayawudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:32">na wutukufu kwa vanu vako Vaisilaheli.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Dade na yuve va Yesu vavaga vantinuka kwa ndongwa tsotsilonjiche kwasawuli ya mwana uyo. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Simiyoni akavatambichilaje, akalongaje na Maliyamu kuta, “Mwana yuno ahagulwe na Mulungu ave chambutso cha kugwa na kukuluswa kwa vanu wolofu va Isilaheli. Nayo yoyikuva ndajilo yoyikukanwa na vanu wolofu, <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />na heve mwene ukususutala ndalahela, iho mahotso ga vanu wolofu gakugubulwa.” <verse eid="LUK 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Kahi ha Nyumba ya Mulungu kwavaga na mudala yumwe Muloli, litawa lyake achemwaga Ana muhintsa va Fanuweli, yoali va likabila lya Aseli. Avaga mugogolo ndala hela, ali atoliche na mulume vakikalasaje myaka saba, na hambele mulume vake akafwaje. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Akikalaje mufwile mbaka hala hoavaga mugogolo va myaka samanini na jitayi. Luvala ulo lweka siawukaga ha Nyumba ya Mulungu, angumutsumitsa Mulungu, ikalaga bila kulya kuno angumusuka Mulungu hamunyi na hachilo. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Luvala lulo akatsaje halutalo ha Yusufu na Maliyamu, akamuhongetsaje Mulungu na kulonga ndongwa tsa uyo mwana, kwa vanu veka wovihuvilaga wukuluso wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yusufu na Maliyamu van'wuya ku Natsaleti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Yusufu na Maliyamu hovavaga kusinda kudita fyeka fyofin'ganika na mumalajitso ga Mutwa Mulungu, vakawuyaje hamwe ku Galilaya, ku muji gwawo gwa Natsaleti. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Mwana akakalagalaje na wuwuya wa Mulungu wavaga hamwe nayo.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ali ha Nyumba ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Chila mwaka valeli va Yesu vavaga vatsovye kubita ku Yelusalemu hachipindi cha sikukulu ya pasaka. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Mwana hoavaga kuva na myaka kumi na jivili, vakabitasaje ku sikukulu iyo kota fyovaditaga. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Hoyavaga kusila sikukulu vakantsaje kuwuya kukaye kwawo, lechelelo mukwamitsi Yesu akasigalaje ku Yelusalemu. Valeli vake sivalutselaga lulongwa ulo. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Vatyaga kuta vali hamwe nayo mwilugu, vakajendaje lujendo lwa chimunyi cheka hambele vakantsaje kumusaka mwilugu lya vanu na mwa vang'olotsawo. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Vakavaje kulemwa kumuwona, Yusufu na Maliyamu vakawuyaje ku Yelusalemu kumusakitsa. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Siku ya kadatu vakamuwonaje ha Nyumba ya Mulungu, ichite hagati ha vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa, anguvahulikitsa na kuvaputsa mbutso. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Veka wovamuhulikaga vakapomokaje kwasawuli ya nyala tsake, na ntselo tsake na njibulo tso avajibulaga. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Dade na yuve vavaga kumuwona vakapomokaje. Yuve akalongaje nayo kuta, “Mwanangu, mbe ndawuli utuditye hino? Dado na heni tukusakije kwa wususutafu chila hono” <verse eid="LUK 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Kwasawuli yachi musakije heni? Simutselije kuta ntsin'ganika kuva ha Nyumba ya Dada vangu?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Lechelelo Maliyamu na Yusufu sivatselaga chila cho alongaga Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Ihyo vakawuyasaje hamwe mbaka ku Natsaleti, akavaje anguvahulikitsa. Lechelelo yuve akatsivikaje ndongwa itso tseka mu numbula yake. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Nayo Yesu akendelelaje kukalagala kwa kuva na ludali na ntselo, akidichilwaje na Mulungu na vanu.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Mbikulo tsa Yohana mubatitsaji</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matayo 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maliko 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohana 1:19-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Mwaka gwa kumi na kahanu gwa wutavala wa Kayisali Tibeliyo, Pondiyo Pilato avaga mutavala va ku Yudeya, Helode avaga muntsajila va ku Galilaya, na Filipi mame va Helode avaga muntsajila va mukova gwa Ituleya na inyi ya Tulakoniti. Lisaniya avaga muntsajila va ku Abilene, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />na Hanasi na Kayafwa vavaga vavina va vatawula nambiko. Luvala ulo lulongwa lwa Mulungu lukamutsilaje kwa Yohana mwana va Tsakaliya uko kumbuga. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Yohana akabitaje chila hono hoha bakanaga na lulenga lwa Yolidani na kulonga, “Mugaluche na kutsileka ndongwa tsenyu ntsibi, mubatitswe, na Mulungu akuvahulumila ndongwa tsenyu ntsibi.” <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Kota fyoyandikwe muchitabu cha Isaya Muloli va Mulungu kuta, “Litsi lya munu yoankola kumbuga, ‘Mumuwuyapile Mutwa ng'asi na mugolose wukolo wake. <verse eid="LUK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Chila likwava likutilwa, na chila chidunda na fidunda fikubong'olwa, na ng'asi tsotsibibinde tsikugololwa. <verse eid="LUK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Na vanu veka vakuwuwona wukuluso wa Mulungu.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Yohana akavalonjelaje vala vanu wolofu wovatsitse kubatitswa, “Henye chilelo cha ntsoka.” Nani yoavalonje muyibilime ghatsabu ya Mulungu yoyinkutsa? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Lelo mudite ndongwa nofu tsotsikihwana na kugaluka kwenyu luhuma mu ndongwa tsenyu ntsibi. Mulekaje kilonjela mu numbula tsenyu kuta, “Hetwe tunayo Dada vetu Ibulahimu kwasawuli ntsinguvalonjela, Mulungu afuluche agadite maganga gano gave vana va Ibulahimu. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Lelo vega mwanga yili mumasina ga mibichi. Ihyo chila mubichi gosinambe gulele mibawo minofu gukudumulwa na kutagwa mumoto.” <verse eid="LUK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Vala vanu wolofu vakamuputsaje, “ Lelo tun'ganika tudite ndawuli?” <verse eid="LUK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Yohana akavalonjelaje, “Munu yoana myenda jivili amugavile yula yo alihela mwenda, yoana chilyo amugavile yoalihela chilyo.” <verse eid="LUK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Nawo vakongotsa kodi vakatsaje vabatitswe, vakamuwutsaje, “Mudahitsi tuditaje ndawuli?” <verse eid="LUK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Yohana akavalonjelaje, “Mulekaje kukongotsa kodi kulutila yoyin'ganika.” <verse eid="LUK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Vamilitsi nawo vakamuputsaje, “Na hetwe natwe tuditaje ndawuli?” Yohana akavalonjelaje, “Mulekaje kumusukula chinu munu yoyuve awu kumuhiga munu kwa wudeteletsi, mukwilwaje na mahombo genyu.” <verse eid="LUK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Vanu vavaga na wihuvilo wukomi munumbula tsawo kuta, Yohana akuva yo Chilisito yo muhagulwa na Muntsajila. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Yohana akavalonjelaje, “Heni ntsimbatitsa kwa malenga, lechelelo yoankutsa ana wuvetso kundutila heni. Heni sifuluche ndejetse ndejesi tsa katambuga tsake, mwene akuvabatitsa kwa Muhe va Mulungu na kwa moto. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Mwene analo luhelo lwa kupetela, na hono ha kupetela akuhaselega ndalahela na akutsa akong'ase wuhemba wake mwidoga lyake, lechelelo misuyo jeka akukong'asa na kujinyanya mumoto go sigutsimaga.” <verse eid="LUK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Ho ihyo kwa ndongwa ntsolofu hamwe na kuvafunda, Yohana akavahimilitsaje vanu na kuvalonjela Ndongwa Nofu. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Lechelelo Yohana hoakavaga kumung'anulila muntsajila Helode kwasawuli ya kumutola Helodeya yoavaga mudala va mung'olotse, hamwe na ng'ani tsinji ntsibi tso aditaga. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Helode akalutitsaje wubi wake kwasawuli ya lulongwa ulo, akamuwopaje Yohana mu nyumba ya wuwopwa.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubatitswa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Matayo 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maliko 1:9-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Vanu veka hovavaga vam'batitswa, Yesu nayo akabitaje kubatitswa. Hoavaga angumusuka Mulungu, kilanga kukadindukaje, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />na Muhe va Mulungu akikaje mwilanga mwake kwa wuwoneko kota wa ng'unda, na litsi kuhuma kilanga kwa Mulungu likahulikwaje, “Heve yo mwanangu yontsingukugana, yo ntsingukwenda hilo.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukolo lwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Matayo 1:1-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Yesu hoantsaga katsi yake avaga na myaka machumi gadatu. Vanu vatselaga kuta, avaga mwana va Yusufu, mwana va Heli. <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Heli avaga mwana va Matati, na Matati avaga mwana va Lavi, na Lavi avaga mwana va Melichi, na Melichi avaga mwana va Yanayi, na Yonana avaga mwana va Yusufu, <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Yusufu avaga mwana va Matatiya, na Matatiya avaga mwana va Amosi, na Amosi avaga mwana va Nahumu, na Nahumu avaga mwana va Hesili, na Hesili avaga mwana va Nagayi, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />nayo Nagayi avaga mwana va Maati, na Maati avaga mwana va Matatiya, na Matatiya avaga mwana va Semeyini, na Semeyini avaga mwana va Yosechi, na Yosechi avaga mwana va Yoda, <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Nayo Yoda avaga mwana va Yoanani, na Yoanani avaga mwana va Lesa, na Lesa avaga mwana va Tselubabeli, na Tselubabeli avaga mwana va Selitiyeli, na Selitiyeli avaga mwana va Neli, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Neli avaga mwana va Melichi, na Melichi avaga mwana va Adi, na Adi avaga mwana va Kosamu, na Kosamu avaga mwana va Helimadamu, na Helinadabu avaga mwana va Heli, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Heli avaga mwana va Yosuva, na Yosuva avaga mwana va Helietseli, na Helietseli avaga mwana va Yolimu, na Yolimu avaga mwana va Matati, na Matati avaga mwana va Lavi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Lavi avaga mwana va Simiyoni, na Simiyoni avaga mwana va Yuda, na Yuda avaga mwana va Yusufu, na Yusufu avaga mwana va Yonamu, na Yonamu avaga mwana va Heliyachimu, na Heliyachimu avaga mwana va Meleya, <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Meleya avaga mwana va Mena, na Mena avaga mwana va Matata, na Matata avaga mwana va Nasani, nayo Nasani avaga mwana va Dawudi, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Dawudi avaga mwana va Yese, Yese avaga mwana va Ubedi, na Ubedi avaga mwana va Bowatsi, na Bowatsi avaga mwana va Salumoni, na Salumoni avaga mwana va Nasoni, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Yuyo Nasoni avaga mwana va Aminadabu, na Aminadabu avaga mwana va Adimini, na Adimini avaga mwana va Alamu, nayo Alamu avaga mwana va Hetsiloni, na Hetsiloni avaga mwana va Pelesi, na Pelesi avaga mwana va Yuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Yuda avaga mwana va Yakobo, na Yakobo avaga mwana va Yisaka, na Yisaka avaga mwana va Abulahamu, na Abulahamu avaga mwana va Tela, na Tela avaga mwana va Naholi, <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Yuyo Naholi avaga mwana va Seluji, na Seluji avaga mwana va Lehu, na Lehu avaga mwana va Peleji, nayo Peleji avaga mwana va Hebeli, na Hebeli avaga mwana va Sela, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Sela avaga mwana va Chenani, na Chenani avaga mwana va Alifakisadi, na Alifakisadi avaga mwana va Semu, nayo Semu avaga mwana va Nuwu yoaleliche na Lamechi, <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lamechi avaga mwana va Metusela, na Metusela avaga mwana va Henochi, nayo Henochi avaga mwana va Yaledi, na Yaledi avaga mwana va Mahalaleli, na Mahalaleli avaga mwana va Chenani, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Chenani avaga mwana va Henosi, na Henosi avaga mwana va Seti, nayo Seti avaga mwana va Adamu, na Adamu avaga mwana va Mulungu.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesu an'jelwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Matayo 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Maliko 1:12-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Yesu akawuyaje kuhuma kululenga lwa Yolidani kuno amemile Muhe va Mulungu na Muhe va Mulungu akamulongotsaje mbaka ku mbuga. <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Kuko ajelwaga na Lisoka kwa siku alubayini. Kwa siku tseka itso sialyeye chinu chochive, hambele ntsala yikamutamaje. <verse eid="LUK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Lisoka likamulonjelaje, “Manyi heve ulimwana va Mulungu uligalule liganga lino live libumunda.” <verse eid="LUK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Lechelelo Yesu akalijibulaje Lisoka, “Yandikwe hino, ‘Munu siafuluche ikale mumi kwa libumunda yeka.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Kahi Lisoka likamutolaje Yesu mbaka hono ha hilanga, likamulajilaje hohamwe ntsajila tseka tsa inyi, <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />na likamulonjelaje, “Ngukupela ntsajila tseka na finu finofu fyeka fikuva fyako, kwasawuli fuluche ntsimupele yoyuve yo ntsingumugana. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Ihyo manyi ufugamile heni, finu fyeka fino fikuva fyako.” <verse eid="LUK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yesu akalijibulaje Lisoka, Yandikwe kuta, Umufugamile Mutwa Mulungu vako na kumutanga hila fyo an'gana mwene.<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Lisoka likamutegulaje Yesu na kumusindika ku Yelusalemu, na kumuvika ha munala gwa Nyumba ya Mulungu, likamulonjelaje, “Manyi heve uli mwana va Mulungu, witotse luhuma hano, <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />kwakuva yandikwe kuta, Mulungu akukulagitsila vatantsi vake va kilanga ili vakugabe. <verse eid="LUK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />Nawo vakukutegula mumawoko gawo, uleche kwikuvala ligulu lyako mu liganga.” <verse eid="LUK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Lechelelo Yesu akalijibulaje, “Kaha yandikwe, ‘Walahogola kumujela Mutwa Mulungu vako.’” <verse eid="LUK 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Lisoka holyavaga kusinda kumujela Yesu kwa chila lujelo, likamulekaje kwa chipindi chochin'ganika.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ankwantsa katsi yake ku Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Matayo 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Maliko 1:14-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Ihyo Yesu akawuyaje mbaka ku Galilaya, kuno amemile wuvetso wa Muhe va Mulungu, natso ndongwa tsake tsikatagalilaje ku Galilaya na chila miji ja habehi. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Yesu akavaje an'dahitsa vanu mu nyumba yawo ya kitang'anila Vayawudi, akatsumilwaje na chila munu.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vanu va ku Natsaleti vangumukana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matayo 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Maliko 6:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Yesu akabitaje ku Natsaleti, hono hoakalagalilye na Siku ya Kwesela Vayawudi yoyachemwaga Sabato, akinjilaje mu nyumba ya kwitang'anila Vayawudi kota fyo avaga atsovye. Akimaje ili asome. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Vakamupelaje chitabu cha Yisaya muloli va Mulungu, Yesu akagubulaje hono hohandikwe hino, <verse eid="LUK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />“Muhe va Mutwa Mulungu alimugati mwa heni, kwasawuli anyagwe ntsivavikulile vagayu Ndongwa Nofu. Anumile ntsivahumye wovali muwupogotsi, na wovabofwe vavetse kulola kahi, na kuvalechela wovan'wonelwa, <verse eid="LUK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />na kuvikula mwaka gwa Mutwa go gudichilwe.” <verse eid="LUK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Yesu aveye kusinda kusoma, akachipetaje chitabu na akamupilulilaje mutantsi, akabitaje kwikalisa hanyi. Vanu veka wovavaga mu Nyumba ya kwitang'anila Vayawudi vakamukangatsilaje miho. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Ihyo akantsaje kwa kuvalonjela hino, “Munyiguno Ndongwa tsino tsikwilye kota fyomuhuliche.” <verse eid="LUK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Veka wovavaga vangumuhulikitsa vakamutsumilaje na kutinuswa na ndongwa tsake tsotsimemile wuwuya, na vakiwutsaje kuta, “Ihi! Yuno si mwana va Yusufu?” <verse eid="LUK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Ntsitsela kuta mukundonjela sembeletso yino, ‘Muganga, wiponetse umwene! Na ndongwa tsila tsowadisile ku Kapelinaumu, udite na kuno kukaye kwenyu.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Akawilaje kuvalonjela hino, “Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta, Muloli siadichilwaga kukaye kwawo. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Lechelelo munyulikitse! Kwavaga na vafwile wolofu muinyi ya Isilaheli chipindi cha Eliya, na kwavaga na ntsala ngomi kuinyi yeka, kwasawuli ndonya yali yilemitswe kutonya kwa myaka jidatu na myetsi sita. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Nayivaje ihyo, Eliya siatumilwe kwa yoyuve mu inyi ya Isilaheli, ila kwa mufwile yumwe mujentsi yoikalaga ku muji gwa Saleputa ku inyi ya Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Kaha kwavaga na vatamwa wolofu va wububa ku inyi ya Isilaheli chipindi cha Elisa muloli va Mulungu. Nayivaje ihyo sikwavaga na yoyuve yoaponitswe, ila munu yumwe ng'ani yoachemwaga Nahamani va inyi ya Siliya.” <verse eid="LUK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Vanu vheka wovavaga mu nyumba ya kitang'anila Vayawudi vakavaje kuhulika ndongwa itso, vakavipaje ndalahela. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Vakinukaje vakamukwegwenaje Yesu mbaka kivala kutali na muji, vakamutegulaje mbaka hilanga ha kadunda hogwali gutsentsilwe muji, ili vamutotse mbaka hasi ha njema. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Lechelelo Yesu akawukaje an'jenda hagati hawo.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angulivinga Lisoka kwa munu.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Maliko 1:21-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Kahi Yesu akikaje mbaka ku Kapelinaumu, ku muji gwa Galilaya, na Siku ya Kwesela akantsaje kuvadahitsa vanu. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Vanu vakatinukaje ndalahela kwasawuli adahitsaga kwa mamulaka. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Na mu Nyumba yila ya kitang'anila Vayawudi kwavaga na munu yoavaga na lisoka, akakolaje fikami akalongaje, <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />“Un'gana utudite chichi Yesu va ku Nantsaleti? Mbe untsitse kutukopola? Ngutsele kuta heve ulinani! Heve yo uli Munu muhagulwa kwasawuli ya Mulungu!” <verse eid="LUK 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yesu akaling'anulilaje lisoka ilyo, akalilonjelaje, “Katuche! Na uhume mugati mwa munu yuno!” Duve lisoka ilyo likamugwisaje hasi munu yula halutalo ha vanu veka, na likahumaje bila kumutetsa. <verse eid="LUK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Vanu veka vakatinukaje, na vakavaje vangilonjela, “Ulu lulongwa lunya ndawuli? Angujing'anulila misoka kwa mamulaka na wuvetso, najo jinhuma!” <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Ndongwa tsa Yesu tsikatagalilaje chila hono muinyi yila.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvaponetsa vanu wolofu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Matayo 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Maliko 1:29-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yesu akahumaje mu nyumba yila ya kwitang'anila Vayawudi, akabitaje mu nyumba ya Simoni. Mudala yumwe mukwive va Simoni avaga na mbungo ngomi, nawo vakamusukaje Yesu amuponeste. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Yesu akabitaje akimaje habehi na mutamwa yula akaying'anulilaje mbungo yila. Nayo mbungo yikamulekaje, na luvala lulo mudala yula akantsaje kuvakolela katsi. <verse eid="LUK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Litsuva holyavaga linsota, veka wovavaga na vang'olotsawo vanya matamwa vakavatolaje mbaka kwa Yesu, akavavichilaje mawoko chila mutamwa kwa kumusuchila, na veka vakaponaje. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Misoka jikavahumaje vanu wolofu, vakakolaje na kuta, “Heve uli mwana va Mulungu!” Lechelelo Yesu akajing'anulilaje misoka na kujilemetsa jileche kulonga, kwasawuli jamutselaga kuta mwene yo Chilisito muhagulwa va Mulungu.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anvikula Ndongwa Nofu ku Yudeya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Maliko 1:35-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Hamilawu iyage kung'acha kutitutitu Yesu akawukaje akabitaje hono hawiyeka. Vanu vakamusakaga nawo vakavaje kumuwona vakajelaje kumlemetsa aleche kuwuka. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Lechelelo mwene akavajibulaje, “Ntsin'ganika kuvikula Ndongwa Nofu tsa wuntsajila wa Mulungu mu miji jinji, kwasawuli ntsatumilwe kwa lulongwa ulo.” <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Akendelelaje kuvikula mu nyumba ya kitang'anila Vayawudi tsa ku Yudeya.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvahagula vadahitswa valongola</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Matayo 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Maliko 1:16-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Chimunyi chimwe Yesu avaga imile ha lilamba lya Jenetsaleti, na vanu wolofu vavaga vamupilime na kuno vangumukunugitsa ili vahulikitse Ndongwa Nofu tsa Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Akajiwonaje mitumbwi jivili ja valova somba, jojavaga mulubali mwa lilamba, vatsiwuyapaga nyafu tsawo. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Yesu hoavaga kwinjila mu mutumbwi go gwali gwa Simoni, akamulagitsaje Simoni aguhegetse luhuma ha mwejego gwa lilamba gubite mbaka ha lulenga lutali. Akikalisaje na akantsaje kuvadahitsa malugu ga vanu. <verse eid="LUK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Avaga kusinda kudahitsa, akamulonjelaje Simoni, “Wendese mutumbwi mbaka hono hanya lulenga lutali, mutotse waafu wenyu mulove somba.” <verse eid="LUK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Simoni akamujibulaje, “ Ena! Mutwa, tukodiche kulova somba chilo cheka situlapata. Lechelelo kwasawuli ulontsile heve tukutotsa nyafu mu malenga.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Nawo hovaveye kutotsa nyafu vakapataje somba ntsolofu ndalahela, mbaka nyafu tsawo tsikantsaje kudemuka. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Vakavachemaje kwa mawoko vayawo wovavaga mu mutumbwi gunji vatse vavatanje. Vakatsaje vakamemyaje somba mu mitumbwi jeka jivili mbaka mitumbwi jikaganaje kuyajilila mululenga. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Simoni Petulo aveye kuwona ihyo, akafugamaje hamagulu ga Yesu na kumulonjela, “Mutwa uheje kwa heni. Heni ntsi munu yo ntsin'dita ndongwa ntsibi!” <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Kwasawuli mwene na vayage vali vatinuche ndalahela kwa kulova somba ntsolofu tsinya ihyo. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Hihila Yakobo, na Yohana, na vana va Tsebedayo wovavaga valova somba hamwe na Simoni nawo vakatinukaje. Yesu akamulonjelaje Simoni kuta, “Uleche kuva na muloto, luhuma sambi siukuva mulova somba, lechelelo ukuva unguvaleta vanu kwa Mulungu.” <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Duve hovavaga kupilula mitumbwi jila halubali lwa lilamba, vakalekaje chila chinu, vakabitasaje na Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumuponetsa munu munya wutamwa wa wububa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matayo 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Maliko 1:40-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Chimunyi chimwe Yesu hoavaga ku Galilaya, munu yumwe munya wutamwa wa wububa muvili gweka akatsaje. Avaga kumuwona Yesu akamufugamilaje na akamugongolaje kuta, “Mutwa, manyi ugane ufuluche umonetse ili ntsidichilwe mu ntsovelo tsa kumufugamila Mulungu.” <verse eid="LUK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yesu akagololaje liwoko lyake, akamudometsaje mutamwa yula na kumulonjela, “Ntsin'gana, upone!” Luvala lulo wububa wake wukaponaje. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Ulekaje kumulonjela munu yoyuve lulongwa ulu, lechelelo ubite ukilajile kwa mutawula nambiko, na ukatawule nambiko kwasawuli ya kudikitswa kumufugamila Mulungu kota fyo avalajitse Musa, na ihyo hovakutsela kuta uponile.” <verse eid="LUK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Lechelelo ndongwa tsa Yesu tsikalutilaje kutagalila chila hono, na vanu wolofu vakakong'anaje ili vamuhulikitse na kuponetswa namwa tsawo. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Nayivaje ihyo Yesu akabitaje hono hohaduhu vanu ili amusuche Mulungu.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumuponetsa munu yoapotsile muvili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matayo 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Maliko 2:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Siku yimwe Yesu avaga an'dahitsa, Mafwalisayo vatunga na vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa, wovavaga vahumye chila fijiji fya Galilaya na kuhuma ku Wuyawudi na Yelusalemu vavaga vichite baho. Na wuvetso wa Mulungu wavaga hamwe na Yesu ili kuvaponetsa vanu namwa tsawo. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Vakatsaje vanu vanji wovamupisile munu mulusaga yoali na wutamwa wa kupola muvili. Vakajelaje kumwingitsa mugati ili vamuviche halutalo ha Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Lechelelo kwasawuli ya wolofu wa vanu vakalemwaje kwinjila mula mugati, vakakwinaje na kutubula kano, vakamwisaje mutamwa yula kuno ali mulusaga hono hoavaga Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Yesu hoavaga kuliwona litumbilo lyawo, akamulonjelaje mutamwa yula, “Muyangu, nguhulumye mu ndongwa tsako ntsibi.” <verse eid="LUK 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa na mafwalisayo vakantsaje kwiputsa, “Munu yuno yo nani anlonga ndongwa tsa kumuliga Mulungu? Kuduhuli yoafuluche avahulumile vanu vanya ndongwa tsibi ila Mulungu ng'ani!” <verse eid="LUK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yesu akatselaje chovahotsaga akavawutsaje, “Kwasawuli ya chichi munhotsa ihyo mu numbula tsenyu? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Mbe, chichi cho chipefu kumulonjela kuta, Uhulumilwe ndongwa tsako ntsibi, awu kulonga kuta, Winuche ubite? <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Lelo ntsin'gana mutsele kuta Mwana va Munu ana wuvina va kuhulumila vanu ndongwa tsawo ntsibi mu inyi.” Ihyo akamulonjelaje munu yula yoapotsile muvili, “Winuche, utegule lusaga lwako, ubite ku nyumba yako.” <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Luvala lulo munu uyo akimaje halutalo hawo, akategulaje lusaga lwake lo avasilaga na kubita kukaye kuno angumutsumitsa Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Chila munu akapomokaje na kwantsa kumutsumitsa Mulungu na vakalongaje, “Munyiguno tuwene ndongwa tsinya mutinuso.”<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lavi anhagulwa kuva mudahitswa va Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matayo 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Maliko 2:13-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Hotsavaga kulutila ndongwa itso, Yesu akahumaje kivala na kumuwona mukongotsa kodi ichite hono ha kukongotsela kodi, litawa lyake Lavi. Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Ufwate heni.” <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Lavi akinukaje na kuleka chila chinu akamufwataje Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Lavi akamuditilaje Yesu liwungo mu nyumba yake, na lilugu lya vakongotsa kodi na vanu vanji vakatsaje kulya. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Lechelelo Mafwalisayo na vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa vakavakalalilaje vadahitswa va Yesu na kuvalonjela, “Kwasawuli yachi munkulya na kung'wa hamwe na vakongotsa kodi na vanya ndongwa tsibi?” <verse eid="LUK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Vanu wosinambe vatamiche sivamusakaga muganga, lechelelo vatamwa yo vamusakaga muganga. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Sintsitsitse kuvachema vanu vawuya, lechelelo ntsitsitse kuvachema vanu vanya ndongwa ntsibi vatsileche na kumugaluchila Mulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amputswa ndongwa tsa kuleka kulya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matayo 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Maliko 2:18-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Vanu vanji vakamulonjelaje Yesu, “Vadahitswa va Yohana valekaga kulya na kusala, na vadahitswa va Mafwalisayo nawo vaditaga hihyo, lelo ndawuli vadahitswa vako vankulya na kung'wa!” <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yesu akavajibulaje, “Mbe, mufuluche muvadite vajentsi wovali hamwe na munyakukwela mwitsenjele valeche kulya na kung'wa? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Lechelelo yikufika siku iho munya kukwela alahetswa kwawo. Iho ho valaleka kulya.” <verse eid="LUK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Yesu akavapelaje muhwano guno, “Kuduhu munu yoademulaga chilaka mu mwenda mupya na kuchihoneletsa mu mwenda mulovela. Manyi adite ihyo akuva ademwe mwenda gula mupya, na chilaka chila sichifuluche chihwane na mwenda gula mulovela. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Kaha kuduhu munu yoavikaga difwayi ntsipya mu mifuko misakafu jo jiwupwe kwa nyingo ng'olo. Manyi adite ihyo mifuko jila jikutwadika na difwayi yila yikubohoka. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Lechelelo difwayi ntsipya yivikwaga mu mifuko mipya ja nyingo. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Kuduhu munu yoiwiniwaga kung'wa difwayi ntsipya manyi alongole kung'wa difwayi ya katali, ila alongaga, ‘Yila ya katali yo nofu kulutila difwayi ntsipya.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesu yo Muntsajila va Siku ya Kwesela</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matayo 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Maliko 2:23-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Siku yimwe ya Kwesela Vayawudi, Yesu avaga anlutila mu migunda ja wuhemba. Vadahitswa vake vakabenaje maho ga wuhemba vakapululaje na kwantsa kulya ndete. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Mafwalisayo vatunga vakamuputsaje, “Mbe, kwasawuli yachi mun'dita lulongwa losiluganikaga kuditwa Siku ya Kwesela?” <verse eid="LUK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yesu akavajibulaje, “Mbe, henye simulasoma hila fyoadisile Dawudi hamwe na vayage hovavaga na ntsala? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Dawudi inje mu Nyumba ya Mulungu, akatolaje mabumunda gala gogali gavisilwe kwasawuli ya kuliwa na vatawula nambiko ng'ani, akalyaje na kuvapela vayage.” <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Yesu akavalonjelaje kuta, “Mwana va Munu yo Mutavala va Siku ya Kwesela.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumuponetsa munu yo apotsile liwoko Siku ya Weselo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matayo 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Maliko 3:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Siku yinji ya Weselo, Yesu akinjilaje mu nyumba ya kitang'anila Vayawudi na akantsaje kudahitsa. Kuko kwavaga na munu yoapotsile liwoko lililo. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Mafwalisayo na vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa vasakaga hila fyovakumuhiga Yesu, iho vakavaje van'tsindila kuwona manyi akumuponetsa munu Siku ya Kwesela. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Lechelelo Yesu akatselaje chovahotsaga, akamulonjelaje munu yula yoapotsile liwoko kuta, “Winuche wime halutalo ha vanu.” Ihyo munu yula akimaje. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Kahi Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Ntsinguvaputsa, mbe, chinu chachi choching'anika kuditwa Siku ya Kwesela? Kudita ndongwa nofu au ndongwa ntsibi? Kukulusa wumi wa munu au kuwananga?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Yesu akavalolaje vanu wovali chila lubali, kahi akamulonjelaje yula munu yo apotsile liwoko kuta, “Golole liwoko lyako.” Nayo akagololaje, na liwoko lyake likaponaje. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Lechelelo Mafwalisayo na vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa vakamuvipilaje ndalahela, vakalonganaje hila fyovakumudita Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Anguvahagula vatumi kumi na vavili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matayo 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Maliko 3:13-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Siku yimwe Yesu akabitaje kuchidunda kusuka, kuko akamusukaje Mulungu chilo cheka. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Hoyavaga kufika hamilawu akavachemaje vadahitswa vake, akavahagulaje hagati hawo vanu kumi na vavili woavachemile vatumi. <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Yo avahagwe vavaga; Simoni yoamupelye litawa Petulo, na Andeleya mung'olotse, na Yakobo, na Yohana, na Filipi, na Batulomayo, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Matayo, na Tomasi, na Yakobo mwana va Halufwayo, na Simoni yo atovanilaga inyi yake, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />na Yuda mwana va Yakobo na Yuda Isikaliyote yoamugaluche Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvaponetsa vanu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Matayo 4:23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Yesu hoavaga kwika kuhuma kuchidunda hamwe na vatumi vake, akimaje hono hanya mbuga, iho havaga na vadahitswa vake vanji wolofu na lilugu lya vanu wovahumye mbali tseka tsa Yudeya, na Yelusalemu, na Tilo na Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Vanu iwo vavaga vatsitse kumuhulikitsa na kuponetswa matamwa gawo. Hihilaga na vanu veka yovakodekaga na misoka akavaponetsaje. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Vanu veka vaganaga kumudometsa Yesu, kwasawuli wuvetso wake wahumaga na kuvaponetsa vanu.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhechelela na Kudutsa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Matayo 5:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Kahi Yesu akavalolaje vadahitswa vake na kuvalonjela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">“Mulungu avaditye wuwuya henye vatsunwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">kwasawuli mukwanuchila wuntsajila wa Mulungu.<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Mulungu avaditye wuwuya henye yo muna ntsala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">kwasawuli hambele mukugutitswa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">Mulungu avaditye wuwuya henye yo munvemba sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">kwasawuli hambele mukuheka!”<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />Mulungu avaditye wuwuya henye ho munvipilwa na vanu na kubagulwa, na kuligwa, na kuvananjila litawa lyenu kota vanu vabi kwasawuli ya Mwana va Munu! <verse eid="LUK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Hotsikuva kuhumila ndongwa itso musangalalaje na kuhechelela, kwasawuli ngweko yenyu yikuva ngomi kilanga kwa Mulungu, ihyo fyo vakukwenyu fyovavaditye valoli vakatali.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />Lechelelo mukudutsa henye muvafuchifu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:24">kwasawuli mwanga mupasile finu finofu.<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Mukudutsa henye yo mwigwite sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">kwasawuli kulutalo mukuwona ntsala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">Mukudutsa henye yo munheka sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">kwasawuli kulutalo mukung'ung'uta na kuvemba.<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Mukudutsa henye vanu hovangu vatsumila henye, kwasawuli ho hihyo vadadawo fyo vavaditye valoli va wudesi.<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muvagane vatelani venyu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Matayo 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7:12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />Lechelelo henye munyulikitse, muvaganaje vatelani venyu. Muvaditile finofu yo vanguvavipila. <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Muvaditile wuwuya vanu vala yo vanguvakotola, na muvasuchile vala yovanguvaditila ndongwa ntsibi. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Manyi munu akutove mulutsetse lwa kwililo, umupitulile na lutsetse kwililo. Manyi munu akusukule likoti umulechele na gwanda. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Manyi munu yoyuve akusukule chinu chako, ulekaje kumudaya. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Muvaditilaje vanu kota hila fyomun'gana henye kuditilwa na vanu vanji.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />Manyi muvagane vala ng'ani yo vanguvagana henye, mun'dita ndongwa tsachi nofu? Kwasawuli nawo yo van'dita ndongwa ntsibi vavaganaga vala wovanguvagana vene. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Kahi manyi muvaditile ndongwa nofu vala ng'ani wovanguvaditila ndongwa nofu henye, mukuva mun'dita ndongwa tsachi nofu? Kwasawuli nawo yo van'dita ndongwa ntsibi vavaganaga vala wovanguvagana vene. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Manyi munguvakopetsa vanu finu kwa kihuvila kuta na henye vakuvapilulila chila chinu mukuva mun'dita ndongwa tsachi nofu? Kwasawuli nawo yo van'dita ndongwa ntsibi vavaditilaga hihyo vakola ndongwa ntsibi kwa kihuvila kuhombwa fyeka. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Lechelelo henye muvaganaje vatelani venyu kwa kuvaditila finofu, muvakopetsaje bila kwihuvila kupilulilwa, na ngweko yenyu yikuva ngomi, nanye mukuva vana va Mulungu yoali kilanga ndalahela. Kwasawuli mwene yo muwuya kwa vanu vabi na kwa vanu yo valihela ndumbo. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Muvaje na lusungu kota Dada venyu Mulungu fyo ana lusungu.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulekaje kuvahiga vanu vanji</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Matayo 7:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />“Mulekaje kuvahiga vanu vanji, na Mulungu siakuvahiga henye, mulekaje kuvakalalila vanu vanji ili Mulungu aleche kuvahiga na henye. Muvahulumilaje vanu vanji, ili Mulungu avahulumile na henye. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Muvapelaje vanu vanji finu fyenyu, na henye mukupelwa na Mulungu, na kwanuchila hihyo kwa chipimo cha kusindililwa na kutsugwantswa, na kumema mbaka kubohoka. Kwasawuli chipimo chila chomunguvapimila vanu vanji, chochicho chomukupimilwa na Mulungu.” <verse eid="LUK 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Akavalonjelaje muhwano guno, “Mbe, chibofu afuluche amulongotse chibofu muyage? Manyi adite ihyo, veka vavili vakwinjila mu lyowo. <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Mudahitswa siamulutilaga mudahitsi vake, lechelelo yula yoasintsile kudahitswa afuluche ave kota mudahitsi vake. <verse eid="LUK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />Kwasawuli yachi unlola kabadu ka lubawo kokali muliho lya mung'olotso, na heve sinambe wilole libadu lya muliho lyako? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Unvetsa ndawuli kumulonjela mung'olotso kuta, ‘Mung'olotsangu, hondi nguhetse kabadu kokali mugati mu liho lyako,’ na heve nambe wilole kabadu kokali muliho lyako? Heve ukuva mudesi, uhetse kabadu kokali mugati mu liho lyako tandi, iho houfuluche uhetse kabadu kokali muliho lya mung'olotso.”<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mubichi gutselanikaga kwa mibawo jake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Matayo 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />Mubichi munofu sigulelaga mibawo mibi, na mubichi mubi sigulelaga mibawo minofu. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Chila mubichi gutselanikaga kwa mibawo jake. Kwasawuli vanu sivabavaga mibawo ja tsambalawe mu mubichi gwa nundwe, awu tsabibu mu mibichi jinya mifwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Munu muwuya ahumyaga ndongwa nofu tsotsili mu numbula yake, nayo munu munya wubi ahumyaga ndongwa ntsibi tsotsili mu numbula yake, kwasawuli munu alongaga fyo fimemile mu numbula yake.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vatsentsi vanya nyala na vatsentsi vapufi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Matayo 7:24-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />“Mbe, Kwasawuli yachi mun'yema Mutwa, Mutwa, na kuno sinambe mudite fyo ntsinguvalonjela? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Nguvalajila fyoali munu yula yoankutsa kwa heni na yoanhulika Ndongwa tsangu na kudita fyontsin'gana. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Munu uyo ihwana na munu yoan'gana kutsenga nyumba, ayafile hasi ndalahela, na kuvika musinji hono hanya litalawe. Manyi litse likuka lya malenga na kuyitova nyumba yila, siyifuluche yitigasiche kwasawuli yitsentsilwe finofu. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Lechelelo munu yula yanhulika ndongwa tsangu na sinambe adite kota fyo ntsin'gana, anakota munu yo atsentsile nyumba muluganga bila kuyava musinji. Manyi litse likuka likuyitova nyumba iyo mbaka yikugwa.”<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s">Litumbilo lya muvina va lijesi lya Loma.</para>
  <para style="p">Matayo 8:5-13</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Hala Yesu hoavaga kusinda kulonga ndongwa itso tseka kwa vanu wovamuhulikitsaga, akabitaje ku Kapelinawumu. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Mutantsi va muvina yumwe va chikundi cha vatova ligalu va ku Valoma yo aganagwa ndalahela. Mutantsi uyu avaga antamika habehi na kufwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Muvina yula hoavaga kuhulika ndongwa tso aditaga Yesu, akavatumaje vagogolo va Chiyawudi, vakamufwate Yesu atse amuponetse mutantsi vake. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Hovaveye kubita kwa Yesu, vakamugongoletsaje ndalahela kwa kumulonjela kuta, “Munu yuno an'ganika atangwe. <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />Kwasawuli anguvagana vanu vetu, na kaha atutsenje Nyumba ya Kitang'anila.” <verse eid="LUK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Yesu akabitaje hamwe nawo, lechelelo hoavaga kuva habehi na kufika ha nyumba ya muvina yula, muvina uyo akavatumaje vayage vakamulonjele Yesu, “Mutwa, uleche kigatsa, kwasawuli heni sifuluche ngwingitse mu nyumba yangu. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Kwasawuli ntsiwene sifuluche ntsitse kwa heve. Lechelelo ulonje lulongwa hela, nayo mutantsi vangu akuva mumi. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Kwasawuli na heni ntsili hasi ha muvina vangu na heni ntsinawo vatova ligalu wo vali hasi hangu wo vanguhulikitsa malajitso go ntsinguvalonjela, manyi ntsimulonjele yuno, ‘Bite,’ abitaga, na yunji manyi ntsimulonjele, ‘Utse,’ atsaga. Kaha manyi ntsimulonjele mupogotsi vangu kuta, ‘Dite hino,’ aditaga.” <verse eid="LUK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Yesu avaga kuhulika ndongwa itso, akapomokaje ndalahela. Akavapituchilaje vanu vala wovamufwataga, akavalonjelaje, “Ntsing'acha kuwona litumbilo likomi kota lino nambe kwa vanu va Isilaheli.” <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Vanu vala wo vavaga vatumilwe kukaye kwa muvina yula, vakamufikaje mupogotsi yula aponile.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumutsilipula mukwamitsi va mudala mufwile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Hala hoavaga kusinda ndongwa itso, Yesu akabitaje ku muji gumwe go gwachemwaga Nayini. Mwene na vadahitswa vake na vanu wolofu wo vamufwataga vakabitasaje hamwe. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Hoavaga kufika habehi na lwitsi lukomi lwa kwinjilila ku muji vakahumilaje vanu wo vamutegwe mukwamitsi yoatajiche. Mukwamitsi uyo avaga mwana va wiyeka va mudala mufwile. Vanu wolofu va muji gula vavaga hamwe na yula mudala. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Mutwa Yesu avaga kumuwona mudala yula mufwile, akamuhulumilaje akamulonjelaje, “Uleche kuvemba.” <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Kahi Yesu akahejelelaje halutalo na akibataje na lusaga lula, na vanu vala wovavaga valutegwe vakimaje. Na akalongaje, “Heve Mukwamitsi, winuche!” <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Mukwamitsi yula yoali atajiche akinukaje, na akikalisaje, akantsaje kulonga, Yesu akamupelaje yuve. <verse eid="LUK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Vanu veka vakapomokaje ndala hela, nawo vakamutsumitsaje Mulungu kwa kulonga, “Muloli muvina atuhumye hagati hetu, na Mulungu atsitse kuvagombola vanu vake.” <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Lulongwa ulo lo adisile Yesu lukatagalilaje ku inyi yeka ya Yudeya na chila hono ha habehi.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yohana Mubatitsaji anguvatuma vadahitswa vake kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Matayo 11:2-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Vadahitswa va Yohana mubatitsaji vakamulonjelaje Yohana ndongwa itso tseka. Ihyo Yohana akavachemaje vadahitswa vake vavili, <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />akavatumaje kwa Muntsajila vamuputse, “Mbe, heve yo yula yo akutsa, awu tumutsinde yunji?” <verse eid="LUK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Vadahitswa vala vaveye kubita kwa Yesu vakamulonjelaje, “Yohana mubatitsaji atutumile tukuwutse kuta, Mbe, Heve yo yula yo akutsa awu tumutsinde yunji?”<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Luvala lulo, Yesu avaponetsaga vanu wolofu yovavaga vatamwa, na akavahetsaje vanu misoka na fibofu wolofu vakantsaje vakalolaje. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Duve Yesu akavalonjelaje vadahitswa va Yohana, “Mubite mukamulonjele Yohana fila fyo mungufiwona na kufihulika, fibofu vanlola, fiteve van'jenda, vanya wububa vampona na kudikitswa kumufugamila Mulungu, na yovadibe vanhulika, na yovatajiche van'tsilipulwa na vagayu vanvikulilwa Ndongwa Nofu. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Aditilwe wuwuya na Mulungu, munu yula yo alihela muhwehwe na heni!” <verse eid="LUK 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Vala vanu yo vatumilwe na Yohana hovavaga kuwuka,Yesu akantsaje kulonga na vanu ndongwa tsa Yohana. Akavaputsaje, “Homwabitaga kula ku mbuga, mwabitaga kulava chichi? Kulava lidenje lyolin'tigaswa na ng'ala? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Lelo mwahele kulava chichi? Mwali muhele kumulava munu yoali ndawuli? Awu kumulola munu yoafwite myenda ja galama?” Kwasawuli vanu wovanfwala myenda ja galama na kwikala mu nyumba tsa vantsajila, sivikalaga kwijeje! <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Lelo mundonjele, mwahele kulava chichi? Mwahele kumulava muloli va Mulungu? Lechelelo nachene ntsinguvalonjela kuta Yohana avalutye valoli va Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Uyo Yohana yo munu yanlongwa mu mandiko ga Mulungu kuta, “Lave Ntsingumutuma jumbe akulongole, yoakukuvichila chang'ani ng'asi ya kukola heve.” <verse eid="LUK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Yesu akawilaje kuvalonjela vanu vala, “Ntsinguvalonjela, hagati ha vanu wovaleliche na vadala, kuduhu munu muvina kulutila Yohana. Lechelelo munu yo mudodo ndalahela mu wuntsajila wa Mulungu yo muvina kulutila Yohana.” <verse eid="LUK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Ihyo vanu veka hamwe na vakongotsa kodi wovali vabatitswe na Yohana, vaveye kuhulika Yesu fyoalontsile, vakidichilaje kuta Mulungu muwuya. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Lechelelo Mafwalisayo na vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa vakalemaje gala go vali valajitswe na Mulungu, ihyo valemile kubatitswa na Yohana. <verse eid="LUK 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yesu akawilaje kulonga, “Mbe, vanu va chilelo chino nguviganitsa na chinu chachi, mbe vihwana na chichi?” <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Vanu va chilelo chino vanakota vana wovichite hono hakugutsila finu yovangichema vene kwa vene kutwa, Tuvapembye fwilimbi, lechelelo simulawunga! Tuvimbye ntsimbo tsa chivembo, lechelelo simuvembite! <verse eid="LUK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Kwasawuli Yohana mubatitsaji ho atsitse ikalaga bila kulya na kung'wa difwayi, nanye mukalongaje kuta, Ana lisoka. <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Mwana va munu atsitse, ankulya na kung'wa, nanye munlonga kuta, Mulave yuno muhatufu na mugatsi. Uyu yo muyage na vakongotsa kodi na vadita ndongwa ntsibi. <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Nayivaje ihyo ntselo ya Mulungu yilajilaga kuta wo wukweli kwa veka wo vanguyidichila.<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu am'bakatswa mafuta na mudala munya ndongwa ntsibi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Siku yimwe Mufwalisayo yumwe yo achemwaga Simoni akamulibulitsaje Yesu mu nyumba yake valye hamwe chilyo cha hachilo, nayo Yesu akabitaje na kikalisa mulutefu ili alye. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Mu muji ugo kwavaga na mudala yo an'dita ndongwa ntsibi. Avaga kuhulika kuta Yesu ali mu nyumba ya Fwalisayo ankulya, akatsaje na supa yinya mafuta gogan'nunyilila finofu. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Akimaje kumbele kumagulu ga Yesu kuno anvemba, akantsaje kugadodetsa magulu ga Yesu kwa manyotsi, uyo mudala akavaje angumupata Yesu magulu kwa fwili tsake. Kahi akavaje angunonela magulu ga Yesu na kumubakatsa mafuta igo. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Mufwalisayo yula yoamulibulitse Yesu avaga kuwona hila, akilonjelaje mu numbula yake, “Manyi munu yuno aka ave muloli va Mulungu akakutsela kuta mudala yoangumubata mumagulu munya ndawuli, kuta mudita ndongwa ntsibi.”<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yesu akamulonjelaje Mufwalisayo yula, “Simoni ntsina chinu cha kukulonjela.” Simoni akamulonjelaje,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">“Ee Mudahitsi, Ndonjele.” Yesu akalongaje hino, <verse eid="LUK 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />“Kwavaga na vanu vavili wo vakopite magobole kwa munu yoankopetsa. Yumwe adayilwaga dinali miya tsihanu, yihwana na mahombo ga kukola katsi siku miya na tsihanu na va kavili adayilwaga dinali hamusini, yihwana na mahombo ga kukola katsi siku hamusini. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Vavaga kulemwa kuhomba madeni gawo, yula yoanguvadaya akavahulumilaje madeni gawo veka vavili. Lelo nani ha iwo vavili yo akumugana ndalahela yula yoavakopitse?” <verse eid="LUK 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simoni akamulonjelaje Yesu, Yula yahulumilwe ideni likomi. Yesu nayo akamulonjelaje Simoni kuta, “Ulontsile finofu,” <verse eid="LUK 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Hambele akamupituchilaje mudala yula na kumulonjela Simoni kuta, “Ndawuli! Ungumuwona mudala yuno? Hontsinje munyumba yako siumelye malenga ga kukalava magulu gangu, lechelelo mudala yuno ang'alifye magulu gangu kwa manyotsi gake na kumata magulu kwa fwili tsake. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Heve siusamwise kwa kunonela, lechelelo mudala yuno salesile kunonela magulu gangu luhuma ntsinjile. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Heve siumbasile mafuta mumutwi gwangu, lechelelo mudala yuno ambasile mafuta ganya wununyililo magulu gangu. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Hoihyo ntsinguvalonjela, ahulumilwe ndongwa tsake ntsibi tsotsikantsolofu, kwasawuli andaje wugano wolofu. Lechelelo yula yoahulumilwe chidogo aganaga chidogo.” <verse eid="LUK 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Yesu akamulonjelaje mudala yula, “Uhulumilwe ndongwa tsako ntsibi.” <verse eid="LUK 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Lechelelo vanu vanji wovavaga hamwe na Yesu, vakantsaje kwiputsa vene kwa vene kuta, “Mbe, uyu munu munya ndawuli mbaka avahulumile vanu vanya ndongwa ntsibi?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Yesu akamulonjelaje mudala yula, “Litumbilo lyako likukulwise! Ubite kwa wusichimafu.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">Vadala yovilongotsaga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matayo 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Maliko 4:1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Hotsavaga kulutila ndongwa itso, Yesu akabitaje mu miji na fijiji kuvikula Ndongwa Nofu tsa wuntsajila wa Mulungu. Avaga hamwe na vala vadahitswa vake kumi na vavili, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />kaha avaga na vadala vala wovavaga vahetsitswe misoka na kuponetswa namwa tsawo na Yesu. Vadala iwo yumwe avaga Maliya yoahumye ku Majidala yoahumitswe misoka saba. <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Na Yoana muchina Kutsa mwimilitsi va nyumba ya Helode, na Sutsana na vadala vanji wolofu, vadala iwo veka vavatangaga kwa finu fyawo Yesu na vadahitswa vake.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhwano gwa muyali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:19">Matayo 13:19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Maliko 4:1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Lila lilugu lya vanu wolofu wovatsitse kuhuma chila muji kwasawuli ya kumuhulikitsa, Yesu akantsaje kulongana nawo kwa muhwano.<verse eid="LUK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />Yesu akalongaje kuta “Muyali yumwe akali ahele kumitsa nyadikwa. Hoavaga ammitsa nyadikwa itso, tsimwe tsikagwaje mung'asi tsikakanyagwaje na magulu ga vanu na kuliwa na fideje. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Nyadikwa tsinji tsikagwaje mu lilongo lya mwitalawe, hotsavaga kota, tsikafundaje kwasawuli kukavaga kuduhu wudodi. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Na nyadikwa tsinji tsikagwaje muchisati cha hamifwa, Mifwa jikakalagalaje hamwe natso, mifwa jikatsitovaje. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Nyadikwa tsinji tsikagwaje mulilongo linofu, tsikotaje na kukalagala na kulela ndalahela tsikavaje ntsolofu mala myaa, kulutila tsila ntsinji.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Hoavaga kusinda kulonga ihyo, akalongaje fikami akatyaje, “Munya mapulichilo ahulikaje.”<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chambutso cha kudahitsa kwa mihwano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Matayo 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Maliko 4:10-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Vadahitswa vake Yesu vakamuputsaje muhwano guno guna mana yachi? <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Nayo akavalonjelaje, “Henye muna nyala tsa kutsela fiho tsa wuntsajila wa Mulungu, lechelelo vanu vanji sivana kota henye iwo valonjelwaga kwa muhwano, kwasawuli navavaje vanlava valekaje kuwona, na vavaje vanhulika valekaje kwelewa.”<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu an'dadambula muhwano gwa muyali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matayo 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Maliko 4:13-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />Yesu akalongaje, “Lelo muhwano guno guna mana yino, nyadikwa tso Ndongwa tsa Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Nyadikwa tsila tsotsigweye mung'asi tsinakota vanu vala wovanhulika Ndongwa tsila, hambele lisoka linkutsa na kutegula ndongwa itso munumbula tsawo, valekaje kuva na litumbilo, valakuluswa. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Nyadikwa tsila tsotsamitsitswe mu lilongo lya mwitalawe, tsihwana na vanu vala wovanhulika ndongwa tsa Mulungu na kwanuchila kwa wusangalafu. Lechelelo ndongwa tsa Mulungu sitsingikala mu numbula tsawo, vitumbilaga kwa chipindi chidodo, manyi vajelwe valekaga litumbilo. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Nyadikwa tsila tsotsamitsitswe mumisati ja mifwa tsihwana na vanu vala wovanhulika ndongwa tsa Mulungu, lechelelo ndongwa tsa Mulungu tsanangwaga na kugatsichila mbwiniwo tsa mali, na finu fya mu inyi. Fitifitsaga lulongwa ulo lulemwe kulela mibawo. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Lechelelo nyadikwa tsila tsotsamitsitswe mulilongo linofu tsihwana na vanu wovahulikaga Ndongwa tsa Mulungu na kudita kota fyo aganaga Mulungu, kwa wugolofu wa numbula tsawo na vanya kwika, iwo kwa wukangatso wukomi vaditaga kota fyo an'gana Mulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhwano gwa lusolola lo luli mwifungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Maliko 4:21-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />“Vanu sivasaga lusolola na kulugubikitsa mu chiya awu kuluvika mwifungu. Lechelelo luvikwaga ha kabong'onyela ili luvang'alichile yovankwinjila mu nyumba iyo vaguwone mwangatsa. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Kwasawuli kuduhu chinu chochive chochifihilwe cho sichikuwoneka, awu chinu chochive chochifihilwe cho sichifuluche chitselaniche na kuva mwatsi. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Ho ihyo mwiyangalilaje hila fyomunhulika. Kwasawuli yula munya chinu akuwilwa, na yula yoalihela chinu akusukulwa mbaka chila cho anacho.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvatambula yuve na vang'olotse</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matayo 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Maliko 3:31-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Siku yimwe yuve na vang'olotse va Yesu vavaga vahele kumuwona, lechelelo vakalemwaje kufika habehi nayo, kwasawuli vanu wolofu vavaga vamupilime. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Munu yumwe akamulonjelaje Yesu hino, “Yuwo na vang'olotso vali kivala van'gana mwiwone.” <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Lechelelo Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Yuvangu na vang'olotsangu wo vala veka wovanhulikitsa Ndongwa tsa Mulungu na kudita kota fyoyin'ganika.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguying'anulila ng'ala ngomi mu bahali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matayo 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Maliko 4:35-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Siku yimwe Yesu akavalonjelaje vadahitswa vake kuta tulowoche lubali lunji lwa lilamba, “Ihyo vakakwinaje mu mutumbwi na kwantsa kulowoka ku mwambu.” <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Hovavaga mu mutumbwi Yesu akavasaje tulo, luvala lulo kukahumilaje ng'ala ngomi na kukunuga mavimbi ga malenga mbaka mutumbwi gukantsaje kumema malenga, vakavaje mu ng'oko ya kuyaga mu malenga. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Vadahitswa vake vakabitaje hono hala hoavasise Yesu, vakamulamusaje na kumulonjela, “Mutwa, Mutwa, tun'yaga.” Yesu akalamukaje, akaying'anulilaje ng'ala yila ngomi na mavimbi, na yila ng'ala ngomi yikakatukaje. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Kahi akavalonjelaje, “Litumbilo lyenyu lilikwiya?” Lechelelo vene vakavaje vapomwiche na kuva na muloto kuno vangilonjela kuta, “Mbe mwene yuno yo nani mbaka anguying'anulila ng'ala ngomi na mavimbi nafyo fingumuhulikitsa?”<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumuponetsa munu munya lisoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matayo 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Maliko 5:1-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Ihyo Yesu na vadahitswa vake vakalowokaje lilamba lya Galilaya, vakafikaje kumwambu ku inyi ya Vajelasi. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Yesu avaga kwika mu mutumbwi, akamufikaje munu yumwe munya lisoka. Kwa siku ntsolofu munu uyo siafwalaga myenda, na saikalaga mu nyumba lechelelo ikalaga kogali makabuli. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Munu uyo avaga kumuwona Yesu, akitotsaje halutalo ha Yesu na kukola fikami, “Un'gana undite chichi heve Yesu mwana va Mulungu yoali kilanga ndalahela? Ntsingusuka uleche kunetsa!” <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Kwasawuli Yesu avaga aling'anulye lisoka lila lihume mugati mwa munu yula. Lisoka ilyo lyamutovaga lwahihyo, na hala ho vamuwopaga kwa pingu mu mawoko na nyololo mu magulu na kumwamila. Lechelelo mwene adumulaga pingu tsila na nyololo na kubilimila ku mbuga. <verse eid="LUK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yesu akamuputsaje, “Heve litawa lyako nani?” Likamujibulaje, “Litawa lyangu, Hetwe tulililugu,” alontsile ihyo kwasawuli avaga na misoka myolofu. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Misoka jila jikamugongoletsaje Yesu aleche kujisindika kulyowo likomi. <verse eid="LUK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Hono iho havaga na chipinga chikomi cha migubi cho chadimwaga mulubali lwa chidunda. Duve, misoka ijo jikamugongoletsaje ajileche jinjile mu migubi jila. Nayo Yesu akajidikitsaje. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Ho ihyo misoka jila jikamuhumaje munu yula, jikinjilaje mu migubi jila, chipinga cheka chikikaje luvilo mulwisa na kwinjila mu bahali jikafwaje. <verse eid="LUK 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Vala vadimi vavaga kuwona chila chochihumye vakabilimaje, vakabitaje kuvalonjela vanu wovali ku mujini na ku fijiji. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Vanu vakatsaje kulola chila chochihumye. Hovaveye kufika hoali Yesu, vakamuwonaje munu yula yo ahumitswe misoka ikalise habehi na Yesu, afwite myenda na aponile, vanu vala vakavaje na muloto ndalahela. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Vanu veka wo valuwene lulongwa ulo vakavalonjelaje vanu iwo hila munu yula fyo aponitswe na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Kahi vanu veka va inyi ya Vajelasi vakamugongolaje Yesu awuche, kwasawuli vavaga na muloto. Duve Yesu akinjilaje mu mutumbwi akawukaje. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Chipindi Yesu an'wuka, munu yula yo ahumitswe misoka akamugongoletsaje Yesu vabitase hamwe nayo, lechelelo Yesu akamulonjelaje, <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />“Piluche kukaye kwako ukavalonjele vanu ndongwa ngomi tso akuditye Mulungu.” Ihyo munu yula akabitaje chila hono ku muji gula na kuvalonjela vanu ng'ani tsila tso amuditye Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhintsa va Jayilosi antsilipulwa na mudala amponetswa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matayo 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Maliko 5:21-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Yesu hoavaga kuwuya kuhuma ku mwambu kwa Vajelasi, vanu wolofu vakamulibulitsaje kwa wusangalo kwasawuli vavaga vangumutsindila. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Iho akatsaje munu yumwe litawa lyake Jayilosi, yo avaga chilongotsi va nyumba ya kitang'anila Vayawudi, akafugamaje ha magulu ga Yesu na kumugongoletsa abite kukaye kwake, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />kwasawuli avaga na muhintsa va wiyeka yo avaga na myaka kumi na jivili, avaga antamika ndalahela na avaga habehi na kutajika. Yesu hoavaga am'bita, lilugu lya vanu lya mutifyaga mbali tseka. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Baho havaga na mudala yoakodekaga na kuhuma danda kwa chipindi cha myaka kumi na jivili. Yo asintsile finu fyake fyeka kwa vaganga, lechelelo siaponitswe. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Akaifyatanitsaje kuhumila kuchigosi kwa Yesu, akadometsaje mwenda gwa Yesu, luvala lulo danda yila yikadugaje. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yesu akaputsaje, “Nani yo andomitse?” Vanu veka vakamukanilaje, lechelelo Petulo akalongaje, “Mutwa ihano hana vanu wolofu yo vangukutifya chila lubali.” <verse eid="LUK 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Lechelelo Yesu akalongaje, “Hana munu andomitse, kwasawuli mbwene wuvetso wangu lunyumile.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Mudala yula avaga kutsela kuta siafuluche afihame, akahumilaje kuno ankakama, akagwaje kwa kipuna ha magulu ga Yesu. Akihalaje ha vanu kuta, kwasawuli yachi mbaka alamwe kumudometsa, na hila fyoaponile wutamwa wake. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Muhintsa vangu litumbilo lyako likuponitse. Ubite kwa wusichimafu.” <verse eid="LUK 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Yesu hoavaga ang'acha kulonga, akatsaje mutantsi kuhuma kukaye ya Jayilosi yula chilongotsi va nyumba ya kwitang'anila Vayawudi, akamulonjelaje Jayilosi, “Uleche kumukoda Mudahitsi, muhintsa vako mwanga atajiche.” <verse eid="LUK 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Lechelelo Yesu hoavaga kuhulika lulongwa ulo akamulonjelaje Jayilosi, “Witumbile hela, uleche kuwona muloto, muhitsa vako akuvamumi.” <verse eid="LUK 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Yesu ho avaga kufika ha nyumba ya Jayilosi, akavalemetsaje vanu vanji kwinjila hamwe na mwene, lechelelo inje na Petulo, na Yakobo, na Yohana, hamwe na dade na yuve va muhintsa yula. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Muda ugo vanu veka vavembaga na kumulomboketsela muhintsa yula. Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Muleche kuvemba! Muhintsa yuno siafweye ndaya ila avasise.” <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Vanu vakamuhekaje Yesu kwasawuli vatselaga kuta yula muhintsa afweye. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Lechelelo Yesu akamwibataje liwoko, na akamulonjelaje fikami kuta, “Muhintsa vangu lamuche.” <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Wumi wake yula muhintsa wukamupiluchilaje, nayo akinukaje luvala lulo. Yesu akavalonjelaje valeli vake vamupele chinu cha kulya. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Valeli vake vakatinukaje ndalahela, lechelelo Yesu akavalemetsaje valahogola vamulonjele munu yoyuve ndongwa tsila tsiltsotsihumye.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvatuma vala kumi na vavili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matayo 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Maliko 6:7-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Yesu akavachemaje hohamwe vatumi vala kumi na vavili, akavapelaje mamulaka na wuwetso wa kuhumya misoka jeka na kuponetsa matamwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Kahi akavatumaje vabite vakavavikulile vanu ndongwa tsa Wuntsajila wa Mulungu na kuvaponetsa vatamwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Akavalonjelaje, “Homukuva muli mulujendo mulekaje kutegula chochive, yive ng'weku, awu libeji, awu yive libumunda, awu magobole, na guve mwenda gwa kubadila. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Kaye yoyive yomukulibulitswa mwikalaje baho mbaka ho mukuwuka ku muji ugo. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Manyi vanu valeme kuvalibulitsa, muhumaje mu muji ugo, homukuva munhuma mukung'unaje lingundi kuvalajila kuta hetwe tulimuduhu kwa chochive chochikuvapata, ili viwukaje.” <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Duve vala kumi na vavili vakantsaje lujendo, vakakolelaje mufijiji kuno vanvikula Ndongwa Nofu tsa Mulungu na kuvaponetsa vatamwa chila hono.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Helode ankuva na muhwehwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matayo 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maliko 6:14-29</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Muntsajila Helode mutavala va Galilaya akahulikaje fila fyeka fyofihumye. Akavaje na mahotso molofu, kwasawuli kwavaga na vanu wovalongaga, Yohana mubatitsi atsilipuche. <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Lechelelo vamwe vatijilaga kuta Eliya atuhumye, na vamwe vakatijilaje kuta yumwe va valoli va katali va Mulungu akuva atsilipuche. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Lechelelo Helode akalongaje hino, “Yohana ntsamukopwe kwa kumudumula mutwi. Lechelelo yuno yo nani yo ntsinhulika ndongwa tsake?” Akiwiniwaje kumuwona.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvalisa vanu Elufu tsihanu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matayo 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maliko 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohana 6:1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Vala vatumi vavaga kuwuya, vakamulonjelaje Yesu finu fyeka fyovadisile. Yesu Akavategulaje na kubita nawo kwakifiha mbaka ku muji gwa Betisayida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Hala vanu wolofu vavaga kutsela koahele, vakamufwataje. Akavalibulitsaje na kulongana nawo Ndongwa tsa Wuntsajila wa Mulungu na akavaponetsaje veka wovaganaga kuponetswa matamwa gawo. <verse eid="LUK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Litsuva ho lyavaga linkwantsa kusota vala vatumi kumi na vavili vakabitaje kwa Yesu na kumulonjela, “Uvalaje vanu ili vabite kufijiji fya habehi na migunda, ili vakasache filyo na hono ha kuvasa, kwasawuli hano hotuli tuli ku mbuga.” <verse eid="LUK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Lechelelo Yesu akavajibulaje, “Muvapele henye filyo.” Nawo vakamulonjelaje, “Tunago mabumunda gahanu na somba tsivili duve. Awu tubite tukagule filyo fya kuvakwila vanu veka vano?” <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Vanu yo vavaga hono hala vavaga valume elufu tsihanu hino. Yesu akavalonjelaje vadahitswa vake, “Muvalonjele vanu vikale filundo filundo fya vanu hamusini hamusini.” <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Vadahitswa vakaditaje kota fyovalagitswe, vanu veka vakikalisaje. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Kahi Yesu akategulaje mabumunda gahanu na somba tsivili, akagalamilaje kilanga na kumulumba Mulungu na kumutsumitsa na kugamegasa, akavapelaje vala vadahitswa vake nawo vakavapelaje vanu. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Vanu veka vakalyaje na kiguta, nawo vatumi vakakong'asaje fila filyo fyofisije, vakamemyaje fitangula kumi na fivili.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo angumutambula kuta Yesu yo Chilisito muhagulwa va Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Matayo 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Maliko 8:27-29</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Siku yimwe Yesu avaga ansuka hono hawiyeka, na avavaga hamwe na vadahitswa vake nawo, Yesu akavaputsaje, “Mbe, vanu vanlonga kuta heni ntsili nani?” <verse eid="LUK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Vadahitswa vakamujibulaje, “Heve yo Yohana mubatitsaji, na vanji vanlonga kuta heve yo Eliya, na vamwe vanlonga kuta heve uliyumwe va valoli va Mulungu yo atsilipuche luhuma ko vafweye.” <verse eid="LUK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Yesu akavaputsaje, “Na henye nanye, munlonga kuta heni ntsi nani?” Petulo akamulonjelaje, “Heve yo Chilisito muhagulwa va Mulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anlonga hila fyo akukopolwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Matayo 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30">Maliko 8:30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:1">9:1</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Kaha Yesu akavafundaje valahogola kumulonjela munu yoyuve lulongwa ulo. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Yesu akawilaje kuvalonjela, “Yin'ganika mwana va munu akodeche ndalahela na kukanwa na vavina va Chiyawudi na vavina va vatawula nambiko na vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa. Nayo akuganika akopolwe, lechelelo siku ya kadatu akutsilipulwa.” <verse eid="LUK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Kahi akavalonjelaje vanu veka yo vavaga hono hala, “Munu yoyuve yo an'gana afwate heni an'ganika itsile mwene na afwate heni chila siku. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Kwasawuli munu yo an'gana kuwukulusa wumi wake, akuwuyatsa, lechelelo munu yoyuve yo akuwuyatsa wumi wake kwasawuli ya heni, akuwukulusa. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Mbe, munu akupata chinu chachi manyi apate ndongwa tseka tsa mu inyi, lechelelo hambele ananje wumi wake? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Munu yoyuve yo akumbonela nyoni heni na madahitso gangu, nayo Mwana va Munu akumuwonela nyoni ho akutsa mu wumelemo wake na wumelemo wa Dade na wumelemo wa vatantsi vahagulwa va kilanga va Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli, kuna vamwe vimile baha sivakufwa mbaka vawuwone wuntsajila wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu an'galuka kumiho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Matayo 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Maliko 9:2-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Tsikavaje kulutila kota siku nane luhuma ho avaga kulonga ihyo, Yesu akavategulaje Petulo, na Yakobo na Yohana, akabitaje nawo kuchidunda kusala. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Hoavaga ansuka, wuwoneko wake wa kumiho wukamelamaje tswee, na myenda jake jikamelemaje ndalahela. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Luvala lulo vakavawonaje vanu vavili wovavaga Musa na Eliya, valonganaga nayo. <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />Vanu iwo vawonekanaga na wumelemo, vavaga vanlongana na Yesu ndongwa tsa chifo chake chochikuhumila ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Petulo na vayage vavaga tulo sito, lechelelo hovakavaga kulamuka vakawuwonaje wumelemo wa Yesu na vala vanu vavili wovavaga vimile hamwe nayo. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Vanu iwo Musa na Eliya hovavaga kuwuka, Petulo akamulonjelaje Yesu, “Mutwa, yika kuva finofu twikale hano, duve tutsenje fyuwo fidatu, chimwe cha heve, chimwe cha Musa na chimwe cha Eliya,” Lechelelo Petulo satselaga choanlonga. <verse eid="LUK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Petulo hoavaga anlonga ihyo, luvala lulo lifuluka likahumilaje na kuvagubikitsa, nawo vakawonaje muloto hala hovavaga kwinjila mwifuluka ilyo. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Likahulikwaje litsi luhuma mwifuluka lila lyo lyalongaga, “Yuno yo mwanangu mwendi yo ntsimuhagwe, mumuhulikitse mwene.” <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Litsi ilyo lyavaga kulonga ihyo, vakamuwonaje Yesu asije aliyena. Vadahitswa vala vakaluvikaje lulongwa ulo munumbula tsawo, sivamulonje munu yoyuve lulongwa ulo lovaluwene.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumuponetsa mukwamitsi munya lisoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Matayo 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Maliko 9:14-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Hamilawu iyage Yesu na vadahitswa vake hovavaga vankwika kuhuma kuchidunda, akitang'anaje na lilugu ikomi lya vanu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Munu yumwe ha lilugu lila lya vanu, akakolaje kutijila, “Mudahitsi, ntsingukugongola utse umulole mwanangu, mwene yo mwanangu va wiyeka. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Kwasawuli lisoka limwinjilaga na kumudita ayove, na kaha limugwisaga chintsilisa, na kuno ahumaga lifulo kumulomo, ilyo lisoka limukodaga silimulekaga ndaya. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Ntsivasusile vadahitswa vako valihetse ilyo lisoka vakalemwaje.” <verse eid="LUK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Henye chilelo chibi na chochigaya litumbilo! Ngikala na henye mbaka hanili iho ho mukunumbila?” Iho Yesu akamulonjelaje munu yula, “Mulete hano mwanago.” <verse eid="LUK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Hala mukwamitsi yula hoavaga am'bita kwa Yesu, lisoka lila likamugwisaje kwa chintsilisa. Lechelelo Yesu akaling'anulilaje, akamuponetsaje mukwamitsi yula, na kumupilula kwa dade. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Vanu veka vakatinuswaje na wuvina wukomi wa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesu an'wila kulonga kuta akufwa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Matayo 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Maliko 9:30-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Vanu vala hovavaga vang'acha vali mumutinuso gwa ndongwa tsila tsadisile, Yesu akavalonjelaje vadahitswa vake, <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />“munyulikitse finofu chonguvalonjela sambi. Mwana va Munu am'bita kuvikwa mu mawoko ga vanu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Lechelelo vene vadahitswa sivatselaga chila cho alongaga Yesu. Lulongwa ulo lwavaga lwa lufiho ili valeche kulutsela, nawo vakogopaje kumuwutsa ndongwa tsa wulontsi ulo.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nani yo akuva muvina</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matayo 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maliko 9:33-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Vadahitwa va Yesu vakatsaje kwisumwana vene kwa vene na kwiwutsa kuta nani yoakuva muvina hagati hetu. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Lechelelo Yesu agatselaga mahotso gawo, nayo akamutolaje mwana na kumuvika habehi na mwene. <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />Kaha akavalonjelaje, “Munu yoyuve yo akumwanuchila mwana kota yuno kwasawuli ya heni akuva antsanuche heni, na yoyuve yo antsanuche heni akuva amwanuche mwene yo anumile. Kwasawuli yula yo mudodo ndalahela hagati henyu, uyo yo muvina kulutila veka.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Munu yo sinambe mutelane alihamwe na henye</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Maliko 9:38-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Yohana akalongaje, “Mutwa, tumuwene munu anhetsa lisoka kwa litawa lyako, tukamulemetsaje kwasawuli mwene sialihamwe na hetwe.” <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Lechelelo Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Mulekaje kumulemetsa, kwasawuli munu yo sinambe mutelane alilubali lwenyu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vanu va ku muji gwa Samaliya vanlema kumulibulitsa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Chipindi cha Yesu kutegulwa kubita kilanga kwa Mulungu hochavaga chilihabehi, mwene akagwadilaje kubita ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Akavatumaje vanu vamulongole, nawo vakabitaje ku chijiji chimwe cha Samaliya, vamuvichile chang'ani chila chinu cho chin'ganika. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Lechelelo vanyakaye va muji ugo vakalemaje kumulibulitsa kwasawuli vatselaga kuta am'bita ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Vadahitswa va Yesu, Yakobo na Yohana hovavaga kuwona ihyo, vakalongaje, “Mutwa, un'gana tusuche moto gwiche kuhuma kilanga ili guvalalitse?” <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Lechelelo Yesu akavapituchilaje vadahitswa vake na kuvang'anulila. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Ihyo Yesu na vadahitswa vake vakabitaje ku chijiji chinji.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hila fyo yin'ganika kuva mudahitswa va Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Matayo 8:19-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Hovavaga valimulujendo, munu yumwe akamulonjelaje Yesu, “Ngukufwata kokuve koukubita.” <verse eid="LUK 9:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Micheve jina malika, na fideje fina fifulila, lechelelo Mwana va Munu alihela hono ha kulambalika mutwi gwake.” <verse eid="LUK 9:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Kahi Yesu akamulonjelaje munu yunji, “Ufwate heni.” Munu uyo akamulonjelaje Yesu, “Mutwa, undeche taha ngamutsiche dada vangu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yesu akamulonjelaje yula munu, “Valeche wovafweye vavatsiche vanu wovafweye, ila heve ubite ukawuvikule Wuntsajila wa Mulungu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Munu yunji akamulonjelaje Yesu kuta, “Ngukufwata, lechelelo ntsinsuka undeche taha ngilaje kwa vanu va mukaye yangu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Munu yoyuve yo anlima na kaha ampituka kumbele, uyo siakufwaya kuwuntsajila wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvatuma sabini na vavili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Hoavaga kusinda ndongwa itso, Mutwa akavahagulaje vanu vanji sabini na vavili, akavatumaje vavili vavili kwa chila chijiji na muji na chila hono ho aganaga kubita hambele. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Fya kubeta fyolofu, lechelelo vabetaji vadodo. Ho ihyo mumusuche Mutwa va mbeta, ili avasindiche vabetaji mu mugunda gwake. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Lelo mubitaje kuno mutselaje kuta ntsinguvatuma kota vana ng'olo hagati ha ngwami. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Mulekaje kutegula magobole, awu myenda, awu filatu fya kubadila, na mulekaje kumusamusa munu yoyuve mung'asi. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Manyi mwinjile mu nyumba yoyive, mwantsaje kulonga hino, ‘Wusichimafu wuve mu nyumba yino.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Manyi have na munu yo anguwugana wusichimafu, wusichimafu wenu wukuva hamwe na mwene, lechelelo manyi alihaduhu wusichimafu wenyu wukuvapiluchila henye. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Mwikalaje mu nyumba yiyo na kulya na kung'wa fila fyo vakuvapela, kwasawuli munu yo ankola katsi an'ganika mahombo gake. Mulekaje kuhama kuhuma nyumba yimwe na kubita mu nyumba yinji. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Manyi mufiche mu muji goguve, na vanu vanguvalibulitsa, mulyaje chovanguvapela. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Muvaponetsaje vatamwa yovali uko, na kuvalonjela vanu kuta, ‘Wuntsajila wa Mulungu wulihabehi.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Lechelelo manyi mwinjile mung'asi yoyive, manyi valeme kuvalibutsa muwuche, na ho mukuva munlutila mung'asi tsawo mulongaje, <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />‘Nambe mingundi ja muji gwenyu jojinanahye mu magulu getu, tunguvakung'unila henye. Lechelelo mutselaje kuta Wuntsajila wa Mulungu wuli habehi.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Ntsinguvalonjela nachene kuta ha siku ya wuhigo, vanu va muji ugo vakuva na ng'odeko ngomi ndalahela kulutila vanu va muji gwa Sodoma.”<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vakudutsa vanu yo vakumulema Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Matayo 11:20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />“Mukudutsa henye vanu va ku muji gwa Kolatsini! Na henye yo mungikala ku Betisayida! Kwasawuli mujiwene mitinuso myolofu, lechelelo ndajilo itso tsika tsive tsidisilwe ku miji ja Tilo na Sidoni vaka kusuka kuhulumilwa na kuleka ndongwa tsawo ntsibi. Vaka kulajila kuta valesile ndongwa tsawo ntsibi kwa kufwala magunila na kwibaka michifu. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Lechelelo siku ya wuhigo yikuva mefu kwa vanu va Tilo na Sidoni kwikangatsa ng'odeko tsawo kulutila henye. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Henye vanu va muji gwa Kapelinawumu, Mbe, mukudutswa mbaka kilanga kwa Mulungu? Ndaya, Mukwiswa mbaka ku inyi ya vanu yo vafweye.” <verse eid="LUK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Kaha Yesu akalongaje vadahitswa vake kuta, “Munu yo akuvahulika henye, akuva an'nyulika heni, na munu yo anguvalema henye akuva an'ndema heni. Munu yo an'ndema heni akuva amulemile mwene yo anumile.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwuya kwa vala sabini na vavili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Vala sabini na vavili vakawuyaje kuno vana wusangalo. Vakalongaje, “Mutwa, nambe misoka jivahumile vanu hala ho tujing'anulye kwa wuwetso wako.” <verse eid="LUK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Yesu akavajibulaje, “Ngaliwene Lihoka fyo linkugwa kuhuma kilanga kota lwenje lwa liladu. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Yesu akavalonjelaje vadahitswa vake kuta, ntsivapelye mamulaka ga kusigana ntsoka na dondi, na wuvetso weka wa Lihoka, na kuduhu chinu chochive chochikuvatetsa. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Ihyo mulekaje kusangalala kwasawuli misoka jinguvahulika na kuhuma, lechelelo musangalalaje kwasawuli matawa genyu gandikwe mu chitabu cha wumi kilanga kwa Mulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ansangalala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Matayo 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Luvala lulo Yesu hoakavaga amemile Muhe va Mulungu akasangalalaje na akalongaje, “Ntsingukulumba Dada, Mutwa va kilanga na Inyi, kwasawuli uvafihile ndongwa tsino vanu vanya ntselo na nyala, nave ukavagubulye vana vadodo. Enaa! Kwasawuli ihi fyo ukaganile heve. <verse eid="LUK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />Dada vangu andisile mbetse kudita finu fyeka. Kuduhu munu yoyuve yo amutsele Mwana ila Dade, na kuduhu yo amutsele Dade ila Mwana, na yula yo Mwana an'gana kumugubulila.” <verse eid="LUK 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Kahi Yesu akavapituchilaje vadahitswa vake na kuvalonjela, “Aditilwe wuwuya na Mulungu munu yula yo angutsiwona ndongwa tsino tso mungutsiwona! <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Ntsinguvalonjela, valolaji wolofu na vantsajila viwiniwaga kufiwona fila fyo mungufiwona, lechelelo sivafiwene, na kaha viwiniwaga kuhulika fila fyo munhulika henye, lechelelo sivafihuliche.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhwano gwa munu va ku Samaliya munya wugano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Hambele akimaje mudahitsi va madahitso ga Musa akaganaga amujele Yesu, akamuwutsaje, “Mudahitsi, nditaje chinu chachi ili ntsiwupate wumi wowugaya wudugo?” <verse eid="LUK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yesu akamuputsaje,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:26">“Hounsoma malajitso ga Musa un'tsela chinu chachi?” <verse eid="LUK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Yula mudahitsi va malajitso ga Musa akamulonjelaje, “Umugane Mutwa Mulungu vako kwa numbula yako yeka, na kwa muhe gwako gweka, na kwa ludali lwako lweka, na kwa nyala tsako tseka, kaha, ‘Umugane na munu yoalihabehi na heve kota fyo ungigana heve.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Ujibwe finofu! Udite hihyo, nave ukwikala finofu kota hila fyo an'gana Mulungu.” <verse eid="LUK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Lechelelo yula mudahitsi va malajitso ga Musa akaganaje kwilajila kuta mwene ana ntselo, ihyo akamuwutsaje Yesu, “Munu va habehi na heni yo nani?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yesu akamujibulaje, “Munu yumwe avaga anhuma ku Yelusalemu am'bita ku Yeliko, mung'asi akitang'anaje na vawumiyani, vakamuwopolaje myenda, na vakamutovaje na kumuleka baho kuno alihabehi na kufwa.” <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Mutawula nambiko yumwe akalutilaje mung'asi yiyila, ho avaga kumuwona akamutyegaje na kukola kulubali. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Kaha munu yumwe mutantsi va mutawula nambiko ho avaga anlutila hono iho, ho avaga kumuwona akamutyegaje na kukola kulubali. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Lechelelo munu yumwe va inyi ya Samaliya ho avaga mulujendo, akafikaje hono hala hoali munu yula, ho avaga kumuwona akamuwonelaje lusungu. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Akafikaje hoali munu yula, akamuhofukaje fikong'o fyake na kumubaka difwayi na mafuta, kaha akamuwopaje fitambala mufikong'o, akamukwinitsaje mu ntsove yake, akabitaje nayo mbaka mu nyumba ya kuvasa vajentsi ili vamutuntse. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Hamilawu iyage akatolaje fipande fivili fya madini ga galama ngomi, akamupelaje yula munya nyumba ya vajentsi na kumulonjela, “Wendelele kumutuntsa munu yuno chochive chochikulutila honguva kuwuya ngukuhomba.” <verse eid="LUK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Kahi Yesu akaputsaje, “Fyo unhotsa heve hagati ha vanu iwo vadatu, nani munu yo vahabehi na yula yoatofilwe na vanu vala vawumiyani?” <verse eid="LUK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Yula mudahitsi va malajitso ga Musa akalongaje, “Yula yoamuwon'ye lusungu yo munu va habehi.” Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Na heve nave ubite ukadite hihyo.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvajendela Malita na Maliyamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Yesu na vadahitswa vake hovavaga mulujendo, vakinjilaje mu chijiji chimwe cho ikalaga mudala yoanchemwa Malita, nayo akamulibulitsaje mu nyumba yake. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Malita avaga na mung'olotse yo anchemwa Maliyamu, uyo Maliyamu avaga ikalise ha magulu ga Yesu kuno angumuhulikitsa. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Lechelelo Malita atindilikaga na finu fyolofu, ihyo Malita akabitaje hoali Yesu na kumulonjela, “Mutwa! Mbe, sinambe ulole mung'olotsangu fyo andechye katsi tseka ntsi yena? Mulonjele atse anangilitse.”<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Lechelelo Mutwa akamulonjelaje, “Malita, Malita, untindilika kwa finu fyolofu, <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />cho chin'ganika chinu chimwe duve, na Maliyamu ahagwe chinu chinofu, na chinu icho kuduhu munu yo afuluche amusukule.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvadahitsa vadahitswa vake kusuka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Matayo 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Siku yimwe Yesu avaga hono ha wiyeka ansuka. Hoavaga kusinda kusuka, mudahitswa vake yumwe akamulonjelaje, “Mutwa tudahitse kusuka kota hila Yohana mubatitsi fyo avadahitse vadahitswa vake.” <verse eid="LUK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Ho mukuva munsuka mulongaje hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">‘Dada vetu yo uli kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">Litawa lyako lihesimilwe na kuva lya wiyeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">Wuntsajila wako wutse.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Utupele chilyo chetu cha chila siku.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Utuhulumile ndongwa tsetu ntsibi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">kota hila na hetwe fyo tunguvahulumila wo vatukosye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">Lekaje kutusindika mu majetso.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Kaha Yesu akavalonjelaje vadahitswa vake, “Nani yoali hagati henyu yoana muyage, nayo yula muyage akatsaje hachilo na gati mu nyumba yake, na kumulonjela kuta, ‘Muyangu, ung'opetse mabumunda gadatu ngukuhomba, <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />kwasawuli mung'olotsangu atsitse kuhuma kulujendo, na heni tsilihela chilyo cha kumupela!’ <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Kaha yula yoali mu nyumba amujibule kutijila, ‘Uleche kung'oda! Mwanga maje lwitsi, heni na vanangu tuvasise. Sifuluche ndamuche ngupele mabumunda.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Ntsinguvalonjela nachene kuta, na yivaje munu uyo siakulamuka amupele igo mabumunda uyo muyage, lechelelo kwasawuli ya hila fyo angumusuka lwahihyo, akulamuka amupele chinu chochive choan'gana kwasawuli siagotswe kumusuka. <verse eid="LUK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Ihyo ntsinguvalonjela kuta, musuche na henye mupelwa, musache na henye mukupata, muhodese na henye mukudindulilwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Kwasawuli munu yoyuve yo ansuka apelwaga, na munu yoyuve yo ansaka apataga, na chila yo anhodetsa adindulilwaga. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Mbe, kuna dada vachi, mwanage amusuche somba, akumupela ntsoka badili ya somba? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Awu manyi asuche likang'a akumupela dondi? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Manyi henye yo muli vanu vabi mufitsele kuvapela vana venyu finu finofu. Lechelelo Dada venyu va kilanga akulutila ndalahela kuvapela Muhe va Mulungu vala veka wovangumusuka.”<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Belitsebuli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Matayo 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Maliko 3:20-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Siku yimwe Yesu ho avaga angulihetsa lisoka luhuma mwa munu yo avaga anlemwa kulonga. Duve lila lisoka ho lyavaga kumuhuma, munu yula yo avaga anlemwa kulonga akantsaje kulonga. Vanu veka vakapomokaje. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Lechelelo vanu vamwe vakalongaje, “Angujivinga misoka kwa wuvetso wa Belitsebuli, yula muvina va misoka jeka.” <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Vanu vamwe vakamujelaje Yesu, vakaganaje avaditile ndajilo tsa kuhuma kilanga kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Lechelelo kwasawuli Yesu akatselaje mahotso gawo akavalonjelaje, “Chila wuntsajila manyi wusumwane wene kwa wene wukugwa, hihyo na vanu va kaye yimwe manyi vikale kwa kutelana vene kwa vene, vanu iwo vakutagalila. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Manyi wuntsajila wa Lihoka wusumane wene kwa wene, wuntsajila wake wukwima chinyandawuli? Ntsinguvalonjela hino kwasawuli henye munlonga kuta heni ntsingujihumya misoka kwa wuvetso wa Belitsebuli. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Lelo manyi heni ntsingujihumyamisoka kwa wuvetso wa Belitsebuli, vatantsi venyu nawo vahumyaga kwa wuvetso wa nani? Kwasawuli iyo iwo wo vakuvahiga. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Lechelelo manyi yive heni ntsingujihumya misoka kwa wuvetso wa Mulungu, mutsele kuta wuntsajila wa Mulungu mwanga wufisile.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />“Munu munya ludali munya fitovelo fyake fyeka ho ankwamila nyumba yake, finu fyake fyeka fivaga hihilaga kota fyo an'gana. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Lechelelo manyi atse munu munya ludali na kumusuma, akumusukula fitovelo fyake fyeka fyo angihuvila na kutegula finu fila fyeka na kutsigavasa. <verse eid="LUK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />Munu yoyuve yo sinambe ihantse na heni alitebe na heni, na munu yoyuve yo sinambe akong'ase hamwe na heni uyo antagalitsa.<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwuya kwa misoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Matayo 12:43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />“Lisoka manyi livingwe luhuma mugati mwa munu, likalaga hono ho hagaya malenga na kusaka hono ha kwesela. Lechelelo manyi lileche kuhawona lilonjelaga hino, ‘Ngupiluchila mu nyumba yangu yo ngikalaga.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Nalyo holikuva lifisile na kuyifika nyumba yila yifyajilwe na kupambwa finofu. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Ihyo libitaga kujitola misoka jinji saba mibi kulutila lyene, najo jinjilaga na kwikala mugati mwa munu, na muwudugo hali ya munu uyo yivaga ntsibi kulutila yila ya hamutalo.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wuwuya wunofu kuhuma kwa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Yesu hoavaga anlonga ndongwa itso, mudala yumwe yoali hala ha vanu wolofu akalongaje fikami kuta, “Aditilwe wuwuya na Mulungu mudala yo akuletsile na kukong'etsa!” <verse eid="LUK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Nayo Yesu akamujibulaje, “Vaditilwe wuwuya ndalahela na Mulungu vala wo vanhulikitsa ndongwa tsa Mulungu na kudita hila fyoyin'ganika.”<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chilelo cho ching'ana ndajilo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Matayo 12:38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Vanu wolofu fyo vavaga vankongetseka, Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Chilelo chino chibi, chochinsaka ndajilo sichikupelwa ndajilo yoyive, ila ndajilo ya Yona. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Kota hila Yona fyo aveye ndajilo kwa vanu va muji gwa Ninavi, ho hihyo Mwana va Munu fyo akuva ndajilo kwa chilelo chino. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Mutsajila mudala kuhuma ku inyi ya Seba akwima muwuhigo hamwe na vanu va chilelo chino, nayo akuvahiga kuta vadisile wubi, kwasawuli mwene ajentsile luhuma kutali atse ahulikitse ntselo tsa muntsajila Selemani, na hano hana muvina kulutila Selemani. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Siku ya wuhigo vanu va muji gwa Ninavi vakwima na hamwe na vanu va chilelo chino na kuvahiga, kwasawuli vene vamupituchilye Mulungu ho vavaga kuhulika mbikulo ya Yona. Na hano hana muvina kulutila Yona!”<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lusolola lwa Muvili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Matayo 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />Yesu akalongaje kuta, “Kuduhu munu yo asaga lusolola na kuluvika kifungu awu mugati mulidebe. Lechelelo yivikwaga hilaga ili yivang'alichile wovankwinjila mu nyumba vavetse kuwona. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Miho gako go lusolola lwa muvili gwako. Manyi miho gako gave mumi, muvili gwako gweka gukwangatsilwa, lechelelo manyi miho gako gave mabofu, muvili gwako gweka gukuva na jitsa. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Ihyo wiyangalile, mwangatsa goguli mugati mwako guleche kuva jitsa. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Manyi muvili gwako gweka guna mwangatsa, na haduhu hono hohave hanya jitsa, duve ukuva na mwangatsa kota hila lusolola fyo lung'alikaga.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvang'anulila Mafwalisayo na vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matayo 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Maliko 12:38-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Yesu hoavaga kusinda kulonga ihyo, Mufwalisayo yumwe akamulibulitsaje Yesu chilyo ku nyumba yake, akabitaje akikalisaje na kulya chilyo. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Lechelelo Mufwalisayo yula akapomokaje ho avaga kuwona Yesu ankulya bila kukalava. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Mutwa akamulonjelaje, “Henye Mafwalisayo muhofugaga chikombe na bakuli mwivala, lechelelo mugati mumemile wuhatufu na wubi. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Henye mulivapuva! Mbe, Mulungu yo avadisile kivala kaha si yoyuyo yo avadisile na mugati? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Ihyo mutawule kwa vagayu finu fila finofu fyo munafyo mugati mwenyu kwa numbula ntselu, na henye mukudichilwa kumufugamila Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />Lechelelo mukudutsa henye Mafwalisayo, kwasawuli simunguvaditila vanu ndongwa nofu na kumugana Mulungu. Lechelelo mungumutawulila lifungu limwe hata mu mafungu ga finu fidodo kota ndugwa na mboga tsa mahamba na filyo. Mun'ganika kuvaditila vanu vanji finofu na kumugana Mulungu hamwe na kutawula lifungu limwe mu mafungu kumi. <verse eid="LUK 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />Mukudutsa henye Mafwalisayo, kwasawuli mun'gana kwikalila figoda fya kutalo mu nyumba tsa kitang'anila Vayawudi, na kusamuswa na vanu mwivala na mu nyumba tsa kitang'anila Vayahudi. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Mukudutsa henye Mafwalisayo, kwasawuli muveye kota makabuli gosinambe gawoneche, na vanu vajenda mwilanga bila kutsela.” <verse eid="LUK 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Mudahitsi yumwe va madahitso ga Musa akamujibulaje Yesu, “Mudahitsi ho unlonga ndongwa tsino tsa Mafwalisayo ungutukumulanga na hetwe.” <verse eid="LUK 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Mukudutsa henye vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa, kwasawuli munguvatwika vanu mitsigo misito jovanlemwa kwitwika, na henye munlemwa kwinula na kuvatangilitsa nambe kwa chala chimwe. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Mukudutsa henye, kwasawuli mun'tsenjela makabuli ga valoli va Mulungu wo vafweye kwa kukopolwa na vadada venyu. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Hoihyo mun'woneka kuta muli likuga limwe na vadada venyu. Kwasawuli vene vavakopwe valoli va Mulungu, na henye mungugatsenjela makabuli gawo, munkakamalila kutajika kwawo, kuno sinambe mufwate malajitso go valontsile. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Lelo kwasawuli ya lulongwa luno, Mulungu kwa ntselo tsake akalontsile hino, ‘Lave nguvatumila valoli va Mulungu na vatumi, nawo vakukopolwa vamwinga na vamwe vakuvakoda.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Ihyo chilelo chino chikuhigwa kwasawuli ya kukopolwa kwa valoli va Mulungu, yo vakopolilwe luhuma kuwubwa kwa inyi. <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />Luhuma kukopolwa kwa Habeli mbaka kwa Tsakaliya va Mulungu yo vamukopwe hoavaga hagati ha hono kutawulila nambiko tsa Mulungu na Nyumba ya Mulungu. Enaa. Ntsinguvalonjela nachene kuta chilelo chino chikuhigwa kwasawuli ya ndongwa itso tseka. <verse eid="LUK 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />Mukudutsa henye vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa, kwasawuli muvalemitse vanu kumutsela Mulungu. Henye vene simwamutselite Mulungu na vala yo vaganije kumutsela Mulungu muvalemitse.” <verse eid="LUK 11:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Yesu ho avaga anwuka hala, Mafwalisayo hamwe na vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa, vakantsaje kumuvipitsa na kumuhunganga kwa kumuwutsa mbutso ntsolofu, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />ili vapate kumudaditsa kukolela mu ndongwa tsake, ili vamuhije.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvang'anulila vanu vapunganitsi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Matayo 10:26-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Luvala ulo lilugu lya vanu vavaga vakong'ine mbaka vakantsaje kikanyaga, Yesu akantsaje kulonga na vadahitswa vake, akalongaje, “Mwiyangalilaje muleche kuviga Mafwalisayo na uwo wupunganitsi. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Chila lulongwa lolugubikitswe lukugubulwa, awu loluli mufiho lukugubulwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Ihyo chila chinu chomulontsile mu gitsa chikuhulikwa hamunyi. Chila chochipwepwitwe kugati, chikuvikulwa helu.<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoan'ganika kogopwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Matayo 10:28-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />“Ntsinguvalonjela henye vanu va habehi na heni, mulekaje kuva na muloto na vala wovankopola muvili, hovakuva vavakopwe sivafuluche vavadite chinu chinji. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Lechelelo nguvalajila yula yomun'ganika kuva na muloto nayo, muvaje na muloto na yula yoafuluche akopole muvili na hambele ana wuvetso wa kuvadibula mu moto gosinambe kutsimiche siku tseka tsotsigaya wudugo. Ntsinguvalonjela nachene, muvaje na muloto na uyo! <verse eid="LUK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Mun'tsela kuta ng'unda tsihanu tsigutswaga kwa galama ndodo ndalahela, Lechelelo kuduhuli ng'unda yoyive yo yikusemwa na Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Mulekaje kuva na muloto henye yo muli chiba kulutila itso ng'unda ntsolofu, hata fwili tsenyu tsa mitwi jenyu tsivalilwe.<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumuvikula na kumulema Chilisito</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Matayo 10:32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10:19-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />“Ntsinguvalonjela kuta, munu yoyuve yo akuvikula halutalo ha vanu kuta alihamwe na heni, Mwana va Munu nayo akumuvikula halutalo ha vatantsi va kilanga va Mulungu kuta munu uyo alihamwe na mwene. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Lechelelo munu yoyuve yo akundema halutalo ha vanu, nayo Mwana va Munu akumukana halutalo ha vatantsi va kilanga va Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Chila munu yo akulonga lulongwa lubi kwa Mwana va Munu akuhulumilwa, lechelelo munu yoyuve yo akulonga lulongwa lwa kumuliga Muhe va Mulungu siakuhulumilwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />Hovakuvasindika mu nyumba tsa kitang'anila Vayawudi, na halutalo ha vavina na vantsajila, mulekaje kuhotsa chila cho mukujibula. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Kwasawuli Muhe va Mulungu akuvadahitsa chila cho mukuganika kulonga.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhwano gwa mufuchifu mupuva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Munu yumwe ha lilugu lya vanu akamulonjelaje Yesu, “Mudahitsi, umulonjele mung'olotsangu tugavane mali tso atuleche dada vetu” <verse eid="LUK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Muyangu, mbe, nani yoambisile heni kwimilila kugavasa mali tsenyu?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Kahi Yesu akavalonjelaje iwo vanu, “Mwiyangalilaje na chila wimi, kwasawuli wumi wa munu siwuli mu finu fyolofu fyo anafyo.” <verse eid="LUK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Kaha akavalonjelaje muhwano guno, “Kwavaga na mufuchifu yumwe yo avaga na mugunda gwake go gwavaga na filyo fyolofu ndalahela. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Mufuchifu uyo akahotsaje munumbula yake, ‘Mbe, nditaje ndawuli kwasawuli heni ntsihela hono ha kuvika filyo fyangu fyo mbetite?’ <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Akalongaje, ‘Ngudita hino, ngubomolanga kano tsangu na kutsenga ngomi ndalahela, na mumo mo nguvika filyo fyangu fyo mbetite na finu fyangu.’ <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Kaha ngidutsa hino, ‘Bee numbula yangu, unafyo finu fyolofu fyo wiviche kwa myaka myolofu. Lelo numbula yangu wesele, na ulye, na ung'we, na usangalale.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Lechelelo Mulungu akamulonjelaje, “Ulimpuva heve! Chilo chichinago um'bita kutajika. Na finu fyowiviche fikuva fya nani?” <verse eid="LUK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Yesu akasindaje kwa kulonga, “Ihyo fyo yivaga kwa munu yoangivichila finu, lechelelo valihela chinu chinofu cho anguchiwona Mulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumutumbila Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Matayo 6:25-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Kaha Yesu akavalonjelaje vadahitswa vake, “Kwasawuli iyo, mulekaje kitindilasila wumi wenyu, awu kuhotsa chomukulya, awu mivili jenyu kuta mukufwala chichi.” <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Kwasawuli chiba wumi kuliko chilyo, na chiba muvili kuliko myenda. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Mulolaje mibondwa, jo sijiyalaga, na sijibetaga na jilihela kano yoyive. Lechelelo Mulungu ajipelaga filyo. Henye muli chiba ndalahela kulutila ijo mideje! <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Mbe, nani yoali hagati henyu yo afuluche iwile myaka ja wumi wake nambe kwa lisala limwe hela? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Ino manyi mulemwe kudita lulongwa ludodo kota ulo, kwasawuli ya chichi mungigatsa kwasawuli ya finu finji. <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Muhotse wuluva hila fyo wunkalagala, siwukolaga katsi wala siwibotaga. Lechelelo ntsinguvalonjela, nambe mwene Selemani yo avaga mufuchifu siafwisilwe finofu kota wuluva uwo. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Manyi Mulungu awufwikaga ihyo wuluva wa mwivindi, wowufuluche wuve munyi guno na mitondo wuntagwa mumoto. Mbe siafuluche avaditile henye kulutila wuluva uwo, henye vagaya litumbilo!<verse eid="LUK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Henye mulekaje kwitindilasa na kuhotsa kuta, Tukulya chichi awu tukung'wa chichi. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Kwasawuli finu ifyo fyeka fivatindilivasaga vanu wo sinambe vamuhulikitse Mulungu, lechelelo Dada venyu va kilanga an'tsela kuta na henye mungufigana finu ifyo. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Lechelelo mun'ganika muwusache tandi Wuntsajila wa Mulungu, na kaha finu ifi fyeka mukupelwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kivichila wufuchifu wa kilanga kwa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Matayo 6:19-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />Mulekaje kuva na muloto henye yomuli chikundi chidodo, kwasawuli Dada venyu awene finofu kuvapela henye wuntsajila wake. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Mugutse finu fyenyu mukavapele magobole vagayu. Mwiditile mifuko ja magobole jo sinambe jisakale, na mwivichile hachiba yo sinambe yisakale kilanga kwa Mulungu. Kwasawuli uko vahitsi sivahitsaga na mifukutsi si janangaga. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Kwasawuli hala hoyili hachiba yako, hobaho hoyikuva numbula yako.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwiyangalilaje</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:42-44">Matayo 24:42-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />Yesu akalongaje, “Muvaje changani kukola katsi, na lusolola lwenyu luvaje lunkwaka. <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Muvaje kota vatantsi wo vangumutsindila mutwa vawo awuye kuhuma kulitsenjele ili vangufitse kumudindulila ho akuva ahoditse. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Vatantsi vala vakuhechelela hala mutwa vawo hoakuvafika vangumutsindila. Ntsinguvalonjela nachene, akufwala myenda ja vatatsi na kuvalonjela mwikalise hanyi na heni nguvahudumila. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Vatatsi vala vakuhechelela muntsajila vawo ho akuvafika valichang'ani na yivaje akuwuya hachilo na gati awu habehi na kwela. <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Lechelelo mutselaje lulongwa luno kuta, manyi munya kaye atsele muda gwachi go akutsa muhitsi, akakuva miho siakakuleka nyumba yake yibomolwe na muhitsi. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Na henye mun'ganika kuva chang'ani, kwasawuli Mwana va Munu akutsa muda gula go sinambe gutselaniche.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mutantsi va kihuvila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Matayo 24:45-51</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Petulo akamulonjelaje, “Mutwa, muhwano guno ungutulonjela hetwe ng'ani awu na vanu veka?”<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Mutwa akamulonjelaje, “Yo nani mutantsi vakihuvila na munya nyala, yo yula mutwa vake akumudita ave mwimilitsi va vatantsi vake veka, ili avapele chilyo chawo kwa luvala lolun'ganika? <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Akuva na wusangalo mutantsi uyo hala hoakuva kuwuya mutwa vake akumufika an'dita ihyo.” <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Ntsinguvalonjela nachene, akumuvika imilile finu fyake fyeka. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Lechelelo manyi mutantsi uyo ahotse mu numbula yake kuta, “Mutwa vangu anchelewa kuwuya, na kwantsa kuvatova vala vatantsi vanji yo anguvimilila valume na vadala, na kuno ankulya na ankungwa na an'gala, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />Ihyo mutwa va mutantsi uyo akutsa siku yo sinambe ayitsele, akumupela hatsabu ngomi ndalahela mutantsi uyo na kumuvika hamwe na vanu vabi. <verse eid="LUK 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />Mutantsi yula yoan'tsela finofu chila choan'gana mutwa vake, lechelelo anleka kudita kota fyo an'gana muvina uyo, akupelwa hatsabu ngomi ndalahela. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Lechelelo munu yo yuve yo sinambe atsele chochin'ganika kudita manyi adite ndongwa tso nambe tsiganiche uyo akupelwa hatsabu ndodo. Munu yo yuve yo apelilwe finu fyolofu akudayilwa fyolofu, na munu yo yuve yo apelitwe wimilitsi wukomi na munu yunji akuputswa ndalahela.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu antelanitsa vanu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Matayo 10:34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />“Ntsitsitse kwasa moto mu inyi, ntsingiwiniwa guka guve gwantsitse kwaka. <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Ntsinatso ng'odeko gomi tso latsima ng'odeche, ntsitifitswa ndalahela mbaka ho gakukwila. <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Munkuta ntsitsitse kuleta wusichimafu mu inyi? Ndaya! Si wusichimafu lechelelo ndetite wutelanifu. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Kwasawuli luhuma sambi kukuva na vanu vahanu mu nyumba yimwe yo vantelana, vadatu kwa vavili, na vavili kwa vadatu. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Dada akutelana na mwanage mukwamitsi, na mwana mukwamitsi akutelana na dade, yuvamunu akutelana na mwanahintsa, na mwanahintsa akutelana na yuve, mukwemulima akutelana na mukwive, na mukwive akutelana na mukwemulima.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kufitsela fipindi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Matayo 16:2-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Kaha Yesu akalongaje na lilugu lya vanu, “Manyi muliwone lifuluka linhumila ku wusotelo wa litsuva, luvalalulo mulongaga kuta, Ndonya yikutonya, nayo yitonyaga.” <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Nanye manyi muyiwone ng'ala yin'wuga lubali lwa kusika mulongaga, “Kukuva na lifuche.” Nayo yivaga hihyo. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Henye mu vabuganitsi! Mufitselaga fipindi kwa kulola ndajilo tsa mu inyi na kilanga ku mafuluka. Mbe, kwasawuli yachi, nambe mutsele mana ya ndogwa tso tsihumila sambi?<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mupatanaje na vatelani vako</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Matayo 5:25-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />Kwasawuli yachi munlemwa kulamula kudita lulongwa lugolofu? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Manyi mutelani vako angukusindika ku wuhigo, wikangatsaje mupatane nayo mung'acha muli mung'asi, ili aleche kukusindika kwa ludali kwa muhigaji, na muhigaji akukusindika kwa mwimilitsi, nayo mwimilitsi akukusindika kwa mwimilitsi va nyumba ya vawopwa ili vakudindile. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Nachene ntsingukulonjela, siukuhuma umo mbaka uhombe sendi ya wudugo.<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s">Mwihale na kutsileka ndongwa tsenyu ntsibi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Luvala ulo kwavaga na vanu wo valivamulonje Yesu ndongwa tsa vanu vatunga va ku Galilaya. Vanu vala yo Pilato ali alajitse vakopolwe na danda yawo yihantswe mu minyama jo jisintsitswe kwasawuli ya nambiko. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Muhotsa kuta Vagalilaya iwo wo vakopulwe kwa ng'odeko kwasawuli vali vanu vabi kuvalutila Vagalilaya veka? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Ntsinguvakanila nachene si ihyo ndaya, hihyo na henye manyi muleche kupituka na kutsileka ndongwa tsenyu ntsibi mukwanangwa kota vawo. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Awu vala vanu kumi na nane go gwavagwilye munala kula ku Siloamu vakafwaje, munkuta vavaga vakola ndongwa ntsibi kulutila vanu vanji veka wo vikalaga ku Yelusalemu? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Ntsinguvakanila nachene, na henye manyi muleche kumupituchila Mulungu mukwanagwa kota iwo.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhwano gwa mubichi gwa mutini gosinambe gulele mibawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Kahi Yesu akavalonjelaje muhwano guno, “Munu yumwe avaga na mubichi gwa mutini mu mugunda gwake gwa mitsabibu. Munu uyo akabitaje kubava mibawo, lechelelo akagufikaje gulihela libawo lyolive. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Ihyo akamulonjelaje yo atuntsaga mugunda gwake gwa mitsabibu kuta, Lave, myaka jidatu mbaka sambi mbeye ntsinsaka mibawo mu mubichi guno gwa mutini bila kupata chochive. Ugudumule! Kwasawuli yachi gwendelele kwananga inyi?” <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Yula mutuntsaji va mugunda akamulonjelaje, “Mutwa, tuguleche kanji kwa mwaka gunji na heni nguguboholela malenga na nguguvichila mboleya. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Manyi gulele mwaka go gunkutsa yikuva finofu, lechelelo manyi sigukulela duve ufuluche ugudumule.”<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumuponetsa mudala yumwe Siku ya Weselo wa Vayawudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Siku yimwe Yesu avaga an'dahitsa mu nyumba ya kitang'anila Vayawudi, nayo yavaga Siku ya Weselo wa Vayawudi. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Mumo mu nyumba iyo mwavaga na mudala yumwe yo avaga jimubite misoka, jo jamudisile abibindale mugongo kwa myaka kumi na nane mbaka alemwaga kugoloka. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Yesu ho avaga kumuwona, akamuchemaje na kumulonjela kuta, “Mudala uponile wubibindafu wako!” <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Akamuvichilaje mawoko mwilanga mwa yula mudala na kumusuchila, na luvala lulo akimaje na akantsaje kumutsumitsa Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Lechelelo muvina va nyumba ya kwitang'anila Vayawudi akavipaje kwasawuli Yesu avaga amuponitse mudala uyo Siku ya Weselo. Ihyo akavalonjelaje vanu wovakong'ine kuta, “Hotsili siku sita tsotsin'ganika vanu kukola katsi, ihyo mutsaje muponetswe siku itso, lechelelo mulekaje kutsa mu Siku ya Weselo” <verse eid="LUK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Iho lelo Mutwa akamulonjelaje, “Henye mu vabunganitsi! Munu vachi hagati henyu yo siayidindulilaga senga yake awu ntsove yake kuhuma mwigagala ayisindiche yikang'we malenga ha Siku ya Kwesela? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Nayo yuno mudala va chilelo cha Ibulahimu yo akoditwe na lisoka kwa myaka kumi na nane. Mbe, siaganikije kuwopolwa Siku ya Weselo?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Hoavaga kulonga ihyo, vatelani vake vakawonaje nyoni, lechelelo vanu vanji vakavaje na wusangalo ndalahela kwasawuli ya ndongwa tseka tso adisile Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhwano gwa nyadikwa ndodo ya mubichi go gunchemwa muhaladali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Matayo 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Maliko 4:30-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Yesu akaputsaje, “Wuntsajila wa Mulungu wihwana na chinu chachi? Nguwiganitsa na chichi? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Wunakota nyadikwa ya mubichi gwa muhaladali yo atweye munu akayalaje mu mugunda gwake. Yikakalagalaje yikavaje mubichi mukomi, fideje fya kululanga fikatavaje fifulya mu mitambi jake.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhwano gwa hamila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:33">Matayo 13:33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Kaha Yesu akavaputsaje, “Nguwiganitsa na chichi Wutsajila wa Mulungu? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Wunakota hamila yo atweye mudala yumwe yo ahantsitse mu madebe gadatu ga wuse, ihyo wuse weka wukatsatsamukaje.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lwitsi lunyehe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Matayo 7:13-14</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:23">21:23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Kahi Yesu ho avaga mulujendo kubita ku Yelusalemu, akalutilaje mu miji na fijiji, kuno an'dahitsa vanu ndongwa tsa Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Munu yumwe akamuputsaje, “Mutwa, mbe vanu vadodo hela wo vakukuluswa?” <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Mwikangatsaje kwinjila kwa kukolela lwitsi lunyehe, kwasawuli ntsinguvalonjela nachene, vanu wolofu vakujela kwinjila lechelelo sivakuvetsa. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Chikutsa chipindi cha munya nyumba ho akulamuka na kudinda lwitsi, nanye mukwima kivala na kuhodetsa na kulonga kuta, Mutwa, Tudindulile lwitsi! Lechelelo mwene akuvalonjela kuta, Sintsivatsele henye komunhuma. <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Nanye mukumulonjela hino, Twaleye na kung'wa hamwe na heve, kaha wadahitse mu mitava jetu! <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Lechelelo mwene akuvalonjela, Sintsivatsele henye na kula ko muhumye, muwuche hano henye yo mun'dita ndongwa ntsibi. <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Hoihyo kukuva na chivembo na kugwegwetsula mino, ho mukuvawona Ibulahimu, na Yisaka, na Yakobo na valoli veka ho vakuva mu Wuntsajila wa Mulungu, lechelelo henye mukuva mudibulwe kivala. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Vanu vakutsa kuhuma lubali lwa ko linhumila litsuva na ko linsotela litsuva, na lubali lwa kunena na lubali lwa kusika, nawo vakikala hono hawo ho avahagulye Mulungu kwasawuli ya liwungo, na Mulungu akuvatavala. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Enaa! Kovali vanu yovali kuwudugo yo vakuva valongola, na valongola wo vakuva kuwudugo.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aguvembye muji gwa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Matayo 23:37-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Luvala ulo Mafwalisayo vatunga vakabitaje kwa Yesu vakamulonjelaje, “Uwuche hano ubite hono hanji, kwasawuli Helode an'gana kukukopola.” <verse eid="LUK 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Mubite mukamulonjele uyo licheve, ‘Ntsihumya misoka na kuvaponetsa vatamwa munyiguno na mitondo, na hawucha nguyisinda katsi yangu.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Nayivaje ihyo heni tsin'ganika kwendelela na lujendo lwangu munyiguno, mitondo na hawucha, si finofu muloli va Mulungu afwile hono hanji na ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />Heve, Yelusalemu! Heve, Yelusalemu! Yo unguvakopola valoli va Mulungu na kwa kuvatova na maganga vala wo vatumilwe kwako. Mala kalinga nganije kuvakong'asa hamwe vanago, kota hila ng'uku fyoyikong'asaga fitswiya fyake mu mabava gake, lechelelo ulemile. <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Lelo! Nyumba yenyu yilesilwe wuchiva. Ntsinguvalonjelani, simukumbona kaha mbaka muda gula ho mukulonga hino, ‘Aditilwe wuwuya na Mulungu mwene yo ankutsa kwa Litawa lya Mutwa.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesu angumuponetsa munu munya wutamwa wa kutuna muvili gweka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Siku yimwe ya Kwesela, Yesu ho avaga alibulitswe kulya mu nyumba ya chilongotsi va Mafwalisayo, vanu vakavaje vangumuhima. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Halutalo ha Yesu kwavaga na munu yumwe munya namwa ya kutuna muvili gweka. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yesu akavaputsaje Mafwalisayo na vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa, “Hino ndawuli, finofu awu siyo finofu kumuponetsa munu Siku ya Weselo?” <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Lechelelo vene vakakatukaje myee. Kahi Yesu akamubataje liwoko mutamwa yula na kumuponetsa na akamulonjelaje abite. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Kaha Yesu akavaputsaje, “Mbe, nani yoali hagati henyu manyi mwanage awu senga yake yigweye mu chisima siku ya Weselo yoaka kuleka kwangufitsa kuyihetsa na yivaje siku ya Weselo?” <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Lechelelo vene vakavaje valihela chinu chochive cha kulonga.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kidutsa na kwika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Yesu akawonaje vala vajentsi wo valibulitswe fyo vahagulaga figoda fya kutalo, akavalonjelaje muhwano guno, <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />“Manyi munu akulibulitse ku liwungo, ulekaje kwikala figoda fya hesima. Kwasawuli yifuluche yive alibulitswe munu yunji muvina kulutila heve mu chigoda icho, <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />na munyaliwungo yo avalibulitse akutsa na kukulonjela hino, ‘Umulechele munu yuno chigoda chako.’ Ihyo heve ukuhonga nyoni hala ho ukuganika kwinuka na kubita kikala kumbele. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Lechelelo manyi ulibulitswe hono ha liwungo, wikalaje hono ha kumbele, ili hala yoakulibulitse hoakuva kutsa akulonjele hino, ‘Bee muyangu, utse kuno kulutalo, hono hanofu ndalahela.’ Iho ho ukuva upasile hesima halutalo ha vajentsi vayago veka.” <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Kwasawuli munu yoyuve yo angidita muvina akwiswa, na yo ankwika akuva munu muvina.<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Kaha Yesu akamulonjelaje yula yo avalibulitse kuta, “Manyi uvaditile vanu chilyo cha liwungo mu munyi awu mumihe, Ulekaje kuvalibulitsa vanu va habehi na heve awu vang'olotso awu vafuchifu ng'ani. Manyi udite ihyo vene nawo vafuluche vakulibulitse kwawo, na vakuva vakuhombite chila cho uvaditye. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Lechelelo ho ukuva unvika liwungo, uvalibulitsaje vagayu, na filema, na fiteve na fibofu, <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />kwa kudita ihyo ukuva uditilwe wuwuya na Mulungu, nayivaje vene valihela wuvetso wa kukuhomba heve ukuhombwa hala ha wutsilipuko wa vanu wo vangidichilwa na Mulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhwano gwa vanu yovalibulitswe muliwungo likomi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Matayo 22:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Kahi munu yumwe yo avaga ichite hamwe na Yesu vankulya, akavaje kuhulika ihyo akamulonjelaje Yesu hino, “Aditilwe wuwuya na Mulungu munu yula yo akulya chilyo mu liwungo lya Wuntsajila wa Mulungu!”<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Munu yumwe adisile liwungo likomi, akavalibulitsaje vanu wolofu. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Chipindi cha liwungo hochavaga kufika, akamutumaje mutantsi vake akavalonjele vala wo avalibulitse kuta avalonjele, Mutse, chila chinu chili chang'ani!” <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Lechelelo veka wo valibulitswe vakalongaje hino, Mulongola akamulonjelaje mutantsi yula kuta, Umbonele lusungu heni ngutsile mugunda ntsin'ganika mbite ngagulole. <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Yunji akalongaje kuta, Umbonele lusungu heni ngutsile senga tsa kulimila, lelo ntsinsuka mbite ngatsidahitse kulima. <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Yunji akalongaje, Umbonele lusungu heni nweye mudala luvala lulu. <verse eid="LUK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />“Mutantsi uyo akawuyaje na kumulonjela mutwa vake lulongwa ulo. Yula munya nyumba akavipaje, akamulonjelaje mutantsi vake kuta, Ubite kubalabala na mumitava ja muji, uvalete mugati vagayu, fiteve, fibofu na vanya filema vanji. <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Hambele mutantsi yula akamulonjelaje, Mutwa, gala malajitso geka go undajitse ntsigadisile, lechelelo bado hono ha liwungo hana nyafwasi. <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Hoihyo Mutwa yula akamulonjelaje mutantsi vake, Ubite kubalabala na mumitava ja muji uvagongoletse vanu vinjile ili nyumba yangu yimeme. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Ntsinguvalonjela kuta, vala veka wovalibulitswe mu liwungo vakalemaje, kuduhu yo akujela alye chilyo mu liwungo lyangu.”<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hila fyoyin'ganika kudita ili uve mudahitswa va Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Matayo 10:37-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Vanu wolofu vavaga hamwe na Yesu mulujendo, Yesu akavapituchilaje na kuvalonjela, <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />“Manyi munu yoyuve an'gana kuva mudahitswa vangu, ang'anika angane heni kulutila kuvagana dade na yuve, awu vang'olotse valume na vadala, awu mudala vake na vanage awu wumi wake mwene manyi aleche kudita ihyo siafuluche ave mudahitswa vangu. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Munu yoyuve yosiangidichila kukodeka na kufwa kwasawuli ya kufwata heni, siafuluche ave mudahitswa vangu. <verse eid="LUK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />Mbe, nani hagati henyu yo an'gana kutsenga nyumba ngomi, yosiikalaga tandi hasi alave magobole gogan'ganika kuta anago gogakukwila kusinda katsi iyo awu ndaya? <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Munu yoyuve manyi aviche musinji na kulemwa kusinda kutsenga nyumba yeka vanu veka vakumuheka, <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />vakulonga kuta, Munu yuno akantsitse kutsenga, lechelelo alemilwe kusinda. <verse eid="LUK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Ndonje muhwano gunji. Mbe, kuna muntsajila vachi munya vatova ligalu elufu kumi, yosaikalaga hasi tandi na kuhotsa manyi ana ludali lwa kuvetsa kitova na muntsajila yunji munya vatova ligalu elufu isilini? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Manyi awone sakuvetsa kitova, akuvatuma vanu kwa muntsajila muyage kugana vasinde ndongwa na yula muntsajila yunji ang'acha kutali, <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />hoihyo duve lulongwa ulo luli hihyo,” kwasawuli, “Kuduhu munu yoyuve hagati henyu yoafuluche ave mudahitswa vangu manyi siakuleka fyeka fyo anafyo.”<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwino gosinambe gukole</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:13">Matayo 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Maliko 9:50</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />Mwino munofu, lechelelo manyi sinambe gukole, gukuditwa ndawuli mbaka gukole? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Sigufwayaga kaha nambe kwa lilongo awu mboleya, na vanu vadibulaga kutali, “Munya mapulichilo na ahuliche cho ntsilonga!”<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Muhwano gwa ng'olo yoyiyatsile</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Matayo 18:12-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Siku yimwe vakongotsa kodi na vanu vanya ndongwa ntsibi vavaga vahele kumuhulikitsa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Mafwalisayo na vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa vakantsaje kumuheha kuta, “Munu yuno anguvalibulitsa vanu vanya ndongwa ntsibi na kulya nawo!” <verse eid="LUK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Yesu akavalonjelaje kwa muhwano guno.<verse eid="LUK 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />Yesu akalongaje, “Manyi hoyoli munu ana ng'olo miya moja, manyi atsele kuta kuna ng'olo yimwe yiyatsile, ndawuli! Siatsilekaga tsila tisini na tisa kwijejele, na kubita kuyisakitsa yoyiyatsile mbaka ayiwone? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Manyi ayiwone ng'olo yila ayitwikaga mumayega gake kwa wusangalo. <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />Manyi afiche kukaye, akuvachema vanu vake va habehi na kuvalonjela kuta, Musangalale hamwe na heni, kwasawuli ntsiyiwene ng'olo yangu yoyika yiyatsile. <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Ihyo ntsinguvalonjela kuta, kukuva na wusangalo kilanga kwasawuli ya munu yumwe munya ndongwa ntsibi yo angukumupituchila Mulungu, kulutila vanu tisini na tisa wo vidichilwe na Mulungu, na kuno sinambe vagane kumupituchila Mulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhwano gwa lindolosi lyoliyatsile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />Yesu akawilaje kulonga, “Manyi kuve na mudala munya mandolosi kumi ga madini ga fetsa, na ayatse lindolosi limwe, yo siafuluche ase lusolola na kufyajila nyumba na kulisaka mbaka aliwone? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Nayo manyi aliwone, avachemaga vanu vake va habehi na kuvalonjela hino, ‘Musangalale hamwe na heni, kwasawuli ntsiliwene lindolosi lyangu lya madini ga fetsa lyolika liyatsile!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Ho ihyo ntsinguvalonjela kuta, hohihyo fyokukuva na wusangalo kwa vatantsi va kilanga va Mulungu, kwasawuli ya munya ndongwa ntsibi yumwe yoangu kumupituchila Mulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhwano gwa mukwamitsi yo ayatsile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Ihyo Yesu akendelelaje kulonga, “Kwavaga na munu yumwe munya vakwamitsi vavili. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Yula mudodo akamulonjelaje dade kuta, Dadangu, umele wuhali wangu.” Nayo dade akavagasaje mali na kumupela wuhali wake. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Tsavaga kulutila siku nunga, yula mudodo akakong'asaje mali tsake tseka, akabitaje kikala inyi ya kutali akelangaje tsila mali. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Nayo hoavaga kwelanga mali tsila tseka, yikahumilaje ntsala ngomi mu inyi yila yeka, akantsaje kugaya kwasawuli avaga alihela chinu chochive. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Ihyo akabitaje kusuka katsi kwa munu yumwe va inyi yila, na munu uyo akamupelaje katsi ya kulisa ngubi kumugunda gwake. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Akavaje na ntsala mbaka akiwiniwaje kulya chilyo cho tsalyaga ngubi, Lechelelo sikwavaga na munu yo amupelye chilyo chochive. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Lechelelo nyala hotsavaga kutsa, akahotsaje munumbula yake na kiputsa, Mbe, dada vangu anawo vatantsi valinga wo vankulya na kusigatsa, na heni hano ntsikufwa na ntsala? <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Nguwuka na kuwuya kwa dada vangu na kumulonjela, Dada vangu, ndisile ndongwa ntsibi kwa heve dada vangu na Mulungu va kilanga. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Sintin'ganika kuchemwa mwanago, undite kota yumwe va vatantsi vako. <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Ihyo akawukaje na kuwuya kwa dade.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">“Lechelelo hoavaga ang'acha kutali dade akamuwonaje, na kumuwonela lusungu akamubilimilaje mwanage, akamukumbanitsaje na kumunonela. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Mwanage akalongaje, Dada vangu, Ndisile ndongwa ntsibi kwa heve na kwa Mulungu va kilanga, Sintsin'ganika kuchemwa mwanago. <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Lechelelo dade akavalonjelaje vatantsi vake, Mwangufitse! Mulete kantsu nali mumufwiche. Mutegule na pete mumufwiche mu chala na filatu fya galama mu magulu gake. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Mulete ngwada yo yinonile tuyisintse ili tudite liwungo na tulye. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Kwasawuli mwanangu yuno avaga afweye, lechelelo sambi ali mumi, avaga ayatsile lechelelo sambi awoniche. Ihyo vakantsaje kuwunga liwungo. <verse eid="LUK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />Luvala ulo mame avaga ang'acha kumugunda. Hoavaga an'wuya na kuva habehi na nyumba yawo, akahulikaje ntsimbo na vanu van'wunga. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Akamuchemaje mutantsi yumwe, akamuputsaje, Mbe, kuna chichi? <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Yula mutantsi akamulonjelaje kuta, Mudodowo awutsile, na dado amusintsye ngwada yo yinonile kwasawuli mwanage awutsile kukaye ang'acha mumi. <verse eid="LUK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Uyo mwana muvina akavipaje ndalahela, akalemaje kwinjila mu nyumba. Ihyo dade akahumaje kwivala na kumugongoletsa. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Lechelelo mwene akamulonjelaje dade, Lole, myaka jeka jino jo ngukolye katsi sintsalesile malajitso gako nambe siku yimwe. Siwamelye nambe chinyehe cha mene ndite liwungo na vayangu! <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Lechelelo mwanago yuno yo alyeye mali tsako na kwelanga na vadala vanya miho matali, hoawutsile kukaye, umusintsye ngwada yoyinonile. <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Dade akamulonjelaje, Mwanangu, heve uli hamwe na heni siku tseka, na finu fyeka fyo ntsinafyo fya heve. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Chochiganikije kuditwa kuwunga liwungo na kusangalala, kwasawuli mudodowo yuno aka afweye, na sambi ali mumi, aka ayatsile, lechelelo sambi awuniche.”<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Muhwano gwa mwimilitsi musugu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yesu akavalonjelaje vadahitswa vake, “Kwavaga na munu yumwe mufuchifu yoavaga na mwimilitsi yo imililaga finu fyake. Mufuchifu yula akahulikaje kuta, mwimilitsi ankwelanga finu fyake. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Siku yimwe mufuchifu yula akamuchemaje na kumuputsa mwimilitsi vake, ndongwa ntsachi tsino tso ntsinhulika, lelo unambulile finu fyangu fyo ngupelye wimilile, kwasawuli siukwendelela kuva mwimilitsi va finu fyangu. <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Ihyo mwimilitsi yula akahotsaje kuta, mufuchifu vangu ambinga katsi ya wimilitsi, lelo ngudita ndawuli? Ludali lwa kulima ntsihela, na heni kusukasuka kwa vanu ntsin'wona nyoni. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Lelo ntseliwe cho ngudita, ili hala honguva mbintsilwe katsi vanu vandibulitse mu kaye tsawo. <verse eid="LUK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Duve, mwimilitsi yula akavachemaje yumwe yumwe va vala wo vadayilwaga na mufuchifu vake. Akamulonjelaje va kwantsa, Mbe, heve un'dayilwa chiyasi chachi cha mafuta na mufuchifu vangu? <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Mwene akamulonjelaje, figuduliya fya lita tsihanu tsa mafuta ga mitseyituni miya nane, mwimilitsi yula akamulonjelaje kuta, Tegule hati ya lideni lyako, wandiche figuduliya miya tsitayi. <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Kaha akamuputsaje mudeni va kavili, heve un'dayilwa chiayasi chachi? Mwene akamulonjelaje, Ntsin'dayilwa magunila miya mbili ga ngano. Mutantsi yula akamulonjelaje, Tegule hati ya lideni lyako, wandiche magunila miya moja na sitini! <verse eid="LUK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />Yula mufuchifu akamutsumilaje mwimilitsi vake yoavaga muhitsi kwasawuli ya wusugu wake woavaditye vadeni vala. Lechelelo vanu yo vangumufwata Mulungu valihela wusugu kota iwo.” <verse eid="LUK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Yesu akendelelaje kuvalonjela, “Mwiditile vanu va habehi kukolela finu fya muinyi yino, ili ho tsalava kusila, mulibulitswe na Mulungu mu wukalo wowugaya wudugo. <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Munu yoyuve yoakuva vakihuvilwa kwa finu fidodo ndalahela, akuva vakihuvilwa kwa finu fyolofu, na munu yoyuve yoakuva sivakihuvilwa kwa finu fidodo safuluche ihuvilwe kwa finu fikomi. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Ihyo manyi henye simuveye vakitumbilwa kwa finu fya muinyi, nani yo akuvapela finu fya kweli? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Manyi henye simukitumbilwa kwa finu fya munu yunji, nani yoakuvapela finu fyenyu muvene?” <verse eid="LUK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />Yesu akendelelaje kulonga, “Kuduhu munu yoafuluche kuvatumichila vavina vavivili, Kwasawuli afuluche amuvipile yumwe na kumugana yunji awu afuluche ihantse na yumwe na kumubedala yunji. Henye nanye simufuluche kumutumichila Mulungu na mali.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Madahitso ganji ga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Matayo 11:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Maliko 10:11-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Lechelelo Mafwalisayo vakavaje kuhulika ihyo, vakamuhekaje Yesu kwa mbedalo kwasawuli vene vavaga vanu va kugana magobole ndalahela. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Henye mungilajila halutalo ha vanu kuta mu vawuya, lechelelo Mulungu avatsele numbula tsenyu. Kwasawuli chila chochinwoneka china galama ndalahela halutalo ha vanu, kwa Mulungu chivaga chibi. <verse eid="LUK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />Malajitso ga Musa hamwe na madahitso ga valoli va Mulungu fyavikulwaga mbaka chipindi cha Yohana Mubatitsaji. Kuhuma baho wuntsajila wa Mulungu wunvikulwa na chila yoa anguwudichila ankwinjila kwa wuvetso. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Lechelelo kuna wupefu kwa kilanga na inyi kulutila, lechelelo kuna wukangafu kujelula nambe kalongwa kamwe ka malajitso ga Musa. <verse eid="LUK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />Munu yoyuve yo angumuleka mudala vake na kumutola mudala yunji an'dita waafu, na mulume yoyuve yakumutola mudala yalesilwe, nayo an'dita waafu.<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Munu mufuchifu na Latsalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />“Kwavaga na munu yumwe mufuchifu yafwalaga myenda ja lanji ya tsambalawu na lanji ntselu ja beyi ngomi, nayo elangaga mali na kikala kwa mbwiniyo tsa muinyi siku tseka. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Na hamulango gwa mufuchifu uyo havaga na munu yumwe mugayu litawa lyake achemwaga Latsalo, yoali na fikong'o muvili gweka. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Uyo Latsalo iviniwaga kulya filyo fyo fyagwaga kuhuma mumetsa ya mufuchifu yula. Nambe mibwa najo jatsaga kumumyanga fikong'o.<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />“Hambele uyo mugayu Latsalo akafwaje, nawo vatantsi va kilanga va Mulungu vakamutegulaje ikale hamwe na Ibulahimu. Na yula mufuchifu nayo hambele akafwaje na vakamutsikaje, <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />na yula mufuchifu hoavaga kula kwa vanu wo vafweye ankodeka ku jehamamu ndalahela, akalolaje kwa kutali na kumuwona Ibulahimu alihamwe na Latsalo. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Ihyo mufuchifu yula akamuchemaje kwa litsi likomi, ‘Dada Ibulahimu! Umbonele lusungu, umutume Latsalo adotse nambe chala chake hela mu malenga, atse amotse lulimi lwangu, kwasawuli kuno jehamamu ntsinkodeka ndalahela.’<verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />“Lechelelo Ibulahimu akamulonjelaje, ‘Mwanangu wiwuche kuta ha wumi wako wapasile finu fyeka finofu, nayo Latsalo akodiche. Lechelelo sambi mwene anhongetswa na heve unkodeka. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Kulutila ihyo, hagati ha hetwe na henye hana likwava likomi, ili wovan'gana kulowoka kuhuma kokuve valemwe.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Munu yula mufuchifu akagongolaje, ‘Duve Dada Ibulahimu, umutume Latsalo abite kukaye kwa vang'olotsangu, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />Kwasawuli ntsinawo vang'olotsangu vahanu, abite akavafunde, valahogola vatse kono kuno ku jehanumu kuna ng'odeko.’<verse eid="LUK 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />“Lechelelo Ibulahimu akamulonjelaje, ‘Vang'olotso vanayo Musa na valoli va Mulungu, van'ganika vavahulikitse vawo.’<verse eid="LUK 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />“Lechelelo yula mufuchifu akalongaje, ‘Ndaya dada Ibulahimu, manyi munu ahume kuno kwa vanu wovafweye na kuvafunda, vakuleka kudita ndongwa tsawo ntsibi na kumupituchila Mulungu,’ <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Nayo Ibulahimu akamulonjelaje, ‘Manyi sivakuvahulikitsa Musa na valoli va Mulungu, nambe abite kuvagongola munu yo ahumye kwa vanu wovafweye sivakuhulika.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s">Madahitso ga ndongwa ntsibi, na litumbilo na majetso.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Matayo 18:6-7</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Maliko 9:42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Kahi Yesu akavalonjelaje vadahitswa vake, “Finu fyo finkwambutsa munu kudita ndongwa ntsibi kofili siku tseka, lechelelo akudutsa munu yula yo akwambutsa munu kudita ndongwa ntsibi. <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Yikakuva chiba kwa munu uyo awopelwe lwala lukomi musingo yake na kutotswa mu bahali, kuliko kwambutsa munu yumwe munya litumbilo adite ndongwa ntsibi.” <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Ihyo mwiyangalilaje,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">“Manyi mung'olotso yumwe munya litumbilo adisile ndongwa ntsibi, umung'anulile, na manyi asuche kuhulumilwa na kuleka kudita ndongwa ntsibi na kumupituchila Mulungu, un'ganika umuhulumile. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Nayivaje akuditye ndongwa ntsibi mala saba kwa siku yimwe, Manyi aleche ndongwa ntsibi na kumupituchila Mulungu, un'ganika umuhulumile.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Litumbilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Vatumi vakamulonjelaje Yesu, “Mutwa, utuwile litumbilo.” <verse eid="LUK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Nayo Mutwa akavalonjelaje, “Manyi muna litumbilo lidodo kota meche ya libichi lyo linchemwa muhaladali, mufuluche mugulonjele mubichi guno gwa mutsombe, ‘Gumbuche ukitotse kubahali,’ nago gukuvahulikitsa.”<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Katsi ya mutantsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />Yesu akalongaje, “Manyi munu yumwe hagati ana mutantsi yo angumulimila kumugunda awu kudima ng'olo, hoakuva an'wuya kuhuma kumugunda. Mbe, afuluche amulonjele mutantsi vake kuta, ‘Wikale hano ulye?’ <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Mbe, siakumulonjela hino, ‘Nditile chilyo ntsilye. Wiviche finofu unumichile, honguva sintsile kulya na kung'wa, holelo na heve ho ukulya na kung'wa.’ <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Mbe, akumuhongetsa mutantsi uyo kwasawuli adisile chila cho aganikije kudita? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Hoihyo na henye manyi mudite fyeka fyomulagitswe, mulongaje hino, ‘Hetwe tu vatantsi hela, yo tudisile chila chotuganikije kudita.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvaponetsa vanu kumi vanya wububa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Yesu hoavaga mulujendo kubita ku Yelusalemu, akwete mu mbaka ya Samaliya na Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Hoavaga ankwinjila mu chijiji chimwe, akitang'anaje na vanu kumi vanya wutamwa wa wububa, nawo vala vanu vavaga vimile kutali. <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />Vakamulonjelaje kwa litsi likomi vakalongaje, “Mutwa Yesu, utuwonele lusungu!” <verse eid="LUK 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Akavaje kuvawona akavalonjelaje hino, “Mubite mukilajile kwa vatawula nambiko.” Duve nawo, hovavaga mung'asi vam'bita, vakaponaje wutamwa wawo na kidichilwa kwa ntsovelo tsa kumufugamila Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Muyawo yumwe avaga kiwona aponile, akawuyaje kwa Yesu kuno angumutsumitsa Mulungu kwa litsi likomi. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Akitotsaje hamagulu ga Yesu na kumulumba. Munu uyo avaga va kabila lya Vasamaliya. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Ihyo Yesu akaputsaje, “Mbe, sitsivaponitse vanu kumi nawo vakidichilwaje kwa ntsovelo tsa kumufugamila Mulungu? Vala tisa valikwiya? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Kuduhu munu yunji yo awutsile kumupela Mulungu wumelemo, ila yuno mujentsi ng'ani?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Kahi Yesu akamulonjelaje munu yula, “Winuche ubite, litumbilo lyako likukuluse.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutsa kwa Wuntsajila wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Matayo 24:23-28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Siku yimwe Mafwalisayo vakamuputsaje Yesu, “Wuntsajila wa Mulungu wukutsa hanili?” Nayo akavalonjelaje, Wuntsajila wa Mulungu siwutsaga kwa kuwuhima kwa miho. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Yesu akalongaje, “Kaha kuduhu munu yoafuluche alonje kuta, Wuli hano! Awu kulonga kuta, Wuli hala! Kwasawuli wuntsajila wa Mulungu wuli mugati mwenyu.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Kahi akavalonjelaje vadahitswa vake, “Siku ntsinkutsa ho mukiwiniwa kuyiwona siku yimwe ya siku tsa heni Mwana va Munu, lechelelo simukuyiwona. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Vanu vakuvalonjela kuta, ‘Mulole ali kula!’ Awu ‘Mulole ali hano!’ Lechelelo henye mulekaje kuvafwata. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Kwasawuli kota hila lwenje fyowung'alikaga kilanga luhuma lubali lumwe mbaka lubali lunji, ho ihyo fyo yikuva siku ya kutsa heni Mwana va Munu. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Lechelelo ha wulongolo heni Mwana va Munu nguganika ng'odeche ndalahela na vanu va chilelo chino vakundema.<verse eid="LUK 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />“Kota hila fyoyavaga siku tsa Nuwu, hoihyo fyoyikuva ha siku tsa heni Mwana va Munu. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Mu siku tsa Nuwu vanu vavaga vankulya na kung'wa, kutola na kutoleka, mbaka hala Nuwu hoavaga kwinjila mu litumbwi likomi. Ndonya ngomi yikatonyaje na likuka likomi likahumilaje na kukopola chila chinu. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Yikuva kota fyo tsavaga mu siku tsa Lutu. Vanu vavaga vankulya na kung'wa, na vagulaga na kugutsa, na vayalaga na kutsenga nyumba. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Lechelelo siku yila Lutu hoavaga kuwuka ku Sodoma, moto gwa chibiliti kuhuma kilanga gukabohokaje kota ndonya na kuvanyanya vanu veka. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Hohihyo fyo yikuva siku yila heni Mwana va Munu fyo nguhumila. <verse eid="LUK 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />Siku iyo munu yoakuva mwilanga mwa ya nyumba yake, alekaje kwika hasi kubita kutegula finu fyake fyo fili mu nyumba. Hihilaga munu yoali kumugunda alekaje kuwuya kutegula chinu chochive. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Mwiwukaje cho chamupasile muchina Lutu. <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Munu yoyuve yo akujela kuwukulusa wumi wake, akuwuyatsa, na yoyuve yo akuwuyatsa wumi wake, akuwukulusa. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Ntsinguvalonjela chilo cha siku iyo vanu vavili vakuva vavasise hamwe mu lusaga lumwe, yumwe akutegulwa na yunji akulekwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Vadala vavili vakuva hono hamwe vanhalula wuse mu lwala, yumwe akutegulwa na yunji akulekwa.” <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Yesu akalongaje, “Valume vavili vakuva hono hamwe vankola katsi ya kulima mumugunda, yumwe akutegulwa na yunji akulekwa.” <verse eid="LUK 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Vadahitswa vake vakamuwutsaje, “Mutwa, Ifyo fikuhumila kwiya?” Akavalonjelaje, “Iho ho hana livili linyama lyo lifyeye, iho ho tsitang'anaga ngungule.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Muhwano gwa mudala mufwile na muhigaji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Kahi Yesu akavalonjelaje muhwano guno vadahitswa vake, kuvalajila hila fyo van'ganika kusuka Mulungu siku tseka bila kugotsola. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Akawilaje kuvalonjela, “Mu muji gumwe kwavaga na muhigaji yosiavaga na muloto na Mulungu, kaha siahotsaga munu yoyuve. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Mu muji gugo kwavaga na mudala yumwe mufwile yo abitaga lwa hihyo kwa muhigaji na kumugongoletsa kuta, ‘Undamule chila cho tsingumudaya mutelani vangu.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Muhigaji yula alemaga kumutanga mufwile yula kwa siku ntsolofu, lechelelo hambele akihotsaje kuta, Nambaje heni tsilihela muloto na Mulungu na kaha sinambe nyotse munu yoyuve, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />lechelelo kwa hila mufwile yuno fyo an'nifya lwahihyo, ngumulamula kota fyo an'gana, Ili aleche kunifya lwahihyo.”<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Ihyo Mutwa Yesu akalongaje, “Mutsihotse ndongwa tso alontsile uyo muhigaji yo sinambe adite kota fyo an'ganika. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Mbe, Mulungu siafuluche avaditile kota fyo yin'ganika vanu vake wo avahagwe, wo vangumuvembela hamunyi na hachilo? Mbe, Mulungu akuhava kuvatanga? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Ntsinguvalonjela akwangufitsa kuvaditila nachene kota fyo mun'gana. Lechelelo heni Mwana va Munu honguva kutsa nguvafika vanu vanalyo litumbilo ku inyi?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhwano wa Mufwalisayo na Mukongotsa kodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Yesu akavalonjelaje kwa muhwano, vanu vala wo vangihuvila kuta vene van'dita kota fyo an'gana Mulungu na kuvabedala vanu vanji, akalongaje kuta, <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />“Vanu vavili vavaga vahele mu Nyumba ya Mulungu ku suka, yumwe avaga Mufwalisayo na yunji Mukongotsa kodi. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Yula Mufwalisayo akisuchilaje kwa kidutsa hino, ‘Mulungu ntsingukulumba kwa kwasawuli heni si ntsinakota vanu vanji wo vawumiyani, awu vahatufu, awu vanu wo van'dita waafu, awu kota yuno mukongotsa kodi. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Heni ntsinleka kulya na kung'wa mala kavili kwa wichi, na kaha nawulaga lifungu limwe ha chila mafungu kumi go ntsimpata.’<verse eid="LUK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />“Lechelelo yula mukongotsa kodi, akimaje kwa kutali siajetsitse nambe kwinula miho gake kilanga kwa Mulungu, lechelelo akitovatovaje mu mambaga yake na kuta, ‘Mulungu, umbonele lusungu heni ntsi munu munya ndongwa ntsibi.’<verse eid="LUK 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />“Ntsinguvalonjela hino, yuno mukongotsa kodi awutsile kukaye kuno avalilwe wuwuya kwa Mulungu kulutila yula Mufwalisayo. Kwasawuli munu yoyuve yo angidutsa akwiswa, na yula munya kwika akwinulwa.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvatambichila vana vadodo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matayo 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Maliko 10:13-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Vanu vamusindichilaga Yesu vana vadodo ili avavichile mawoko ili vatambichilwe. Vadahitswa vake vavaga kuwona hila, vakavalemetsaje vanu kwa kuvang'anulila. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Lechelelo Yesu akavachemaje vana vala vabite kwake na kulonga, “Muvaleche vana vadodo vatse kwa heni, muleche kuvalemetsa, kwasawuli Wuntsajila wa Mulungu wa vanu vanakota vana vano <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta, munu yoyuve yosinambe awanuchile Wuntsajila wa Mulungu kota mwana mudodo, siakuhogola kwinjila mu wuntsajila wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muvina yumwe mufuchifu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matayo 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Maliko 10:17-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Muvina yumwe va Vayawudi, akamuputsaje Yesu, “Mudahitsi muwuya, nditaje chichi ili ntsinjile ku wumi wowugaya wudugo?” <verse eid="LUK 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Ndawuli unyema heni ntsi muwuya? Kuduhu muwuya ila Mulungu ng'ani. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Ugatsele malajitso ga Mulungu, ‘Walahogola kudita waafu, walahogola kukopola, walahogola kuhitsa, walahogola kulonga wudesi, na walahogola kuvabedala yuwo na dado.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Yula muvina mufuchifu akalongaje, “Malajitso igo geka ntsibite kuhuma hontsavaga mwana.”<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Yesu hoavaga kuhulika ihyo, akamulonjelaje, “Upunguchilwe chinu chimwe, un'ganika udite hino, ‘Ubite ukagutse chila chinu cho unacho uvapele vagayu, naheve ukuva na finu fya kutumila kilanga kwa Mulungu, kaha utse ufwate.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Lechelelo munu uyo hoavaga kuhulika ihyo, akang'ung'utaje ndalahela kwasawuli avaga wufuchifu. <verse eid="LUK 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yesu hoavaga kuwona hila munu yula fyo ang'ung'uta, akalongaje, “Lave fyo kukuva kutalamu kwa munu mufuchifu kwinjila ku Wuntsajila wa Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Lechelelo kukuva kupefu ndalahela kwa linyama lyo linchemwa lingamiya kupuluta mu nang'ana ya sindano, kulutila mufuchifu kwinjila ku Wuntsajila wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Vanu vala yo vakahuliche ihyo, vakalonganaje kuta, “Manyi yive ihyo nani yoafuluche kukuluka?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Fila fyo fivasumaga vanu, Mulungu sifimusumaga.”<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Nayo Petulo akamuputsaje, “Lave! Tulesile finu fyeka fyo tukanafyo tukufwatite heve.”<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta, munu yoyuve yo alesile nyumba, awu mudala vake, awu mung'olotse, awu yuve, awu dade, awu vanage kwasawuli ya Wuntsajila wa Mulungu, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />kuduhu munu yo siafuluche aleche kupata finu fyolofu ndalahela chipindi cha sambi, na ku chipindi cho chinkutsa, na kaha ku wumi wo wugaya wudugo.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anlonga lwa kadatu kuta hambele akufwa na kutsilipuka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matayo 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Maliko 10:32-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yesu akavatolaje vadahitswa vake kumi na vavili mbaka hono hawiyeka akavalonjelaje, “Muhulikitse! Tum'bita ku Yelusalemu uko ko chikuhumila chila chinu chovalontsile valoli va Mulungu, kwasawuli ya Mwana va Munu. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Vakumubata na kumuleka kwa vanu wosi Vayawudi, vakumuliga na kumufunyila mati. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Vakumutova na mikotya na kumukopola, lechelelo siku ya kadatu akutsilipuka.”<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Lechelelo vadahitswa vake vakalemwaje kutsela lulongwa ulo, kwasawuli vavaga vafihilwe mana ya ndongwa itso, na sivakeliwe chochilonjiche.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumuponetsa chibofu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matayo 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Maliko 10:46-52</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Yesu akavaje kufika habehi na ku Yeliko, kwavaga na munu yumwe chibofu ichite mung'asi ansuka kutangwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Avaga kuhulika lilugu lya vanu linlutila akaputsaje, “Kuna chichi?” <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Vakamulonjelaje kuta, “Yesu va ku Natsaleti anlutila.” <verse eid="LUK 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Ihyo chibofu yula akakolaje fikami, akatyaje, “Yesu, Mwana va Dawudi, umbonele lusungu!”<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Vanu vala wovavaga valongwe vakamulonjelaje kwa kumung'anulila ili akatuche, lechelelo mwene akendelelaje kulonga fikami, “Mwana va Dawudi umbonele lusungu!”<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yesu akimaje, akavalonjelaje vamulete halutalo hake. Chibofu yula akavaje kufika habehi, Yesu akamuputsaje, <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />“Un'gana nguditile chichi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">Nayo akamulonjelaje kuta, “Mutwa ntsin'gana kulola.”<verse eid="LUK 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Duve ulole! Litumbilo lyako likuponitse.”<verse eid="LUK 18:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Luvala lulo chibofu uyo akalolaje, akamufwataje Yesu kuno angumutsumitsa Mulungu. Vanu veka vavaga kuwona ihyo, vakamutsumitsaje Mulungu.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na Tsakayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yesu akinjilaje ku muji gwa Yeliko, akavaje anlutila mung'asi tsa muji ugo. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Kuko kwavaga na munu yumwe yoachemwaga litawa lyake Tsakayo, nayo avaga muvina va vakongotsa kodi, na kaha avaga mufuchifu. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Nayo aganaga atsele kuta Yesu avaga munu va chinya ndawuli, lechelelo akalemwaje kumuwona kwasawuli avaga mufupi na kaha vanu vavaga wolofu ndalahela. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Ihyo akalongolaje luvilo kulutalo, akakwinaje kilanga ku mubichi gwa mutsombe ili avetse kumuwona, kwasawuli atselaga kuta Yesu akukola ku ng'asi yila. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Ihyo Yesu avaga kufika hono hala, akalolaje kilanga akamulonjelaje, “Tsakayo, wangufitse kwika, kwasawuli munyiguno nguva mujentsi mu nyumba yako.” <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Ihyo Tsakayo akangufitsaje kwika, akamulibulitsaje Yesu kukaye yake kwa wusangalo. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Vanu veka vavaga kuwona hila, vakantsaje kukalala vakalongaje, “Yesu ahele kuva mujentsi va munu munya ndongwa ntsibi.”<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Lechelelo Tsakayo akimaje na kumulonjela Mutwa, “Lave, heni nguvapela vagayu lifungu limwe mu mafungu gavili ga mali tsangu, na manyi ntsimusukwe munu yoyuve chinu chochive, ngumupilulila mala katayi.”<verse eid="LUK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Munyiguno wukuluso wufisile mu nyumba yino, kwasawuli uyu nayo mwana va Ibulahimu. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Kwasawuli heni Mwana va Munu ntsitsitse kusaka na kukulusa fyo fiyatsile.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhwano gwa vatantsi kumi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Matayo 25:14-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Vanu wovavaga vangumuhulikitsa Yesu vavaga habehi na kufika ku Yelusalemu, vatijilaga kuta Wuntsajila wa Mulungu wulihabehi. Ihyo Yesu akavalonjelaje muhwano kuta, <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />“Kwavaga na munu yumwe va lukolo lwa chintsajila yoavaga ahele ku lujendo lwa inyi ya kutali ili avikwe kuva muntsajila. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Hoavaga ang'ali kuwuka akavachemaje vatantsi vake kumi na kuvapela magobole molofu na kuvalonjela, Mutsiditile katsi mbaka ho nguwuya. <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Lechelelo vanu va inyi yake vakamuvipilaje, ihyo vakatumaje vajumbe vabite vakalonje kuta, Tulema munu yuno ave muntsajila vetu.”<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />Yesu akalongaje, “Nambe ihyo munu uyo apasile wuntsajila na kuwuya ku inyi yake, kahi akavachemaje vala vatantsi vake wo avagavye magobole gala ili atsele chila yumwe cho apatite. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Mutantsi va kwantsa akatsaje na kulonga hino, Mutwa, luhuma ku magobole go ukamelye, masile mafungu kumi mu lifungu limwe lyo wamelye. <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Muntsajila yula akamulonjelaje, Udisile finofu mutantsi munya kwihuvila. Kwasawuli uveye munya kwihuvila kwa finu fidodo, Ngukuvika uve muvina va miji kumi. <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Mutantsi va kavili akatsaje na kulonga hino, Mutwa, masile mafungu gahanu mu lifungu limwe lyo wamelye. <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Muntsajila vake akamulonjelaje hihilaga kuta, Heve nave ntsingukupela wuvina wa miji jihanu. <verse eid="LUK 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Mutantsi yunji akatsaje, akalongaje, Mutwa, lino hano ligobole lyako, ngali ngufihye hono hanofu muchitambala. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Kwasawuli ngogwipe heve kuta uli munu mutalamu. Utegulaga hala ho siulavika, na ubetaga hala ho siulayala.” <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Yesu akendelelaje kulonga kuta, “Muntsajila yula akamulonjelaje kuta, Heve mutantsi mubi, ngukuhiga kwa ndongwa tsako! Manyi watselaga kuta heni ntsi munu mutalamu, yo negulaga finu fyo sintsilavika na kubeta fila fyo sintsayatsile. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Kwasawuli ya chichi, siukavisise ligobole lyangu kwa vanya liba vaditile katsi, ili honguva mbutsile negule ligobole lyangu na fwayida yake?” <verse eid="LUK 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Iho yula muntsajila akavalonjelaje vala wovavaga vimile hala, “Mumusukule igobole ilyo na mukamupele yula yoapasile fwayida mala kumi.” <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Nawo vakamulonjelaje kuta, “Mutwa, mbona mwanga anago mafungu kumi!” <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Nayo akavalonjelaje, “Ntsinguvalonjelani, chila munya chinu akupelwa na kulutitsilwa. Lechelelo yula yo alihela chinu, nambe chila cho anacho chikusukulwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Ila iwo vatelani vangu wo sivaganije ntsive muntsajila vawo, muvalete na kuvakopola halutalo hangu.”<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ankwinjila Yelusalemu kwa ntsumitso</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matayo 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maliko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohana 12:12-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Yesu avaga kulonga ihyo, akalongolaje kubitila ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Akavaje kufika habehi na miji ja Besifwaje na Besaniya, habehi na chidunda cho chinchemwa Mitseyituni, akavatumaje vadahitswa vake vavili na kuvalonjela kuta, <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />“Mubite mu chijiji chochili kulutalo, na homukuva munkwinjila mu chijiji icho, mukuyifika ntsana ya ntsove yiwopitwe yo ying'ali kukwinwa na munu yoyuve ayijendele. Muyiwopole na mundetele. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Manyi munu avaputse kuta munguyiwopola kwasawuli ya chichi, mumulonjele kuta, ‘Mutwa anguyigana.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Vala yovatumilwe vakabitaje, vakafikaje chila chinu chili hihilaga kota Yesu fyo avalonje. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Hovavaga vanguyiwopola yila ntsana ya ntsove, munya ntsove akavaputsaje, “Kwasawuli ya chichi munguyiwopola yino ntsana ya ntsove?”<verse eid="LUK 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Nawo vakavalonjelaje kuta, “Mutwa anguyigana.” <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Duve vakamusindichilaje Yesu yila ntsana ya ntsove. Vakatandikaje myenda jawo mwilanga mwa iyo ntsana ya ntsove, vakamukwinitsaje Yesu mwilanga. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Yesu hoavaga ankwendelela na lujendo kuno akwinile yila ntsana ya ntsove, vanu vakatandikaje myenda jawo mubalabala. <verse eid="LUK 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Hovavaga kufika habehi na ku Yelusalemu ho lunkwantsila lwisa lwa chidunda cha Mitseyituni, vanu veka hamwe na vadahitswa vake vakantsaje kumulumba Mulungu na kumutsumitsa kwa litsi likomi kwasawuli ya ndongwa ngomi tseka tsovatsiwene, <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />vakavaje vankwimba hino, “Aditilwe wuwuya na Mulungu Mutwa yo ankutsa kwa Litawa lya Muntsajila. Wusichimafu wuli kilanga kwa Mulungu, na wumelemo wuli kilanga ndalahela!” <verse eid="LUK 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Iho Mafwalisayo vamwinga wovavaga mwilugu lya vanu vakamulonjelaje Yesu, “Mudahitsi, vang'anulile vadahitswa vako vakatuche!”<verse eid="LUK 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Ntsinguvalonjela hino, manyi vano vakatuche, maganga gakutova chiyove.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguguvembela muji gwa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Yesu hoavaga kufika habehi na kuguwona muji gwa Yelusalemu, akaguvembelaje, <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />akalongaje, “Ukauve un'tsela munyiguno ndongwa ntso tsikuleta wusichimafu! Lechelelo sambi tsifihilwe hamiho gako. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Siku tsinkutsa vatelani vako vakukupilima kwa lwigo chila lubali na vakukutova kuhuma chila lubali. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Kahi vakukugwisa heve hamwe na vanu vako veka. Sivakukulechela nambe liganga limwe mu lukantsi lwako, kwasawuli walemaga kutsela chipindi cho Mulungu ho akuletye wukuluso!”<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ankwinjila mu Nyumba ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matayo 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maliko 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohana 2:13-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Kahi Yesu akinjilaje mugati mwa Nyumba ya Mulungu, akantsaje kuvavinjila kivala vanu wovagutsaga finu umo mugati, <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />akavalonjelaje kuta, “Yandikwe hino, ‘Nyumba yangu yikuva Nyumba ya Kusalila, lechelelo henye muyidisile yive malika ya vahitsi.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 19:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Yesu avaga an'dahitsa chila siku mu Nyumba ya Kusalila. Vavina va vatawula nambiko na vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa, na vavina va vanu vaganaga kumukopola, <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />lechelelo vakalemwaje hila fyo vakumubata, kwasawuli vanu veka vavaga vangumuhulikitsaga finofu ndalahela.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s">Vanu van'wun'tsa mamulaka ga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matayo 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Maliko 11:27-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Siku yimwe Yesu hoavaga anguvadahitsa vanu mu Nyumba ya Kusalila na kuvavikulila Ndongwa Nofu, vavina va vatawula nambiko na vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa hamwe na vavina va vanu vakatsaje, <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />na kumuputsa kuta, “Utulonjele un'dita ndongwa tsino kwa mamulaka ga nani? Nani yo akupelye mamulaka gano?” <verse eid="LUK 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yesu akavalonjelaje kuta, “Na heni nguvaputsa lulongwa na henye mun'ganika mundonjele, <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />mamulaka ga Yohana kubatitsa gahumye kilanga kwa Mulungu awu kwa vanu?” <verse eid="LUK 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Lechelelo vene vakiputsaje, “Manyi tulonje gahumye kilanga kwa Mulungu, mwene akutuputsa, mbona situkamutumbye? <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Na manyi tulonje kuta gahumye kwa vanu, vanu veka hano vakututova na maganga, kwasawuli veka vangitumbila kuta Yohana avaga muloli va Mulungu.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Duve vakamulonjelaje, “Nambe tutsele kuta mamulaka igo gahumye kwiya.”<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Na heni singuvalonjela kuta ntsin'dita ndongwa tsino kwa mamulaka gachi.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhwano gwa vanu wo vakoditse mugunda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matayo 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Maliko 12:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Yesu akendelelaje kuvalonjela vanu muhwano guno “Munu yumwe avaga na mugunda gwa mitsabibu, nayo akakoditsaje kwa valimi na kubita lujendo ku inyi ya kutali, akikalaje uko kwa siku ntsolofu. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Chipindi cha kubeta, munu uyo akamutumaje mutantsi vake kwa vala valimi, akatole mibawo mitunga ja mugunda gwa mitsabibu. Lechelelo vanu vala wovavaga vakodite vakamutovaje mutantsi uyo na kumupilula ali mawoko ng'ani. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Muntsajila yula akamutumaje mutantsi va kavili yuyo nayo vakamutovaje hihilaga na kumuditila ndongwa tsa nyoni na kumupilula ali mawoko ng'ani. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Akamutumaje kaha mutantsi va kadatu uyo nayo vakamutetsaje, na kumudibula kutali na mugunda. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Yula mutwa munya mugunda akahotsaje na kulonga hino, ‘Ngudita chinu chachi? Ngumutuma mwanangu yo ntsingumugana, na hanga yuno vakumuhulikitsa!’ <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Lechelelo vanu vala wovali vakodite mugunda hovavaga kumuwona hela, vakalonganaje vene kwa vene kuta, ‘Yuno yo muhali. Lelo tumukopole ili wuhali wake wukuva wetu.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Ihyo vakamuhumyaje kivala kwa mugunda gwa mitsabibu na vakamukopolaje.” Yesu akaputsaje, “Yula munya mugunda akuvadita chichi vanu vala wo vakodite mugunda? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Akutsa na kuvakopola vanu vala wo vakodite mugunda na kuvapela valimi vanji mugunda ugo gwa mitsabibu.” Vanu vala hovavaga kuhulika ndongwa itso vakalongaje, “Mulungu aleche kutuditila lulongwa ulo!”<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Lechelelo Yesu akavalolaje kwa kuvakangatsila miho na kuvalonjela, “Ndongwa tsino tsa Mulungu tsina mana yachi? Liganga lyo valilemile vatsentsi, lelo liveye liganga lya kihuvilwa kwa wutsentsi! <verse eid="LUK 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Munu yoyuve yo akugwa mu lilanga ilyo, akubeneka fipande fipande, na manyi limugwile munu yoyuve likumutijina.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbutso ya kuhomba Kodi kwa Kayisali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matayo 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Maliko 12:13-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa na vatawula nambiko vavina vakatselaje kuta Yesu avaselembetsaga vene kwa muhwano ugo, ihyo vaganaga kumubata hono baho, lechelelo vakawogopaje vanu. <verse eid="LUK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Hoihyo vamupelanitsaga kwa kuvatuma vapelanitsi wo vilajilaga kuta vawuya, vamupilimaga kwa ndongwa tso alongaga ili vamubate na kumusindika kwa vavina va silikali ya Chilumi. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Vapelanitsi iwo vakamulonjelaje Yesu kuta, “Mudahitsi tun'tsela kuta unvikula na kudahitsa ndongwa tsa wukweli, na tun'tsela kuta heve ulihela wubagulo, kaha heve un'dahitsa wukweli wa ng'asi ya Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Lelo utulonjele mbe, malajitso ga Musa ganlajitsa tuhombe kodi kwa muntsajila muvina va ku Loma?”<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Yesu akatselaje hila fyo vangumutega, akavalonjelaje, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />“Mundajile lindolosi ilyo. Mbe, sula yino na fyandisi fino fya nani?”<verse eid="LUK 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Vene vakamulonjelaje, “Fya Kayisali muntsajila muvina va ku Loma.” Ihyo Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Duve fya Kayisali mumpelaje Kayisali, na fya Mulungu mumpelaje Mulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Vakalemwaje kumubata kwasawuli ya vanu. Nawo vakatinukaje ndalahela kwa ndongwa tsila tso alongaga, hoihyo vakakatukaje.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbutso tsa wutsilipuko</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matayo 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maliko 12:18-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Kahi Masadukayo vamwinga wo valongaga kuta kuduhu wutsilipuko wa vanu wo vafweye, vakatsaje kwa Yesu na kumuputsa, <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />“Mudahitsi, Musa atwandichilye kuta manyi mung'olotse va munu mtunga atajiche na kumuleka mufwile alihela vana, yin'ganika mung'olotse yula amuhale mufwile uyo, ili amulelele vana mung'olotse yo atajiche. <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Lelo kwetu kwavaga na vanu saba yo vavaga lukolo. Yula va mulongola akakwelaje mudala, hambele munu uyo akatajikaje bila kuleka mwana. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Kahi yula mung'olotse va kavili akamutolaje yula mufwile, nayo kaha hambele akatajikaje <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />na mung'olotse va kadatu nayo akamutolaje hihilga kota vayage. Lukavaje hihilaga kwa vanu vala veka saba vakatajikaje bila kuleka vana na mufwile yula. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Hambele kuwudugo na mudala yula nayo akafwaje. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Ino lelo utulonjele, Mbe, siku ya wutsilipuko mudala uyo akuva muchina va nani, kwasawuli avaga atoliche kwa valume saba wovavaga lukolo?”<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yesu akavalonjelaje vala Masadukayo, “Ndongwa tsa kutola na kutoleka itso tsa muinyi yino ya sambi, <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />lechelelo vanu vala wo Mulungu akuwona van'ganika kutsilipulwa kuhuma kwa vanu wovafweye na kwikala ku inyi yo yinkutsa, iwo wo sivakutola awu kutoleka. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Iwo sivakufwa kaha, kwasawuli vakuva kota vatantsi va kilanga va Mulungu. Iwo wo vana va Mulungu, kwasawuli Mulungu avagavye kuva wumi. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Lechelelo kulonga kuta vanu vakutsilipuka, nambe Musa alontsile lulongwa ulo mumandiko matunga ga Mulungu, kuta mu chila chisati cho chakaga moto bila kusila, hala Mutwa hoilaje na kulonga kuta, ‘Mwene yo Mulungu va Ibulahimu, Mulungu va Yisaka, na Mulungu va Yakobo.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Mwene si Mulungu va wovafweye, ila mwene yo Mulungu va vanya wumi, kwasawuli veka yo vangikala kwa mwene vana wumi.” <verse eid="LUK 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Vadahitsi vatunga va madahitso ga Musa vakamulonjelaje, “Mudahitsi, ulontsile finofu.” <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Vakalontsile ihyo kwasawuli sivahogwe kuwila kumuputsa mbutso tsinji.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chilisito yo mwana va nani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matayo 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Maliko 12:35-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Kahi Yesu akavaputsaje, “Yinkuva ndawuli vanu vanlonga kuta Chilisito muhagulwa va Mulungu yo mwana va Dawudi?” <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Kwasawuli Dawudi mwene mu chitabu cha Tsabuli anlonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">“Mutwa amulonje Mutwa vangu kuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">Wikale lubali lwangu lwa wuvina na mamulaka,<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />mbaka ntsivaviche vatelani vako hovakuva chigoda cha kuvichila magulu gako.”<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Manyi Dawudi angumuchema mwene, “Mutwa, yiveye ndawuli Chilisito ave mwana va Dawudi?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiyangalila na vadihitsi va malajitso ga Musa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matayo 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Maliko 12:38-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Vanu veka hovavaga vangumuhulikitsa, Yesu akavalonjelaje vadahitswa vake, <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />“Mwiyangalile na vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa, wo vaganaga kujenda jenda kuno vafwite kantsu nali, na vaganaga kusamuswa na vanu kwa kufugamilwa iho ho vankuva hono ha kugutsila finu, na kwikala figoda fya kutalo mu Nyumba tsa kitang'anila Vayawudi na kikala mu figoda fya hesima mu liwungo. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Yo vavatsulumulaga vafwile kuno vangilajila kota vawuya, na kwa wubuganitsi vamusukaga Mulungu kwa suko nali. Vanu vanya ihyo vakuhigwa wuhigo wukomi ndala hela.”<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Sadaka ya mudala mufwile</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Maliko 12:41-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Yesu hoavaga mu Nyumba ya Mulungu akavawonaje vanu vafuchifu fyo vatawulaga sadaka gawo mu lisandiko lya kutuntsila sadaka. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Akamuwonaje mufwile yumwe mugayu antawula sendi tsivili. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Yesu akalongaje, “Ntsinguvalonjela nachene kuta, mufwile yuno mugayu atawe sadaka ngomi kulutila tso vatawe vanu veka. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Kwasawuli vanu vano veka vatawe sadaka tsawo kuhuma mu fila fyo filutye mu wufuchifu wawo, lechelelo mufwile yuno na avaje mugayu, atawe chila chinu cho ihuvilije.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anlonga hila Nyumba ya Mulungu fyo yikubomolwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Matayo 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Maliko 13:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Vadahitswa vake vamwinga vavaga vanlongana hila Nyumba ya Mulungu fyo yatsentsilwe kwa maganga manofu na ga galama ngomi, hamwe na sadaka tso vatawe vanu kwa Mulungu. Lechelelo Yesu akavalonjelaje kuta, <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />“Chikutsa chipindi fino fyeka fyo mungufiwona, kuduhu nambe liganga limwe lyo likusigala mwilanga mwa liganga linji, kwasawuli geka gakubomolwa.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndajilo tsa siku tsa wudugo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Matayo 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Maliko 13:3-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Vanu vakamuputsaje Yesu, “Mudahitsi, ndongwa itso tsikuhumila hanili? Ndajilo yachi yo yikulajila kuta ndongwa itso tsilihabehi kuhumila?” <verse eid="LUK 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Mwiyangalile, mulekaje kudeteletswa. Kwasawuli vanu wolofu vakutsa na kulonga kuta, ‘Vene yo heni!’ Manyi muwone ihyo mutsele kuta, ‘Muda gula guli habehi!’ Lechelelo henye mulekaje kuvafwata. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Hala homukuhulika ndongwa tsa ligalu na fitika mulekaje kuva na muloto, kwasawuli ndongwa itso tsin'ganika tsihumile tandi, lechelelo wula wudugo wukuva wung'ali.”<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Kaha Yesu akendelelaje kulonga, “Inyi yikwitova na inyi yinji na wuntsajila wukitova na wuntsajila wunji. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Kukuva na mikakamo mikomi ja inyi, na ntsala, na namwa tsa kutinusa tsa kiyambutsa. Kaha kukuva na finu finya mutinuso na ndajilo ngomi kuwulanga. <verse eid="LUK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Lechelelo hofikuva fing'acha kuhumila ifyo fyeka, vakuvibata henye kwasawuli yangu na kuvakoda na vakuvasindika mu nyumba tsa kwitang'anila na kuvawopa mu nyumba tsa wuwopwa, mukusindikwa kulutalo kwa vantsajila na vavina. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Lechelelo icho cho chikuva chipindi cha henye kuvavikulila litumbilo lyenyu. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Mulekaje kuhotsa hila fyo mukulonga halutalo ha wuhigo, <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />kwasawuli heni nguvapela nyala na ndongwa hila fyo mukulonga, na kuduhu munu yo afuluche avasume henye. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Henye mukupitukwa na valeli venyu, vang'olotsenyu na vanu va habehi na henye, na vamwe mukukopolwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Vanu veka vakuvavipila henye kwasawuli ya kufwata heni. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Lechelelo muhe gwenyu gukuva na wukuva na wukuluso wo wugaya wudugo. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Lechelelo yo akikangatsa mbaka kuwudugo, akukuluswa.”<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anlonga ndongwa tso tsikuhumila ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Matayo 24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Maliko 13:14-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />Iho ho mukuwona muji gwa Yelusalemu gupilimwe na vatova ligalu, mutselaje kuta chipindi cha kwananjika kwa muji ugo chifisile. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Iho vanu vala wovali ku Yudeya vabilimile kufidunda, veka wovali ku Yelusalemu vahume, na vala wovali kumigunda valekaje kuwuya ku mujini. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Kwasawuli siku itso tsikuva siku tsa kupilulilwa kwa tsibi tso tsadisilwe, ili tsikwile ndongwa tseka tso andiche Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Vakudutsa vadala wo vanya wubofu na wo vankosa vana, kwasawuli kukuva na ng'odeko ngomi na mbipo ya Mulungu yikuva kwa vanu va inyi ya Yudeya. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Vamwe vakukopolwa kwa waladi, na vamwe vakutegulwa na kusindikwa mu nyumba tsa vawopwa na kusindikwa kota vanu valemulwe mwigalu na vakusindikwa kuinyi tsinji, na muji gwa Yelusalemu gututavalwa na vanu wo si Vayawudi mbaka chipindi chawo fyo chikulutila.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwuya kwa Mwana va Munu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matayo 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Maliko 13:24-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />“Kukuva na ndajilo ku litsuva, na mwetsi na nyenyetsi. Inyi iyi na bahali yikuva na mavimbi makomi ya kutinusa, lulongwa ulo lukudita vanu va inyi tseka vave na ng'odeko na muloto. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Vanu vakugotsola kwa muloto mukomi ho vakutsiwona ndongwa tso tsikuhumila mu inyi, na kwasawuli ya kutigaswa kwa finu fya ku lulanga. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Chipindi icho ho vakumbona heni Mwana va Munu ntsinkutsa mu mafuluka, kwa ludali na wumelemo wukomi. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Hala ndongwa itso ho tsikwantsa kuhumila, mwikangatsaje na kwihuvila kuta wukuluso wenyu wuli habehi.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhwano gwa mubichi go gunchemwa mutini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matayo 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Maliko 13:28-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Kahi Yesu akavalonjelaje muhwano guno, “Mugulave mubichi go gunchemwa mutini na mibichi jinji jeka. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Ho mukuva kujiwona jantsitse kudedemuka mahamba, mun'tsela kuta chipindi cha mbelega chifisile. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Ho hihyo homukuva kuwona ndongwa itso tsinhumila, mutselaje kuta wuntsajila wa Mulungu wuli habehi. <verse eid="LUK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Ntsinguvalonjelani wukweli kuta, vanu va chilelo chochi kutsiwona ndongwa itso, sichikulutila mbaka ndongwa itso tseka tsihumile. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Kilanga na Inyi fikulutila, lechelelo nayivaje ndawuli Ndongwa tsangu sitsikulutila.”<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mun'ganika muvaje miho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />Yesu akendelelaje kuvalonjela, “Mwiyangalile numbula tsenyu tsilekaje kwibatika wuhatufu, na wugatsi, na mbwiniwo na katsi tsa wumi wuno, mbaka siku yila yivafiche kwa kuvatinusa kota hila mutego fyo gugwilitsaga. <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />Kwasawuli siku iyo yikutsa kwa vanu veka wo vangikala mu inyi yeka. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Muvaje miho siku tseka na kuno munsuka lwahihyo ili muve na wuvetso wa kuvakulusa na fila fyeka fyo fikuhumila, na kwima halutalo ha Mwana va Munu.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Siku tseka hamunyi Yesu adahitsaga mu Nyumba ya Mulungu, na chila hamihe abitaga ku chidunda cha Mitseyituni na kuva kuko chilo cheka. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Vanu veka vabitaga mu Nyumba ya Mulungu hamilawu kumuhulikitsa Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">Mupanjo gwa kukopolwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matayo 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maliko 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohana 11:45-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Siku ya liwungo lya mibumunda jojilihela hamila yoyachemwaga Pasaka, ho yavaga yilihabehi. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Vavina va vatawula nambiko hamwe na vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa vakavaje vansaka hila fyo vakumukopola Yesu, nawo vaditaga ihyo kwa fiho kwasawuli vawogopaga vanu.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda angidichila kumupituka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Matayo 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Maliko 14:10-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Duve lisoka likamwinjilaje Yuda yo achemwaga Isikaliyoti, yumwe va vala vatumi kumi na vavili. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Ihyo Yuda akabitaje kwa vavina va vatawula nambiko na vavina va vimilitsi va Nyumba ya Mulungu, akalonganaje nawo hila fyo akumupituka Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Nawo vatawula nambiko vakahechelelaje ndala hela vakalaganaje kumuhomba magobole. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yuda akidichilaje, na akantsaje kusaka muda gula go akumupituka Yesu, chipindi ho kukuva kuduhu vanu.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pasaka ya wudugo ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matayo 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Maliko 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohana 13:21-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Ho yavaga kufika siku ya Liwungo lya Mabumunda go galihela hamila, iyo yo yavaga siku ya kusintswa kwa ntsanang'olo ya Pasaka. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Ihyo Yesu akavatumaje Petulo na Yohana, “Mubite mukatuditile chilyo cha Pasaka ili tulye.” <verse eid="LUK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Nawo vakamuputsaje, “Un'gana tukayidite kwiya?” <verse eid="LUK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Muhulikitse! Ho mukuva mum'bita mujini, mukitang'ana na munu mulume yo itwisile chiya cha malenga. Mubitase mbaka mu nyumba yo akwinjila. <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />Nanye mumulonjele munya nyumba kuta, ‘Mudahitsi amputsa, chilikwiya chumba cha vajentsi cho akulila chilyo cha Pasaka hamwe na vadahitswa vangu?’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Nayo akuvalajila chumba chikomi chili kugolofwa mwanga chivisilwe chang'ani, na henye mudite chilyo cha pasaka mumo.”<verse eid="LUK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Ihyo vakabitaje, vakafikaje chila chinu chavaga hihilaga kota Yesu fyo avaga avalonje, vakaditaje chilyo cha Pasaka.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chilyo cha Mutwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matayo 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Maliko 14:22-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Ho chavaga kufika chipindi, Yesu akikalisaje kulya hamwe na vatumi vake. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Ntsiviniwe ndalahela kulya chilyo cha Pasaka hamwe na henye ho ntsing'acha kwinjila mu ng'odeko tsangu. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Ntsinguvalonjela kuta singulya kaha pasaka mbaka hala Mulungu ho akuva avagombwe vanu vake veka na kutavala.”<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Ihyo Yesu akategulaje chikombe cho chavaga na difwayi, akamulumbaje Mulungu na kulonga, “Mwanuchile chikombe chino na mung'we nyeka. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Kwasawuli ntsinguvalonjela, kuhuma sambi singung'wa kaha difwayi ya libawo lya mutsabibu, mbaka ho wukutsa Wuntsajila wa Mulungu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Kaha akatolaje libumunda, akalumbaje na kulonga, “Guno go muvili gwangu go guntawulwa kwasawuli yenyu. Muditaje hino kwa kuntsiwuka heni.” <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Ho avaga kulya akaditaje hihilaga, akategulaje chikombe, akalongaje, “Difwayi yino mu chikombe yo lilagano lipya lyo lin'ditwa kwa danda yangu yo yim'bohoka kwasawuli yenyu.<verse eid="LUK 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />“Lechelelo mulave! Yula munu yo akumituka alihamwe na hetwe bahanago ankulya hamwe na heni. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Heni Mwana va Munu ntsim'bita kukopolwa kota fyo aganile Mulungu, lechelelo akudutsa munu yula yo akungaluka.” <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Iho vatumi vakantsaje kwiputsa vene kwa vene kuta, nani yoali hagati hetu yo akudita lulongwa ulo.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusumwanila wuvina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Kukahumilaje wusumwano hagati ha vatumi viwutsaga kuta nani yo akuva muvina vawo. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Vantsajila na vanu va muinyi vavatavalaga vanu kwa ludali, nawo vaganaga vachemwe kuta vanguvatanga vanu. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Lechelelo kwa henye yivaje finji, yula yoan'gana ave muvina kwa henye, an'ganika ave mutantsi venyu. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Ihyo nani yo muvina? Mbe, yula yo ichite mumetsa kulya, awu yula yo ankola katsi ya wutantsi? Akuva yula yo angikala mumetsa kulya chilyo! Nambe ihyo, lechelelo heni ntsili hano hagati henyu ntsinakota mutantsi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Kaha Yesu akalongaje, “Henye yomuli hamwe na heni chipindi cheka cha njelo tsangu. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Ihyo kota hila Dada vangu fyo amelye Wuntsajila, na heni ntsinguvapela mamulaka ga kutavala, <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />ili muvetse kulya na kung'wa mu metsa ya Wuntsajila wa heni na kikala mu figoda fya wuvina kutsitavala tsila kabila kumi na tsivili tsa Vaisilaheli.”<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anlonga hila Petulo fyo akumukana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayo 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maliko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohana 13:36-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />“Yesu akamulonjelaje, Simoni! Simoni! Hulikitse! Lisoka lisusile kwa Mulungu livapete henye kota munu fyo ampeta wuhemba. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Lechelelo heni ngusuchye heve, ili litumbilo lyako lileche kutindajila. Nave ho ukuva umiluchilye uvakangatse vang'olotso.”<verse eid="LUK 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Petulo akamulonjelaje Yesu, “Mutwa, heni ntsili chang'ani kubitasa hamwe na heve ku nyumba ya vawopwa, nambe kufwa hamwe na heve.”<verse eid="LUK 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Ntsingukulonjela heve Petulo kuta, munyiguno hachilo ntsogolo ying'acha kuvika mwanga ukuva ung'anile mala kadatu kuta si untsele.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wiviche chang'ani kwa ligalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Kahi Yesu akavaputsaje vadahitswa vake, “Hala ho ntsaganile mubite bila mufuko gwa magobole awu libeji, awu filatu, Mbe, mwagatsile chinu chochive?” Nawo vakamulonjelaje, “Ndaya.” <verse eid="LUK 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Lechelelo sambi, yula yo anago magobole ategule, awu libeji ategule. Yoyuve yo alihela waladi, agutse likoti lyake abite akagule. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Kwasawuli yandikwe mu Mandiko ga Mulungu kuta, Avalilwe hamwe na vawumiyani, na heni ntinguvalonjelani chila cho chandikwe kwajili ya heni chin'ganika chihumile.” <verse eid="LUK 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Vadahitswa vake vakamulonjelaje, “Mutwa, hano hana waladi wuvili.” Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Duve tutsileche ndongwa itso!”<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ansuka mu chinyungu cha Jetisemane</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Matayo 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Maliko 14:32-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Ihyo Yesu akawukaje na kubita ku chidunda cha Mitseyituni kota fyo aditaga kuhuma hamutalo, nawo vadahitswa vake vakamufwataje. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Hovavaga kufika uko, akavalonjelaje, “Musukaje, muleche kwinjila mu majetso.” <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Mwene akibagulaje nawo kota wutali wa munu kutotsa liganga, akafugamaje na kwantsa kusuka. <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />Akalongaje, “Dada manyi ugane nyetsele chikombe chino cha ng'odeko. Sikota fyontsin'gana heni, lechelelo kota hila fyo un'gana heve.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Mutantsi va kilanga va Mulungu akahumilaje na kumukangatsa. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Yesu hoavaga mu wusungu wukomi, akasukaje ndalahela na lifuche lyake lyo lyagwaga hanyi lyahumyaga na danda.<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Hoavaga kusinda kusuka, akavapiluchilaje vadahitswa vake akavafikaje vavasise, kwasawuli vavaga vafuluje kwa wususutalo. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Mbona muvasise? Mulamuche musuche, muleche kwinjila mumajetso.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwibatika kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matayo 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maliko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yohana 18:3-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Yesu hoavaga ang'acha anlonga ihyo, likatsaje lilugu lya vanu kuno Yuda avalongwe yula yo avaga yumwe va vala vatumi kumi na vavili. Yuda akamuhejelelaje Yesu ili amunonele. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Lechelelo Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Yuda, Ino ungumupituka Mwana va Munu kwa kumunonela?”<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Vala vafwasi va Yesu vavaga kuwona chila cho chinhumila vakalongaje, “Mutwa, tufuluche tuvatemanje kwa nyaladi tsetu?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Yumwe va vala akamutemaje lipulichilo lyake la lubali lwa kwililo mutantsi va muvina va vatawula nambiko.<verse eid="LUK 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Lechelelo Yesu akalongaje, “Muleche!” Kahi akalidometsaje lipulichilo lya munu uyo, akamuponetsaje.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Kaha Yesu akavalonjelaje vala vavina va vatawula nambiko na vala wo vatsitse kumubata, na vavina va vimilitsi va Nyumba ya Mulungu, “Mutsitse na waladi na ndumbi kota hila heni mitwe silikali? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Siku tseka ntsavaga hamwe na henye mu lidama lya Nyumba ya Mulungu simwimbite. Lechelelo sambi cho chipindi chenu, chino cho chipindi cha wutavala wa jitsa,”<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo angumukana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Matayo 26:57-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Maliko 14:53-54</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yohana 18:12-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Ihyo vakamubataje Yesu, vakabitaje nayo mbaka ku nyumba ya muvina va vatawula nambiko. Lechelelo Petulo akavaga angumufwata kumbele kwa kutali. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Hovavaga vakotsitse moto hidama, nawo vavaga vichite kota moto, Petulo nayo akikalaje hamwe nawo. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Mutantsi yumwe muhintsa hoavaga kumuwona Petulo ichite ha moto, akamukangatsilaje miho, na kulonga, “Munu yuno aka hamwe na Yesu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Lechelelo Petulo akalongaje, “Bee mudala, sintsimutsele munu uyo!”<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Hambele munu yunji akamuwonaje Petulo na kulonga, “Heve nave uli yumwe vawo!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">Lechelelo Petulo akamulonjelaje, “Ndaya be munu heve, si heni!”<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Ho yavaga kulutila kota lisala limwe hino, munu yunji akalongaje kwa kuhahanitsa kuta, “Wukweli munu yuno aka hamwe na Yesu, kwasawuli na mwene nayo anhumila ku Galilaya.”<verse eid="LUK 22:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Lechelelo Petulo akamulonjelaje, “Be munu heve, sintsichitsele ndaya icho chounlonga!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:60">Luvala lulo lo alongaga Petulo ntsogolo yikavikaje. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Mutwa akapitukaje na kumulola Petulo, Petulo nayo akiwukaje ndongwa tsila tso alontsile Muntsajila kuta, “Munyi guno ying'acha siyilavikantsogolo, ukung'ana mala kadatu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Iho Petulo akahumaje kwivala na kuvemba kwa wusungu ndalahela.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vimilitsi vangumubedala Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Matayo 26:67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Maliko 14:65</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Vanu vala wovavaga vangumwimilila Yesu, vakantsaje kumubedala na kumutova. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Vakamuwopaje chitambala kumiho, vakavaje vangumuputsa, “Lagule nani yo akutofile?” <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Vakendelelaje kumulonjela ndongwa tsinji ntsolofu tsinya maligo.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu halutalo ha Libalatsa lya Vayawudi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matayo 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Maliko 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yohana 18:19-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Hamilawu ho kwavaga kwela, libalatsa lya vavina va vanu, na vavina va vatawula nambiko, na vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa, vakakong'anaje, vakamuletaje Yesu halutalo ha hono ha kuhijila. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Nawo vakamulonjelaje, “Utulonjele! Mbe heve yo Chilisito?” Lechelelo Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Nambe ntsivalonjele, simukunumba. <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />Nayivaje ntsivaputse lulongwa, simukumitula. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Lechelelo kuhuma sambi, heni Mwana va Munu nguva ntsichite lubali lwa hesima lwa Mulungu Munya Wuvetso weka,” <verse eid="LUK 22:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Iho veka vakalongaje, “Ihyo un'gana ulonje kuta heve uli Mwana va Mulungu?” Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Kota fyo mulontsile henye, hihyo fyo ntsili.” <verse eid="LUK 22:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Nawo vakalongaje, “Mbe, tukugana vanu vanji vatulonjele chinu chachi? Hetwe vene tuhuliche fyo anlonga.”<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ansindikwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matayo 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maliko 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yohana 18:28-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Kahi libalatsa lyeka likimaje na kumusindika Yesu mbaka halutalo ha Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Vakantsaje kumuhiga Yesu na kumulonjela Pilato kuta, “Tumuwene munu yuno anguvayatsa vanu vetu, na kuvalonjela valeche kuhomba kodi kwa Kayisali muntsajila va Loma na kwichema kuta mwene yo Chilisito, Muntsajila.” <verse eid="LUK 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Ihyo Pilato akamuputsaje Yesu, “Heve yo Muntsajila va Vayawudi?” Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Heve yo ulontsile.” <verse eid="LUK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Kaha Pilato akavalonjelaje vavina va vatawula nambiko na lilugu lya vanu kuta, “Nambe ntsiwuwone wubi wowuve kwa munu yuno.”<verse eid="LUK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Lechelelo vene vakahahanitsaje kulonga kuta, “Yuno anguvasongetsa vanu kwa madahitso gake ganguvadita vanu va ku Yudeya yeka vapisane na wutavala. Antsye ku Galilaya na sambi ali hano.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ansindikwa kwa Helode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Pilato ho avaga kuhulika ihyo, akaputsaje, “Mbe, munu yuno munyakaye va ku Galilaya?” <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Akatselaje kuta Yesu avaga ahumye kuwuntsajila wa Helode, chipindi icho Helode nayo kaha avaga ku Yelusalemu, ihyo Pilato akamusindikaje Yesu kwa Helode. <verse eid="LUK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Helode hoavaga kumuwona Yesu akasangalalaje ndalahela, kwasawuli kuhuma hamutalo aganaga kumuwona Yesu. Helode aganaga kujiwona miwujitsa myolofu. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Helode akamuputsaje Yesu mbutso ntsolofu, lechelelo Yesu sialontsile chochive. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Vavina va vatawula nambiko na vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa vavaga vimile hono iho, vakalalilaga kumuhiga kwa Helode. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Ihyo Helode hamwe na vimilitsi vake, vakamubedalaje Yesu na kumuvipitsa. Vakamufwikaje mwenda gwa chintsajila, vakampilulaje kwa Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Siku iyo Helode na Pilato vakiyendaje kwasawuli ya lulongwa ulo, lechelelo iho hamutalo vatelanaga.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anhigwa kukopolwa.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matayo 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Maliko 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yohana 18:39-19:16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Pilato akavachemaje vavina va vatawula nambiko, na vavina va vanu, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />akavalonjelaje, “Henye mumuhitsile munu yuno kwa heni kuta anguvapisanitsa vanu na wutavala! Mbije kuluhima lulongwa ulo, sintsiwuwene wubi wowuve wowufuluche wumwambutse ahigwe. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Nambe Helode nayo siakauwene wubi wowuve, na ihyo amupilwe kwa hetwe. Munu yuno sialadita lulongwa lubi loluve lwa kuhigwa akopolwe. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Ihyo ngulajitsa atowe fiboko na hambele ngumulechela. <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />Kwasawuli yavaga ntsovelo ha chipindi cha liwungo lya pasaka Pilato kumudindulila muwopwa yumwe.”<verse eid="LUK 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Lechelelo vanu veka vakayovaje ho hamwe kulonga, “Umukopole munu yuno, utudindulile Balaba!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Uyo Balaba avaga awopitwe mu nyumba ya vawopwa kwasawuli ya kwambutsa vanu vadite wupitufu mu muji kwa vatavala, na kwambutsa vanu vafwe. <verse eid="LUK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Pilato aganaga kumulechela Yesu, ihyo akalongaje nawo kaha. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Lechelelo vene vakalongaje kwa chiyove, “Muvambe mu musalaba, mumuvambe mu musalaba!” <verse eid="LUK 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Pilato akavaputsaje lwa kadatu, “Mbe, munu yuno adisile wubi wachi? Sintsiwuwene wubi wowuve kwake wo wufuluche wumwambutse akopolwe! Ho ihyo ngulajitsa asubulwe fiboko, na hambele kumulechela.” <verse eid="LUK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Lechelelo vene vakalutitsaje kuyova fikami kuta Yesu avambwe mumusalaba. Hambele chiyove chawo chikamusumaje. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Ihyo Pilato akalamulaje vaditilwe chovan'gana. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Akamudindulilaje munu yula yoavaga awopitwe kwasawuli ya wupitufu mu muji na kukopola vanu, na akamutawulaje Yesu, vamudite kota fyovan'gana.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anvambwa mumusalaba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matayo 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maliko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohana 19:17-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Hovavaga vam'bita nayo Yesu, vakitang'anaje na munu yumwe litawa lyake Simoni va ku Kilene, yo ahumaga kivala kwa muji ankutsa ku mujini. Vakamubataje, na kumutwika musalaba gula agutegule kumbele kwa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Vanu malugu na malugu vamufwataga Yesu, ha vanu iwo kwavaga na vadala wo vamuvembelaga na kumung'ung'utila. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yesu akavapituchilaje na akavalonjelaje, “Henye vahintsa va ku Yelusalemu! Muleche kumbembela heni, lechelelo mwivembele henye na vana venyu. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Kwasawuli muda gunkutsa ho vakulonga kuta, ‘Vatambichilwe vala vadala wovali mende maleme gawo gang'ali kulela na mavele gawo go gang'ali kosa!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Luvala ulo vanu vakwantsa kufilonjela fidunda kuta, Mutugwile! Na tudunda, Mutugubiche! <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Manyi vanditye hino heni yo ntsilihela wubi wowuve, vakumuditila ndawuli munu munya wubi?” <verse eid="LUK 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Vakavategulaje vanu vanji vavili vawumiyani, na kuvasindika vakopolwe hamwe na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Vavaga kufika hono ho hachemwaga, “Lipala lya Mutwi,” Iho ho vamuvambite Yesu mu musalaba hamwe na vawumiyani, yumwe lubali lwa kililo na yunji lubali lwa lichiji. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Yesu akalongaje, “Dada, uvahulumile kwasawuli sivan'tsela chovan'dita.” Vakagavanaje myenda jake kwa kujitovela simbi. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Vanu vavaga vimile hala vangumulola, nawo vavina va Vayawudi vakamubedalaje kwa kulonga kuta, “Avakuluse vanji, lelo ikuluse mwene, manyi mwene yo Chilisito, muhagulwa va Mulungu!” <verse eid="LUK 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Kahi vimilitsi nawo vakatsaje vakamubedalaje na vakampelaje difwayi yo yihahile ili ang'we, <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />nawo vakalongaje, “Manyi heve yo Muntsajila va Vayawudi wikuluse u mwene.” <verse eid="LUK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Hilanga ha musalaba gula havaga na chibawo cho chandikwe hino, “YUNO YO MUNTSAJILA VA VAYAWUDI.” <verse eid="LUK 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Yumwe va vawumiyani vala wo vavambitwe hamwe hala ho avambitwe halubali ha Yesu, akamuligaje, “Heve si yo Chilisito muhagulwa va Mulungu? Wikuluse u mwene, utukuluse na hetwe.” <verse eid="LUK 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Lechelelo yula muwumiyani yunji akamung'anulilaje muyage kwa kumulonjela, “Mbe, heve ulihela muloto kwa Mulungu? Ungumuliga na kuno heve nave uvambitwe kota mwene. <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Heve na heni tuhijitwe kwa wubi wo tudisile, kwasawuli tumpata chochin'ganika kwa chila chotudisile. Lechelelo munu yuno siadisile chinu chibi chochive.” <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Kaha muwumiyani yula akamulonjelaje Yesu kuta, “Yesu! Untsiwukaje hala ho ukuva winje mu Wuntsajila wako.”<verse eid="LUK 23:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Ntsingukulonjela wukweli kuta, munyi guno ukuva hamwe na heni kilanga kwa Mulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ankufwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matayo 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maliko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohana 19:28-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Yavaga kota saa sita hamunyi, jitsa likagubikaje inyi yeka mbaka saa tisa mumihe, <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />kwasawuli litsuva lyalesile kuvala, na lipantsiya lya Nyumba ya Mulungu likademukaje hagati kuhuma kuchanya mbaka hasi. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Yesu akavembaje fikami, “Dada! Muhe gwangu ntsinguvika mu mawoko gako.” Hoavaga kulonga ihyo, akatajikaje. <verse eid="LUK 23:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Yula muvina va vimilitsi hoavaga kufiwona fyo fihumye, akamutsumitsaje Mulungu na kulonga, “Wukweli munu yuno aditaga kota fyo an'gana Mulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 23:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Vala vanu veka wovavaga vakong'ine iho kwasawuli ya lulongwa ulo, vavaga kuwona fila fyofihumye, vakawuyaje kukaye tsawo kuno vangikuna mambaga tsawo kwa wususutalo. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Lechelelo vala veka wovavaga vamutsele Yesu, hamwe na vadala vala wo vamufwataga kuhuma ku Galilaya, vavaga vimile kutali vanlola fila fyo finhumila.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutsikwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matayo 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maliko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohana 19:38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Kwavaga na munu yumwe yo achemwaga Yusufu, yo avaga jumbe va libalatsa likomi lya Vayawudi, na aditaga kota fyo an'gana Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />Lechelelo mwene siavaga idiche hila fyo vadisile vavina vayage mu lila libalatsa. Munu uyo avaga ahumye ku muji gwa Alimataya, na antsindilaga kutsa kwa Wuntsajila wa Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Nayo Yusufu akabitaje kwa Pilato, akasukaje apelwe muvili gwa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Akisaje muvili ugo mu musalaba, akagupilingaje sanda ntselu ya chitambala cha galama, akaguvikaje mu kabuli woyavaga vahongwe mu liganga, kabuli iyo yavaga ntsipya. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Siku iyo yavaga ya kwivika chang'ani kwa Siku ya Kwesela yavaga habehi kwantsa. <verse eid="LUK 23:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Vala vadala wo vamufwatite Yesu kuhuma ku Galilaya, vakamufwataje Yusufu na vakaliwonaje likabuli na muvili gwake Yesu hila fyo gulambalikwe. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Vakawuyaje kukaye, vakavikaje chang'ani mafuta ga kununyilila na mafuta ga kugubaka muvili gwa Yesu. Siku ya Weselo vakeselaje kota fyo yavaga matsovela.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Kutsilipuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Matayo 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Maliko 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohana 20:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Siku ya kwantsa ya wichi kung'acha hamilawu, vala vadala vakatolaje gala mafuta go ganunyililaga go vavisile chang'ani, vakabitaje ku kabuli. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Vakalifikaje liganga lila libiduswe kutali na kabuli. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Lechelelo hovavaga kwinjila mugati, sivakaguwonaje muvili gwa Mutwa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Hovavaga vang'acha vapomwiche kwasawuli ya lulongwa ulo, luvala lulo vakimaje habehi nawo valume vavili, wo vavaga vafwite myenda jojavaga jimmelema ndalahela kota lwenje lwa liladu. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Vadala iwo vakawonaje muloto, vakahonamaje mbaka hasi. Lechelelo vanu vala vakavalonjelaje, “Mbe, ndawuli mungumusaka munu yo mumi hagati ha wo vafweye? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Alihaduhu hano, atsilipuche. Mwiwukaje kota fyo avalonje hoavaga kula ku Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />Hala ho avalonje kuta, ‘Heni Mwana va munu ntsin'ganika ntsibatiche na vanu vanya ndongwa ntsibi, vambambe mu musalaba na siku ya kadatu ngutsilipuka.’” <verse eid="LUK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Ihyo ho vadala iwo vakiwukaje ndongwa tsila tso avalonje Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Ho vavaga kuwuya kuhuma ku kabuli, vakavalonjelaje vadahitswa vala kumi na yumwe na vanu vanji ndongwa itso tseka tso tsihumye. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Vanu wo valontsile ndongwa itso kwa vatumi va Yesu, vavaga Maliyamu va ku Majidala, na Yoani, na Maliyamu yuve va Yakobo, hamwe na vadala vanji wo vajendasaga hamwe. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Lechelelo vatumi vala vakalekaje kutsitumba ndongwa tsila tso vahuliche kuhuma kwa vadala vala, kwasawuli vatsiwonaga kota tsa wupufi. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Lechelelo Petulo akawukaje, akabitaje luvilo mbaka ku likabuli, Akahonamaje kuhunjilila mugati, akatsiwonaje sanda tsifulunjiche, siakachiwene chinu chinji. Akawuyaje kuno anhotsa chichi chochihumye.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvahumila vanu vavili mu ng'asi ya Emawu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Maliko 16:12-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Munyi gugo vadahitswa vavili va Yesu vavaga mung'asi vam'bita ku chijiji cho chinchemwa Emawu, lujendo lwake lwali lwa chilometa kumi na yimwe kuhuma ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Vavaga vanlongana ndongwa tsila tseka tso tsihumye. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Hovavaga vang'acha vanlongana ndongwa itso, Yesu mwene akahumilaje na kihatsa hamwe nawo mu lujendo. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Vakamuwonaje, lechelelo sivamutselaga. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Yesu akavaputsaje, “Munlongana chichi kuno mun'jenda?” Nawo vakimaje vakwisimbe kumiho kuno vasusute. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Yumwe vawo yo achemwaga Chileopa, akamulonjelaje, “Mbe, heve uliyeka yo ulimujentsi kuno Yelusalemu yo sufitsele fila fyo fihumye kuko?” <verse eid="LUK 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Nayo akavaputsaje, “Finu fyachi?” Vakamulonjelaje, “Finu fyofimupatite Yesu va ku Natsaleti. Yoavaga muloli va Mulungu munya wuvetso wukomi mu ndongwa tsake na ng'olwa tsake halutalo ha Mulungu na ha vanu veka. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Vavina va vatawula nambiko na vavina vetu vamutawe ahigwe kufwa, nawo vakamuvambaje mu musalaba. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Lechelelo hetwe twihuvilaga kuta mwene yo akuvakulusa Vaisilaheli. Lechelelo sambi siku ya kadatu kuhuma ndongwa itso tseka tsihumile. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Kahi vadala vatunga va kwetu vatupomwise. Vakali vahele ku likabuli munyi guno kung'acha hamilawu. <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />Lechelelo sivaguwene muvili gwake. Vakawuyaje na kutulonjela kuta vatantsi vavili va Mulungu va kilanga vavahumye vavalonje kuta Yesu ang'acha mumi. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Vamwinga vetu vakavahele ku likabuli vakalole chila chovalontsile vadala iwo, lechelelo mwene Yesu sivamuwene.” <verse eid="LUK 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Kahi Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Henye muli vanu vapufi chinya ndawuli, na numbula tsenyu nambe tsitumbile ndongwa tsila tseka tso tsalontsilwe na valoli va Mulungu? <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Valoli va Mulungu vandiche kuta, Chilisito yo ahagulwe na Mulungu siaganikije akodeche isho na hambele injile mu wumelemo wa Wuntsajila wake?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Yesu akatsaje kuvadadambulilaje ndongwa tseka fyo tsinlonga mu mandiko kwasawuli ya mwene, kwantsila mu malajitso ga Musa mbaka kwa vavoli veka. <verse eid="LUK 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Vavaga kuva habehi na chijiji chila chovabitaga, Yesu akiganitsaje kota an'gana kwendelela na lujendo, <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />lechelelo vene vakamugongoletsaje ikale nawo, vakalongaje, “Wikale hamwe na hetwe, kwasawuli sambi kuveye mihe na chilo chinkwinjila.” Duve, akinjilaje mugati akikalaje nawo. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Hoavaga kwikala na kulya hamwe nawo, akategulaje libumunda, akalumbaje, akalimegaje na kuvapela. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Luvala lulo miho gawo gakagubulwaje, vakamutselaje, lechelelo mwene akayagaje hagati hawo. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Vakiputsaje vene kwa vene, “Mbe, numbula tsetu sitsitinuchije kwa wusangalo, hala hoavije angutudahitsa mandiko ga Mulungu kula kung'asi?” <verse eid="LUK 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Luvala lulo vakawukaje na kuwuya ku Yelusalemu. Kuko vakavafikaje vatumi vala kumi na yumwe hamwe na vala wovavaga hamwe nawo vakong'ine, <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />valongaga, “Mutwa atsilipuche nachene! Amuhumye Simoni!”<verse eid="LUK 24:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Ihyo vala vadahitswa vavili vakavalonjelaje chila cho chivahumye mung'asi, na hila fyo vamutselye hala hoamegije libumunda.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvahumila vadahitswa vake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matayo 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maliko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohana 20:19-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Hovavaga vang'acha vanguvalonjela ihyo, Yesu mwene akimaje hagati hawo, akavalonjelaje, “Wusichimafu wuve na henye.” <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Vakatinukaje na kuva na muloto, vahotsaga kuta valiwene lilayika. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Lechelelo mwene akavaputsaje, “Kwasawuli ya chichi munkuva na muloto? Mbona munkuva na muhwehwe mu numbula? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Mulave mawoko na magulu gangu, yo heni, na muntsambalagate mulole, kwasawuli lilayika lilihela muvili na fitseje kota heni fyontsili.” <verse eid="LUK 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Hoavaga kulonga ihyo, akavalajilaje mawoko na magulu gake. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Vadahitswa vake vakalemwaje kitumba kuta yo mwene, kwasawuli ya kupomoka na wusangalo wo vavaga nawo. Hovavaga vang'acha vapomwiche, Yesu akavaputsaje, “Muna chinu chochive cha kulya?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Vakamupelaje chipande cha somba cho chibanikwe. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Akachitolaje na akalyaje kuno veka vangumulola.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Kaha akavalonjelaje, “Ifino fyo ntsavalonje hamutalo hontsavaga ntsing'acha hamwe na henye, chila chochandikwe kwasawuli ya heni mu malajitso ga Musa, na fyo vandiche valoli va Mulungu na mu chitabu cha Tsabuli mbaka fihumile.”<verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Iho ho akavagubulaje nyala tsawo vagatsele mandiko ga Mulungu, <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />akavalonjelaje, “Ihi fyo yandikwe mu mandiko ga Mulungu kuta, Chilisito akukodwa mbaka kufwa na siku ya kadatu akutsilipuka. <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />Na kwa Litawa lya Yesu wujumbe wa wuleketso wa ndongwa ntsibi, wukuvikulwa kwa vanu va inyi tseka, kwantsila Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Henye yo muli vasayidi va ndongwa tsino. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Na heni nguvatumila yula yo ali avalonje Dada vangu kuta akuvapela. Lechelelo henye mwikale mu muji gugu, mbaka hala homukupelwa Muhe va Mulungu kuhuma kilanga.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anchipulwa mbaka kilanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:19">Maliko 16:19</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 16:20">20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Kahi Yesu akavalongotsaje vadahitswa vake mbaka kivala kwa muji gwa Besaniya, akinulaje mawoko gake kilanga, akavatambichilaje. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Ho avaga anguvatambichila vadahitswa vake, Yesu akachipulwaje kubita kilanga kwa Mulungu na kuvaleka. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Kahi vakamufugamilaje na kuwuka kupiluka Yelusalemu kuno vavaga na wusangalo wukomi. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Chipindi cheka vakikalaje mu Nyumba ya Mulungu na kuno vangumutsumitsa Mulungu.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>